    # mc "It's possible the reason is that we're idiots. I won't deny that."
    mc "Il est possible que la raison soit qu'on est des idiots. Je ne vais pas le nier."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1744
translate french c30s004_Eva_0a966d31:

    # eva "*Sad laugh* Do you have to try and make me laugh even today?"
    eva "*Rire triste* Faut-il que tu essaies de me faire rire même aujourd'hui ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1745
translate french c30s004_Eva_a85e8477:

    # mc "Especially today."
    mc "Surtout aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1746
translate french c30s004_Eva_e4734882:

    # mc "I don't like seeing you sad, and even less crying."
    mc "Je n'aime pas te voir triste, et encore moins pleurer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1748
translate french c30s004_Eva_b9421df7:

    # mc "I understand that letting ourselves get carried away by emotions and crying for a while is sometimes soothing."
    mc "Je comprends que se laisser emporter par ses émotions et pleurer un moment soit parfois apaisant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1749
translate french c30s004_Eva_508ea622:

    # mc "And I also understand that, when we're like this, the last thing we want is a clown trying to make us laugh."
    mc "Et je comprends aussi que, quand on est comme ça, la dernière chose qu'on veut, c'est un clown qui essaie de nous faire rire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1750
translate french c30s004_Eva_ef0cb7c2:

    # mc "But if the sadness is replaced by anger towards the clown, it's a step in the right direction."
    mc "Mais si la tristesse est remplacée par de la colère envers le clown, c'est un pas dans la bonne direction."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1752
translate french c30s004_Eva_cd38fb39:

    # eva "You don't want to be the focus of my anger..."
    eva "Tu n'as pas envie d'être la cible de ma colère..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1753
translate french c30s004_Eva_f3e2d6aa:

    # mc "No, I don't. I'm very fond of my intact bones."
    mc "Non, en effet. Je tiens beaucoup à mes os intacts."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1754
translate french c30s004_Eva_04407c15:

    # mc "But if anger pulls you out of sadness, I'm willing to let you break one."
    mc "Mais si la colère te sort de la tristesse, je suis prêt à te laisser m'en briser un."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1755
translate french c30s004_Eva_dc0963be:

    # mc "A tiny one, one that doesn't hurt too much, if possible."
    mc "Un tout petit, un qui ne fait pas trop mal, si possible."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1757
translate french c30s004_Eva_b3231c9d:

    # eva "*Sad laugh* You certainly are a clown."
    eva "*Rire triste* Tu es vraiment un clown."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1758
translate french c30s004_Eva_5ab3c5c0:

    # eva "But I don't know of any bone that doesn't hurt when broken. I'm trained to inflict pain."
    eva "Mais je ne connais aucun os qui ne fait pas mal quand on le casse. Je suis entraînée à infliger de la douleur."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1760
translate french c30s004_Eva_c977471a:

    # eva "There's no point in breaking a bone if it doesn't hurt, right?"
    eva "Ça ne sert à rien de casser un os si ça ne fait pas mal, pas vrai ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1761
translate french c30s004_Eva_613cc66e:

    # mc "It could be good for something. Especially when there's a well-meaning clown around."
    mc "Ça pourrait servir à quelque chose. Surtout quand il y a un clown bien intentionné dans les parages."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1763
translate french c30s004_Eva_4602417c:

    # eva "I think I should go change for dinner."
    eva "Je crois que je devrais aller me changer pour le dîner."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1764
translate french c30s004_Eva_411579bd:

    # mc "Sounds good. Where are your clothes? Do you want me to come with you?"
    mc "Ça marche. Où sont tes vêtements ? Tu veux que je vienne avec toi ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1766
translate french c30s004_Eva_1f0c0104:

    # eva "Aren't you going to try to pry what's wrong out of me?"
    eva "Tu ne vas pas essayer de me tirer les vers du nez pour savoir ce qui ne va pas ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1767
translate french c30s004_Eva_3cff4d8e:

    # mc "No. If you want to tell me someday, you will."
    mc "Non. Si tu veux me le dire un jour, tu le feras."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1769
translate french c30s004_Eva_d0d61e9f:

    # mc "I love you, but I have no right to interrogate you if you don't want to talk to me."
    mc "Je t'aime, mais je n'ai pas le droit de t'interroger si tu ne veux pas me parler."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1771
translate french c30s004_Eva_6379e635:

    # mc "I love you, you've become a new sister to me, but I have no right to interrogate you if you don't want to talk to me."
    mc "Je t'aime, tu es devenue une nouvelle sœur pour moi, mais je n'ai pas le droit de t'interroger si tu ne veux pas me parler."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1773
translate french c30s004_Eva_2c88a7c1:

    # "Sadness reappears in her eyes, even though it never completely left."
    "La tristesse réapparaît dans ses yeux, même si elle ne les a jamais complètement quittés."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1774
translate french c30s004_Eva_dbda846e:

    # eva "Can you hug me?"
    eva "Tu peux me prendre dans tes bras ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1775
translate french c30s004_Eva_a2807aec:

    # mc "Of course. You know I'm really good at that."
    mc "Bien sûr. Tu sais que je suis vraiment doué pour ça."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1777
translate french c30s004_Eva_98f2b8dc:

    # eva "Even better than at goofing around."
    eva "Encore plus doué que pour faire le con."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1778
translate french c30s004_Eva_3cc9ab83:

    # mc "And I'm fucking great at that."
    mc "Et je suis putain de doué pour ça."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1781
translate french c30s004_Eva_4e0afb04:

    # "You hold each other in silence for a long time, until you pull apart when the sun finally sets."
    "Vous vous enlacez en silence pendant un long moment, jusqu'à ce que vous vous sépariez quand le soleil se couche enfin."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1782
translate french c30s004_Eva_d4a9578d:

    # eva "They're going to miss us at dinner..."
    eva "On va leur manquer au dîner..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1783
translate french c30s004_Eva_2cebebc1:

    # mc "Do you want to go change?"
    mc "Tu veux aller te changer ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1785
translate french c30s004_Eva_39cbe7ab:

    # eva "No."
    eva "Non."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1786
translate french c30s004_Eva_c91446bb:

    # eva "When you said you loved me..."
    eva "Quand tu as dit que tu m'aimais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1787
translate french c30s004_Eva_1eea4b43:

    # mc "I love you. I can't help it. I don't want to help it."
    mc "Je t'aime. Je n'y peux rien. Je ne veux pas lutter contre ça."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1789
translate french c30s004_Eva_cd888979:

    # eva "[deb.nick] and [lis] told me almost the same thing..."
    eva "[deb.nick] et [lis] m'ont dit presque la même chose..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1790
translate french c30s004_Eva_3175a1cf:

    # mc "Is that why you got like this? I like it when people tell me they love me."
    mc "C'est pour ça que tu t'es mise dans cet état ? J'aime bien quand les gens me disent qu'ils m'aiment."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1791
translate french c30s004_Eva_fa98651a:

    # mc "Do you want to explain it to me?"
    mc "Tu veux m'expliquer ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1793
translate french c30s004_Eva_52dbf186:

    # eva "You're going to think I'm an idiot..."
    eva "Tu vas penser que je suis une idiote..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1794
translate french c30s004_Eva_323072aa:

    # mc "I don't think so."
    mc "Je ne pense pas."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1795
translate french c30s004_Eva_ac075516:

    # mc "I've seen you cry a few times, and it's always been tears of joy."
    mc "Je t'ai vue pleurer quelques fois, et ça a toujours été des larmes de joie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1796
translate french c30s004_Eva_c94b00d8:

    # mc "The only time I saw you truly sad was when that thing with Gavin happened... And today it seems way worse than that day."
    mc "La seule fois où je t'ai vue vraiment triste, c'est quand il y a eu cette histoire avec Gavin... Et aujourd'hui, ça a l'air bien pire que ce jour-là."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1798
translate french c30s004_Eva_585be301:

    # eva "It's just that I think I hurt them... [lis] and [deb.nick]."
    eva "C'est juste que je crois que je les ai blessées... [lis] et [deb.nick]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1799
translate french c30s004_Eva_f29eb02a:

    # mc "I saw them on my way here, and they didn't mention anything to me."
    mc "Je les ai vues en venant ici, et elles ne m'ont rien dit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1800
translate french c30s004_Eva_883a4dd3:

    # mc "If you want, I'm still here for you to talk about it."
    mc "Si tu veux, je suis toujours là si tu as besoin d'en parler."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1802
translate french c30s004_Eva_62613c0d:

    # eva "The three of us were by the pool, sitting on the lounge chairs..."
    eva "On était toutes les trois au bord de la piscine, assises sur les chaises longues..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1803
translate french c30s004_Eva_7fb332f8:

    # eva "I thanked [deb.nick] for what she said about me and [ama] a couple of days ago."
    eva "J'ai remercié [deb.nick] pour ce qu'elle a dit sur moi et [ama] il y a quelques jours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1805
translate french c30s004_Eva_f812d691:

    # deb "There's no need to thank me. I meant it from the bottom of my heart. We both love you."
    deb "Il n'y a pas besoin de me remercier. Je le pensais du fond du cœur. Nous t'aimons toutes les deux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1807
translate french c30s004_Eva_25bd460b:

    # lis "I know it sounds weird, but on Saturday, when [deb.nick] told me what had happened, we talked."
    lis "Je sais que ça a l'air bizarre, mais samedi, quand [deb.nick] m'a raconté ce qui s'était passé, on a discuté."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1808
translate french c30s004_Eva_4f0e826b:

    # lis "I don't know how to explain it, but with this whole family feeling that's been building..."
    lis "Je ne sais pas comment l'expliquer, mais avec tout ce sentiment de famille qui s'est construit..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1810
translate french c30s004_Eva_b2198fd8:

    # deb "I refuse to call you cousin or anything like that. A cousin sounds like someone distant."
    deb "Je refuse de t'appeler cousine ou quoi que ce soit du genre. Une cousine, ça fait penser à quelqu'un de distant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1812
translate french c30s004_Eva_76792c1d:

    # lis "What [deb.nick] means is that we both love you... we love you and [ama]... as if you were our new sisters."
    lis "Ce que [deb.nick] veut dire, c'est que nous t'aimons toutes les deux... on vous aime, toi et [ama]... comme si vous étiez nos nouvelles sœurs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1814
translate french c30s004_Eva_cc6a0437:

    # deb "We know it's weird, that we've known you for less than a month..."
    deb "On sait que c'est bizarre, qu'on te connaît depuis moins d'un mois..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1816
translate french c30s004_Eva_caf335ec:

    # lis "But if the party I was at on Friday taught me anything, it's that, when I think of a girl I trust blindly, it's you two."
    lis "Mais si la fête où j'étais vendredi m'a appris quelque chose, c'est que, quand je pense à une fille en qui j'ai une confiance aveugle, c'est vous deux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1818
translate french c30s004_Eva_757024e5:

    # eva "And that's when I completely broke down..."
    eva "Et c'est là que j'ai complètement craqué..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1821
translate french c30s004_Eva_1b659726:

    # eva "I just stood there with my mouth open, like an idiot, looking back and forth between them."
    eva "Je suis restée là, la bouche ouverte, comme une idiote, à les regarder l'une après l'autre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1822
translate french c30s004_Eva_488c7252:

    # eva "I didn't know what to say."
    eva "Je ne savais pas quoi dire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1824
translate french c30s004_Eva_2d7609e8:

    # eva "And I ran off, unable to say a word, all the way to this corner."
    eva "Et je me suis enfuie, incapable de dire un mot, jusqu'à ce coin."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1826
translate french c30s004_Eva_a63d5b17:

    # eva "You can say it now. I'm an idiot. I promise I won't break any of your bones if you say it."
    eva "Tu peux le dire maintenant. Je suis une idiote. Je promets de ne te briser aucun os si tu le dis."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1827
translate french c30s004_Eva_4e33eff4:

    # mc "You're not an idiot, [eva]. You're not used to people telling you how much they love you."
    mc "Tu n'es pas une idiote, [eva]. Tu n'as pas l'habitude que les gens te disent à quel point ils t'aiment."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1828
translate french c30s004_Eva_855d18df:

    # mc "You didn't know how to react."
    mc "Tu ne savais pas comment réagir."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1830
translate french c30s004_Eva_895b4116:

    # eva "It's not because they told me they love me. It's because they told me they love me like a sister."
    eva "Ce n'est pas parce qu'elles m'ont dit qu'elles m'aimaient. C'est parce qu'elles m'ont dit qu'elles m'aimaient comme une sœur."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1831
translate french c30s004_Eva_7f403519:

    # eva "They were both there. They love each other a lot. And they were including me..."
    eva "Elles étaient toutes les deux là. Elles s'aiment beaucoup. Et elles m'incluaient..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1832
translate french c30s004_Eva_4cd46698:

    # eva "They were including [ama] and me. As their sisters."
    eva "Elles nous incluaient, [ama] et moi. Comme leurs sœurs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1833
translate french c30s004_Eva_4520f6ce:

    # mc "Now I understand what happened to you. And I stand by what I said. You're not an idiot."
    mc "Maintenant je comprends ce qui t'est arrivé. Et je maintiens ce que j'ai dit. Tu n'es pas une idiote."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1835
translate french c30s004_Eva_bf2bed23:

    # eva "Do you really understand?"
    eva "Tu comprends vraiment ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1836
translate french c30s004_Eva_e3254ff8:

    # mc "Of course I do. You had already accepted two sisters you share genes with. They also told you they consider you their sister."
    mc "Bien sûr que oui. Tu avais déjà accepté deux sœurs avec qui tu partages des gènes. Elles t'ont aussi dit qu'elles te considèrent comme leur sœur."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1838
translate french c30s004_Eva_d2053b24:

    # eva "Yeah... but that's natural. As you said, we're almost triplets."
    eva "Ouais... mais c'est naturel. Comme tu l'as dit, on est presque des triplées."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1839
translate french c30s004_Eva_19022a24:

    # mc "That's the most important thing. [lis] and [deb.nick] have named you their sister by choice."
    mc "C'est le plus important. [lis] et [deb.nick] t'ont désignée comme leur sœur par choix."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1841
translate french c30s004_Eva_61e7a1ba:

    # eva "And I couldn't say the same to them."
    eva "Et je ne pourrais pas leur dire la même chose."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1842
translate french c30s004_Eva_d56b9c53:

    # mc "I understand."
    mc "Je comprends."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1844
translate french c30s004_Eva_a85c1677:

    # eva "[dap] and [eri] aren't my sisters by choice. We have the same genes. We're sisters whether we like it or not, at least to some extent."
    eva "[dap] et [eri] ne sont pas mes sœurs par choix. Nous avons les mêmes gènes. Nous sommes sœurs qu'on le veuille ou non, du moins dans une certaine mesure."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1846
translate french c30s004_Eva_a1c4c5db:

    # eva "I also shared genes with Diana and Fiona, and they were also my sisters."
    eva "Je partageais aussi des gènes avec Diana et Fiona, et elles étaient aussi mes sœurs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1847
translate french c30s004_Eva_b2922e48:

    # eva "[ama], Beatrice, and Clarice were my sisters by choice."
    eva "[ama], Beatrice et Clarice étaient mes sœurs par choix."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1849
translate french c30s004_Eva_6c67dbbc:

    # eva "[ama], Fiona, Clarice, Diana, and Beatrice were my sisters by choice."
    eva "[ama], Fiona, Clarice, Diana et Beatrice étaient mes sœurs par choix."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1850
translate french c30s004_Eva_2041812b:

    # eva "I didn't share genes with them, but I shared... other things. My life."
    eva "Je ne partageais pas de gènes avec elles, mais je partageais... d'autres choses. Ma vie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1851
translate french c30s004_Eva_47983c58:

    # mc "That's normal."
    mc "C'est normal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1853
translate french c30s004_Eva_4104ee9a:

    # eva "I can't tell [lis] and [deb.nick] that I consider them my sisters..."
    eva "Je ne peux pas dire à [lis] et [deb.nick] que je les considère comme mes sœurs..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1854
translate french c30s004_Eva_67dcdea5:

    # mc "Makes sense."
    mc "C'est logique."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1856
translate french c30s004_Eva_2c9c5fa9:

    # eva "My sisters die around me. Sometimes it's my fault."
    eva "Mes sœurs meurent autour de moi. Parfois, c'est de ma faute."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1857
translate french c30s004_Eva_ca47d6e3:

    # eva "I had five sisters. And now four of them are gone. And I killed one of them."
    eva "J'avais cinq sœurs. Et maintenant quatre d'entre elles sont mortes. Et j'en ai tué une."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1858
translate french c30s004_Eva_6cb79bcd:

    # mc "You told me she died in an explosion during training..."
    mc "Tu m'as dit qu'elle était morte dans une explosion pendant l'entraînement..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1859
translate french c30s004_Eva_f6bbca12:

    # eva "I prepared the explosives that day..."
    eva "J'avais préparé les explosifs ce jour-là..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1861
translate french c30s004_Eva_8615866e:

    # mc "I didn't know, [eva]..."
    mc "Je ne savais pas, [eva]..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1862
translate french c30s004_Eva_da59a365:

    # "You hug her tightly. With one of those typical Marks hugs that could break some ribs."
    "Tu la serres fort dans tes bras. Avec un de ces câlins typiques des Marks qui pourraient briser des côtes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1863
translate french c30s004_Eva_776397c7:

    # "You thought you had started to understand her."
    "Tu pensais avoir commencé à la comprendre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1864
translate french c30s004_Eva_348bff84:

    # "You were wrong."
    "Tu avais tort."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1865
translate french c30s004_Eva_749c5ee0:

    # "You'll never understand what it feels like to think you're to blame for the death of a loved one."
    "Tu ne comprendras jamais ce que ça fait de penser qu'on est responsable de la mort d'un être cher."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1866
translate french c30s004_Eva_d1d0c98e:

    # "You still have a lot to learn about what happened at NTR back then."
    "Tu as encore beaucoup à apprendre sur ce qui s'est passé à NTR à l'époque."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1867
translate french c30s004_Eva_770d228a:

    # eva "You're... hurting me..."
    eva "Tu... me fais mal..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1868
translate french c30s004_Eva_ab3c76a7:

    # "Her voice sounds puzzled. Almost surprised."
    "Sa voix semble perplexe. Presque surprise."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1870
translate french c30s004_Eva_9a87d34e:

    # mc "I'm sorry."
    mc "Je suis désolé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1871
translate french c30s004_Eva_94af0af1:

    # "The line applies to both the strength of the hug and what she had to go through as a little girl in Aruba."
    "La phrase s'applique à la fois à la force de l'étreinte et à ce qu'elle a dû traverser quand elle était petite fille à Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1872
translate french c30s004_Eva_53ee831c:

    # eva "Aaron told me it wasn't my fault. He was supervising the preparation of the explosives that day, and he said I did it right."
    eva "Aaron m'a dit que ce n'était pas ma faute. Il supervisait la préparation des explosifs ce jour-là, et il a dit que j'avais bien fait."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1873
translate french c30s004_Eva_c7fac3f2:

    # eva "But..."
    eva "Mais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1875
translate french c30s004_Eva_d12ea19e:

    # "The girl's hand searches for the necklace she almost always wears. Today, the metal heart isn't there."
    "La main de la fille cherche le collier qu'elle porte presque toujours. Aujourd'hui, le cœur en métal n'est pas là."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1876
translate french c30s004_Eva_5e3354b4:

    # mc "But you can't stop thinking about what would have happened if you had done something differently."
    mc "Mais tu ne peux pas t'empêcher de penser à ce qui se serait passé si tu avais fait les choses différemment."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1878
translate french c30s004_Eva_d78ec5e1:

    # eva "Exactly. I'll always know that I killed Fiona."
    eva "Exactement. Je saurai toujours que j'ai tué Fiona."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1879
translate french c30s004_Eva_37106757:

    # mc "And you think that, if you tell [lis] and [deb.nick] that you love them like sisters, you'd be betraying her."
    mc "Et tu penses que, si tu dis à [lis] et [deb.nick] que tu les aimes comme des sœurs, tu la trahirais."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1880
translate french c30s004_Eva_dd52780b:

    # mc "And Beatrice, Clarice, and Diana."
    mc "Et Beatrice, Clarice et Diana."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1882
translate french c30s004_Eva_d87766ae:

    # eva "Yes... You still don't think I'm an idiot?"
    eva "Oui... Tu ne penses toujours pas que je suis une idiote ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1883
translate french c30s004_Eva_26622ef6:

    # mc "No, [eva]. None of us would think that, because none of us can imagine what you all experienced."
    mc "Non, [eva]. Aucun de nous ne penserait ça, parce qu'aucun de nous ne peut imaginer ce que vous avez toutes vécu."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1884
translate french c30s004_Eva_6f6fb122:

    # mc "The six of you spent 24 hours a day together for 12 years. And you went through a lot of bad shit together."
    mc "Vous avez passé 24 heures sur 24 ensemble toutes les six pendant 12 ans. Et vous avez traversé un paquet de merdes ensemble."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1885
translate french c30s004_Eva_8ebf8376:

    # mc "A relationship of less than a month can't compare to that."
    mc "Une relation de moins d'un mois ne peut pas rivaliser avec ça."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1887
translate french c30s004_Eva_9cb7ce3b:

    # eva "It's... different..."
    eva "C'est... différent..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1888
translate french c30s004_Eva_3d31bd2a:

    # mc "That's exactly it. Different. You had five sisters and now you have two more."
    mc "C'est exactement ça. Différent. Tu avais cinq sœurs et maintenant tu en as deux de plus."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1889
translate french c30s004_Eva_0c5252b3:

    # mc "And now you're starting to see the rest of the girls in a different light. If you didn't, what [deb.nick] and [lis] said wouldn't have affected you."
    mc "Et maintenant tu commences à voir le reste des filles sous un autre jour. Si ce n'était pas le cas, ce que [deb.nick] et [lis] ont dit ne t'aurait pas affectée."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1891
translate french c30s004_Eva_041d4bf7:

    # "Her hand reaches for the necklace again."
    "Sa main se dirige à nouveau vers le collier."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1892
translate french c30s004_Eva_4e0c011e:

    # eva "Yes..."
    eva "Oui..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1893
translate french c30s004_Eva_684771b7:

    # mc "They're still not on the same level as your original sisters. Maybe they never will be."
    mc "Elles ne sont toujours pas au même niveau que tes sœurs d'origine. Peut-être qu'elles ne le seront jamais."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1894
translate french c30s004_Eva_4a04cd67:

    # mc "But you're starting to feel things for them that you've only ever felt for your sisters."
    mc "Mais tu commences à ressentir des choses pour elles que tu n'avais ressenties que pour tes sœurs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1896
translate french c30s004_Eva_476cc54a:

    # eva "That's what scares me. Not only am I betraying them, but..."
    eva "C'est ce qui me fait peur. Non seulement je les trahis, mais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1897
translate french c30s004_Eva_2e65084d:

    # mc "You're never going to forget them. Nor are you going to replace them."
    mc "Tu ne les oublieras jamais. Et tu ne les remplaceras pas non plus."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1899
translate french c30s004_Eva_49527e9f:

    # mc "When we found out that [sca] was my half-sister, she didn't replace [emm]."
    mc "Quand on a découvert que [sca] était ma demi-sœur, elle n'a pas remplacé [emm]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1901
translate french c30s004_Eva_ed547e37:

    # mc "When [mar] gives birth, I'll have a new brother or sister. They won't replace [emm]."
    mc "Quand [mar] accouchera, j'aurai un nouveau frère ou une nouvelle sœur. Il ou elle ne remplacera pas [emm]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1903
translate french c30s004_Eva_d5ae5432:

    # mc "If [mar] gets pregnant, I'll have a new brother or sister. They won't replace [emm]."
    mc "Si [mar] tombe enceinte, j'aurai un nouveau frère ou une nouvelle sœur. Il ou elle ne remplacera pas [emm]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1905
translate french c30s004_Eva_71f60128:

    # mc "If [mar] has another baby someday, I'll have a new brother or sister. They wouldn't replace [emm]."
    mc "Si [mar] a un autre bébé un jour, j'aurai un nouveau frère ou une nouvelle sœur. Il ou elle ne remplacerait pas [emm]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1907
translate french c30s004_Eva_6b0180f6:

    # mc "If my dad had a baby, I'd have a new brother or sister. They wouldn't replace [emm]."
    mc "Si mon père avait un bébé, j'aurais un nouveau frère ou une nouvelle sœur. Il ou elle ne remplacerait pas [emm]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1909
translate french c30s004_Eva_af44863a:

    # eva "But that's because there are shared genes... This is different. This is choosing new sisters."
    eva "Mais c'est parce qu'il y a des gènes en commun... Là, c'est différent. C'est choisir de nouvelles sœurs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1910
translate french c30s004_Eva_473ff680:

    # "She's starting to get annoyed that she can't convince you to see it from her point of view."
    "Elle commence à s'agacer de ne pas réussir à te convaincre de voir les choses de son point de vue."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1911
translate french c30s004_Eva_51ece621:

    # "It's time to change tactics."
    "Il est temps de changer de tactique."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1912
translate french c30s004_Eva_82b376c5:

    # mc "Jamaal never replaced [emm]. I chose him to be my brother."
    mc "Jamaal n'a jamais remplacé [emm]. Je l'ai choisi pour être mon frère."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1913
translate french c30s004_Eva_0bf270b9:

    # mc "I know. *Laugh* Maybe it was a weird choice."
    mc "Je sais. *Rires* C'était peut-être un choix bizarre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1915
translate french c30s004_Eva_d485bceb:

    # eva "*Laugh* You're an idiot."
    eva "*Rire* T'es un idiot."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1916
translate french c30s004_Eva_58e968a8:

    # "For the first time, there isn't a hint of sadness in her laughter."
    "Pour la première fois, il n'y a pas une once de tristesse dans son rire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1917
translate french c30s004_Eva_d41fcbb1:

    # "It seems your words are starting to convince her of how wrong she is."
    "On dirait que tes mots commencent à la convaincre qu'elle a tort."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1918
translate french c30s004_Eva_7f1fdae5:

    # mc "*Laugh* I know that too."
    mc "*Rire* Je le sais aussi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1919
translate french c30s004_Eva_d9b61fcc:

    # mc "But what I mean is that you can have several sisters by choice and they won't replace each other."
    mc "Mais ce que je veux dire, c'est que tu peux avoir plusieurs sœurs de cœur et qu'elles ne se remplaceront pas les unes les autres."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1920
translate french c30s004_Eva_c59fa87f:

    # mc "It's the same with family. Do you remember Christmas at the beach?"
    mc "C'est pareil avec la famille. Tu te souviens de Noël à la plage ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1922
translate french c30s004_Eva_1016b3e0:

    # eva "Yeah. What about it?"
    eva "Ouais. Et alors ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1923
translate french c30s004_Eva_0cabf84d:

    # mc "You told me something like 'That's not my family. My family is [ama]. And it's not even Christmas.'"
    mc "Tu m'as dit un truc du genre 'C'est pas ma famille. Ma famille, c'est [ama]. Et c'est même pas Noël.'"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1925
translate french c30s004_Eva_195614e1:

    # eva "Because it wasn't Christmas!"
    eva "Parce que c'était pas Noël !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1926
translate french c30s004_Eva_dc21964f:

    # mc "You know that's not what I mean."
    mc "Tu sais que c'est pas ce que je veux dire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1927
translate french c30s004_Eva_1d7bfbec:

    # mc "Now you consider the girls and me your family. Maybe even Jamaal."
    mc "Maintenant, tu considères les filles et moi comme ta famille. Peut-être même Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1928
translate french c30s004_Eva_21569a58:

    # mc "*Laugh* You can make weird choices, too."
    mc "*Rires* Tu peux faire des choix bizarres, toi aussi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1930
translate french c30s004_Eva_bacf5c75:

    # eva "*Laugh* You're still an idiot."
    eva "*Rires* T'es toujours un idiot."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1931
translate french c30s004_Eva_8860cf16:

    # mc "But, do you consider [ama] any less family now that you also consider [nor] family... or [eil]?"
    mc "Mais, est-ce que tu considères [ama] un peu moins comme ta famille maintenant que tu considères aussi [nor] comme ta famille... ou [eil] ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1932
translate french c30s004_Eva_75adbac9:

    # "You avoid naming [eri] or [dap] on purpose. That way you cover the extended family."
    "Tu évites de nommer [eri] ou [dap] exprès. De cette façon, tu couvres la famille élargie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1934
translate french c30s004_Eva_7fac3a83:

    # eva "No... But..."
    eva "Non... Mais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1935
translate french c30s004_Eva_aa39311d:

    # mc "No 'buts'. I'm not telling you to go hug [lis] and [deb.nick] and tell them you consider them your sisters."
    mc "Pas de 'mais'. Je ne te dis pas d'aller serrer [lis] et [deb.nick] dans tes bras et de leur dire que tu les considères comme tes sœurs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1936
translate french c30s004_Eva_2ef2ab6f:

    # mc "Maybe one day you will. Or maybe that day will never come and you'll just be good friends."
    mc "Peut-être qu'un jour tu le feras. Ou peut-être que ce jour ne viendra jamais et que vous serez juste de bonnes amies."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1937
translate french c30s004_Eva_28670522:

    # mc "But whether you do it or not, none of them will ever replace Fiona. Or Beatrice, Clarice, or Diana."
    mc "Mais que tu le fasses ou non, aucune d'entre elles ne remplacera jamais Fiona. Ou Beatrice, Clarice, ou Diana."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1939
translate french c30s004_Eva_e7d944ba:

    # eva "I love you."
    eva "Je t'aime."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1941
translate french c30s004_Eva_fee7f8e1:

    # eva "I can tell you that I love you like a brother."
    eva "Je peux te dire que je t'aime comme un frère."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1942
translate french c30s004_Eva_6616e794:

    # mc "I love you too."
    mc "Je t'aime aussi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1943
translate french c30s004_Eva_03a3687f:

    # "You recognize that spark in her eyes, accompanied by a sincere smile."
    "Tu reconnais cette étincelle dans ses yeux, accompagnée d'un sourire sincère."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1944
translate french c30s004_Eva_b75cbbd9:

    # "You've seen it a thousand times in [emm]'s eyes, when everything clicks in her head in a second."
    "Tu l'as vue mille fois dans les yeux de [emm], quand tout fait tilt dans sa tête en une seconde."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1946
translate french c30s004_Eva_8762bc95:

    # "You hug each other again. This time without either of you hurting the other."
    "Vous vous serrez à nouveau dans les bras. Cette fois sans que l'un de vous ne blesse l'autre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1947
translate french c30s004_Eva_5810c525:

    # eva "Sometimes I wonder why. And I remember that you're always here for me."
    eva "Parfois je me demande pourquoi. Et je me rappelle que tu es toujours là pour moi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1948
translate french c30s004_Eva_65ab44d3:

    # mc "And I'll always be there for you when you need me. Even when you don't want me to be."
    mc "Et je serai toujours là pour toi quand tu auras besoin de moi. Même quand tu ne voudras pas que je le sois."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1949
translate french c30s004_Eva_f1b59ff3:

    # eva "I know."
    eva "Je sais."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1951
translate french c30s004_Eva_440dd6ce:

    # mc "*Laugh* I hope you don't love me like a brother."
    mc "*Rire* J'espère que tu ne m'aimes pas comme un frère."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1953
translate french c30s004_Eva_981c4d1a:

    # eva "*Laugh* Considering your relationship with [emm], I don't think there's much of a difference."
    eva "*Rire* Vu ta relation avec [emm], je ne pense pas qu'il y ait une grande différence."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1955
translate french c30s004_Eva_ade985d1:

    # eva "*Laugh* Idiot."
    eva "*Rire* Idiot."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1956
translate french c30s004_Eva_9b45815e:

    # "It's a long hug."
    "C'est une longue étreinte."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1957
translate french c30s004_Eva_0335a357:

    # "[eva] feels much better than in the previous hugs."
    "[eva] semble se sentir beaucoup mieux que lors des précédentes étreintes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1958
translate french c30s004_Eva_58b7f03c:

    # "You don't know what's going through her head, but you're glad for what her body, much more relaxed than before, conveys."
    "Tu ne sais pas ce qui lui passe par la tête, mais tu te réjouis de ce que son corps, beaucoup plus détendu qu'avant, transmet."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1959
translate french c30s004_Eva_3b2ced96:

    # mc "One day you'll have to explain to me the story of that necklace you always reach for when you talk about your sisters."
    mc "Un jour, il faudra que tu m'expliques l'histoire de ce collier que tu touches toujours quand tu parles de tes sœurs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1960
translate french c30s004_Eva_fa1f6299:

    # "The redhead tenses for a moment in your arms."
    "La rousse se crispe un instant dans tes bras."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1961
translate french c30s004_Eva_fb615a15:

    # eva "Maybe another day."
    eva "Peut-être un autre jour."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1962
translate french c30s004_Eva_fdc0812b:

    # mc "Then you'll have to explain to me why you're wearing a wetsuit to the pool."
    mc "Alors tu devras m'expliquer pourquoi tu portes une combinaison de plongée à la piscine."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1963
translate french c30s004_Eva_1f2c2dfa:

    # eva "*Laugh* That will have to wait too."
    eva "*Rire* Ça aussi, ça devra attendre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1964
translate french c30s004_Eva_e4455265:

    # eva "And now, hold me in silence."
    eva "Et maintenant, serre-moi en silence."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1965
translate french c30s004_Eva_bf23b507:

    # "It's a polite way of telling you that you talk too much. This time you're glad you've talked so much."
    "C'est une façon polie de te dire que tu parles trop. Cette fois, tu es content d'avoir autant parlé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1966
translate french c30s004_Eva_b995f0e3:

    # "[eva]'s body language tells you that the conversation has been good for her."
    "Le langage corporel d'[eva] te dit que la conversation lui a fait du bien."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1968
translate french c30s004_Eva_85a2a97e:

    # "When you decide to break the hug and go to dinner, there's no one left in [nor]'s kitchen."
    "Quand tu décides de rompre l'étreinte et d'aller dîner, il n'y a plus personne dans la cuisine de [nor]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1969
translate french c30s004_Eva_b970a214:

    # "There's a note on the counter letting you know they left dinner in the fridge for you."
    "Il y a un mot sur le comptoir pour te prévenir qu'elles ont laissé le dîner dans le frigo pour vous."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1970
translate french c30s004_Eva_f4f270a3:

    # "You can't imagine how they knew you were going to be late for dinner."
    "Tu ne peux pas imaginer comment elles savaient que tu allais être en retard pour le dîner."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1972
translate french c30s004_Eva_5182a123:

    # eva "If you start acting stupidly romantic after this, I'll show you that I can give hugs that hurt, too."
    eva "Si tu commences à faire le romantique à la con après ça, je te montrerai que je peux aussi faire des câlins qui font mal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1974
translate french c30s004_Eva_a895dc9f:

    # "A couple of hours earlier..."
    "Quelques heures plus tôt..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1975
translate french c30s004_Eva_08fc7c89:

    # ama "[nor], I doubt [eva] and [mc] are going to make it to dinner."
    ama "[nor], je doute qu'[eva] et [mc] arrivent à temps pour le dîner."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1976
translate french c30s004_Eva_b7e8538e:

    # nor "Is something wrong, sweetie?"
    nor "Il y a un problème, ma chérie ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1977
translate french c30s004_Eva_eb8026b8:

    # ama "Nothing bad. I think [mc] is helping [eva] right now more than she can imagine."
    ama "Rien de grave. Je pense que [mc] aide [eva] en ce moment plus qu'elle ne peut l'imaginer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1978
translate french c30s004_Eva_2fefa476:

    # nor "(And whatever he's doing, judging by your smile, he's helping you too.)"
    nor "(Et quoi qu'il fasse, à en juger par ton sourire, il t'aide aussi.)"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1990
translate french c30s004_EmmMarEri_cd0c735b:

    # centered "{size=+20}{b}DAY 36 – TUESDAY{/b}{/size}"
    centered "{size=+20}{b}JOUR 36 – MARDI{/b}{/size}"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1992
translate french c30s004_EmmMarEri_0e3a41d4:

    # "The next morning, while you're still sleeping..."
    "Le lendemain matin, pendant que tu dors encore..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1993
translate french c30s004_EmmMarEri_8828e59e:

    # eri "Thank goodness Aunt [bet] and grandma are coming back today."
    eri "Dieu merci, tante [bet] et grand-mère reviennent aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1994
translate french c30s004_EmmMarEri_f4385b5b:

    # mom "It felt like a long time without them, and [bet] is leaving again in a couple of days."
    mom "Ça m'a paru long sans elles, et [bet] repart dans quelques jours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1995
translate french c30s004_EmmMarEri_d44fc4ab:

    # emm "I think she's going to be really busy these days. We're all going to want to spend time with her before she leaves."
    emm "Je pense qu'elle va être vraiment occupée ces jours-ci. On va toutes vouloir passer du temps avec elle avant qu'elle parte."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1997
translate french c30s004_EmmMarEri_e37fc2cf:

    # mom "Don't overwhelm her too much. She'll probably have to get some things ready before she goes."
    mom "Ne la submergez pas trop. Elle aura probablement des choses à préparer avant de partir."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1999
translate french c30s004_EmmMarEri_5f997489:

    # eri "I was planning to help her get her stuff ready."
    eri "J'avais prévu de l'aider à préparer ses affaires."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2000
translate french c30s004_EmmMarEri_80c8152c:

    # eri "Helping her unpack and repack her bags is a way to spend time with her."
    eri "L'aider à défaire et refaire ses valises est une façon de passer du temps avec elle."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2002
translate french c30s004_EmmMarEri_2a3a7fc8:

    # emm "*Laugh* The cockroach is smart! I hadn't thought of that."
    emm "*Rire* Le cafard est intelligent ! Je n'y avais pas pensé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2003
translate french c30s004_EmmMarEri_ee0b8cee:

    # emm "I think helping her take her clothes to the laundry room and stuff could be fun... For once."
    emm "Je pense que l'aider à emmener ses vêtements à la buanderie et tout ça pourrait être amusant... Pour une fois."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2006
translate french c30s004_EmmMarEri_c50a80bd:

    # mom "*Laugh* You have experience with having fun in the laundry room."
    mom "*Rire* Tu as de l'expérience pour t'amuser dans la buanderie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2008
translate french c30s004_EmmMarEri_f200f454:

    # eri "What I don't understand is how you managed to stop him from... you know..."
    eri "Ce que je ne comprends pas, c'est comment tu as réussi à l'empêcher de... tu sais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2010
translate french c30s004_EmmMarEri_525c4f75:

    # emm "*Laugh* Because my plan worked great. From the waist up, I was inside the washing machine."
    emm "*Rire* Parce que mon plan a marché à merveille. À partir de la taille, j'étais à l'intérieur de la machine à laver."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2011
translate french c30s004_EmmMarEri_a0f28777:

    # emm "Sometimes you guys complain that my plans never work. Bazinga! In your face!"
