translate french c30s006_mad_80eabb36:

    # "The girl kisses you passionately for a few seconds that feel too short."
    "La fille t'embrasse passionnément pendant quelques secondes qui semblent trop courtes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2695
translate french c30s006_mad_56b2c467:

    # "Her body relaxes as time passes."
    "Son corps se détend au fil du temps."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2696
translate french c30s006_mad_e886dc8f:

    # "You read somewhere that a kiss should last at least 20 seconds to release all the oxytocin. Or was that hugs?"
    "Tu as lu quelque part qu'un baiser devrait durer au moins 20 secondes pour libérer toute l'ocytocine. Ou c'était les câlins ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2698
translate french c30s006_mad_e958c695:

    # mc "Less nervous?"
    mc "Moins nerveuse ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2699
translate french c30s006_mad_19664287:

    # mad "A little..."
    mad "Un peu..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2700
translate french c30s006_mad_bceaa42d:

    # mc "Well, you wanted to talk to me, right?"
    mc "Bon, tu voulais me parler, c'est ça ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2703
translate french c30s006_mad_106f455a:

    # mad "Well, it all started when you proposed to [kia] and then you proposed to me with that post-it..."
    mad "Eh bien, tout a commencé quand tu as demandé [kia] en mariage et qu'ensuite tu m'as fait ta demande avec ce post-it..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2705
translate french c30s006_mad_b4259883:

    # mad "Well, it all started when you proposed to me with that post-it."
    mad "Eh bien, tout a commencé quand tu m'as fait ta demande avec ce post-it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2706
translate french c30s006_mad_f4770c25:

    # mc "And we discovered you have a marriage fetish. *Laugh*"
    mc "Et on a découvert que tu avais un fétichisme du mariage. *Rires*"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2707
translate french c30s006_mad_eeaae653:

    # mad "Yeah..."
    mad "Ouais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2709
translate french c30s006_mad_1a7bb245:

    # mad "I don't know if you've noticed, but I hardly ever wear rings."
    mad "Je ne sais pas si tu as remarqué, mais je ne porte presque jamais de bagues."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2710
translate french c30s006_mad_e5db7433:

    # mc "I noticed. I don't wear them either, but for a wedding ring I'd be willing to change that habit."
    mc "J'ai remarqué. Je n'en porte pas non plus, mais pour une alliance, je serais prêt à changer cette habitude."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2713
translate french c30s006_mad_b916222b:

    # mad "A ring for each girl? Which girl's ring goes on the ring finger?"
    mad "Une bague pour chaque fille ? La bague de quelle fille irait sur l'annulaire ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2714
translate french c30s006_mad_c22d41c7:

    # mad "We'd never be able to agree on a ring design, so you'd only have to wear one."
    mad "On ne serait jamais capables de se mettre d'accord sur le design d'une bague, alors tu n'aurais à en porter qu'une seule."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2715
translate french c30s006_mad_a29dd635:

    # mc "That would be complicated. Each of you would want something to fit your own taste."
    mc "Ce serait compliqué. Chacune de vous voudrait quelque chose à son goût."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2717
translate french c30s006_mad_16bcbbaf:

    # mad "But your post-it solved that problem. It gave me an idea."
    mad "Mais ton post-it a résolu ce problème. Ça m'a donné une idée."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2719
translate french c30s006_mad_2ad34fa0:

    # mad "Each of us would have our own personalized ring to our liking. With something that meant something to her."
    mad "Chacune de nous aurait sa propre bague personnalisée à son goût. Avec quelque chose qui a du sens pour elle."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2720
translate french c30s006_mad_7c19a090:

    # mad "We don't need a physical ring to show that we're together."
    mad "On n'a pas besoin d'une bague physique pour montrer qu'on est ensemble."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2721
translate french c30s006_mad_f418ae84:

    # mc "I don't understand what you mean."
    mc "Je ne comprends pas ce que tu veux dire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2723
translate french c30s006_mad_8f78ca83:

    # mad "[mc] Marks, with this ring I declare myself your wife. If you want, of course."
    mad "[mc] Marks, avec cette bague, je me déclare ta femme. Si tu le veux, bien sûr."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2724
translate french c30s006_mad_0acbaeac:

    # mc "Of course I want to!"
    mc "Bien sûr que j'en ai envie !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2726
translate french c30s006_mad_31428ada:

    # "Your new wife turns around and kisses you even more passionately than before."
    "Ta nouvelle femme se retourne et t'embrasse encore plus passionnément qu'avant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2727
translate french c30s006_mad_c0c1886a:

    # "There are no more nerves. Only joy. Now you understand why no one told you what this was about."
    "Il n'y a plus de nervosité. Seulement de la joie. Maintenant tu comprends pourquoi personne ne t'a dit de quoi il s'agissait."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2728
translate french c30s006_mad_54f636a8:

    # "The kiss is even longer than the last one. Despite everything, it feels short to you."
    "Le baiser est encore plus long que le précédent. Malgré tout, il te paraît court."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2731
translate french c30s006_mad_ca04a8d2:

    # mc "Did you get a tattoo of the drawing I made on the post-it?"
    mc "Tu t'es fait tatouer le dessin que j'ai fait sur le post-it ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2733
translate french c30s006_mad_25d1fa23:

    # mad "By drawing the ring, you solved the issue of the custom ring."
    mad "En dessinant la bague, tu as résolu le problème de la bague sur mesure."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2734
translate french c30s006_mad_313deb7c:

    # mad "It meant so much to me that I don't want any other ring."
    mad "Ça comptait tellement pour moi que je ne veux aucune autre bague."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2735
translate french c30s006_mad_cd43271f:

    # mc "Did each of you get a ring tattooed?"
    mc "Chacune de vous s'est fait tatouer une bague ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2737
translate french c30s006_mad_7e142eda:

    # mad "You'll have to find that out for yourself. The bad part about the harem is that we can't enjoy this moment for very long."
    mad "Tu vas devoir le découvrir par toi-même. Le mauvais côté du harem, c'est qu'on ne peut pas profiter de ce moment très longtemps."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2739
translate french c30s006_mad_d4c19048:

    # mad "There's another girl waiting for you, and Jamaal must be getting impatient."
    mad "Il y a une autre fille qui t'attend, et Jamaal doit s'impatienter."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2741
translate french c30s006_mad_eb4b80b1:

    # mad "There are other girls waiting for you, and Jamaal must be getting impatient."
    mad "Il y a d'autres filles qui t'attendent, et Jamaal doit s'impatienter."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2742
translate french c30s006_mad_7f255f25:

    # mc "*Laugh* I hate that scavenging vulture."
    mc "*Rires* Je déteste ce vautour charognard."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2744
translate french c30s006_mad_706ade4b:

    # mad "By drawing the ring, you solved the issue of not wearing rings that I could lose."
    mad "En dessinant la bague, tu as résolu le problème de ne pas porter de bagues que je pourrais perdre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2745
translate french c30s006_mad_313deb7c_1:

    # mad "It meant so much to me that I don't want any other ring."
    mad "Ça a tellement compté pour moi que je ne veux aucune autre bague."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2746
translate french c30s006_mad_9156efd3:

    # mc "Rings are uncomfortable and you definitely can't lose this one. This is more... permanent."
    mc "Les bagues sont inconfortables et tu ne peux définitivement pas perdre celle-là. C'est plus... permanent."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2748
translate french c30s006_mad_a0bc7a8e:

    # mad "But now we should go see [mee] and Aunt [bet]. I'm sure they want to congratulate us."
    mad "Mais maintenant on devrait aller voir [mee] et Tante [bet]. Je suis sûre qu'elles veulent nous féliciter."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2749
translate french c30s006_mad_172e56c7:

    # mc "We're not going to get a moment to ourselves, are we?"
    mc "On ne va pas avoir un moment à nous, n'est-ce pas ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2751
translate french c30s006_mad_a8321211:

    # mad "Unfortunately, no. But I hope we get one before you leave for Aruba."
    mad "Malheureusement, non. Mais j'espère qu'on en aura un avant que tu partes pour Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2752
translate french c30s006_mad_b1472e3a:

    # mc "By the way, am I going to have to get a ring tattooed also?"
    mc "Au fait, est-ce que je vais devoir me faire tatouer une bague aussi ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2754
translate french c30s006_mad_ac913fac:

    # mad "*Laugh* No, honey. I like your body the way it is, without tattoos."
    mad "*Rires* Non, chéri. J'aime ton corps tel qu'il est, sans tatouages."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2757
translate french c30s006_mad_99a57d1d:

    # "You kiss each other again, just as passionately as the previous two times, but calmer at the same time."
    "Vous vous embrassez à nouveau, tout aussi passionnément que les deux fois précédentes, mais plus calmement en même temps."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2758
translate french c30s006_mad_e962a17f:

    # "Kissing your new wife produces a warmth inside you that runs through your entire body."
    "Embrasser votre nouvelle femme produit une chaleur en vous qui parcourt tout votre corps."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2760
translate french c30s006_mad_66a58f13:

    # "You pull away reluctantly."
    "Tu t'éloignes à contrecœur."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2762
translate french c30s006_mad_b51dfd2c:

    # "There's a scavenging vulture waiting for you."
    "Il y a un vautour charognard qui t'attend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2764
translate french c30s006_mad_81b6f66c:

    # "[mee] and Aunt [bet] are waiting for you."
    "[mee] et tante [bet] t'attendent."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2770
translate french c30s006_kia_f6ff2923:

    # "The next stop is [kia], after Jamaal forces you to walk one lap around the house."
    "Le prochain arrêt est [kia], après que Jamaal t'a forcé à faire un tour de la maison."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2772
translate french c30s006_kia_9f712fad:

    # "Jamaal accompanies you to where [kia] is."
    "Jamaal t'accompagne là où se trouve [kia]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2784
translate french c30s006_kia_2ac128a1:

    # "You approach [kia] imagining what awaits you. Did they all get a ring tattooed?"
    "Tu t'approches de [kia] en imaginant ce qui t'attend. Se sont-elles toutes fait tatouer une bague ?"

