translate french c30s006_kia_dfcaa03d:

    # mc "Hey, [kia]. You look gorgeous. I guess there's a tattoo I need to see."
    mc "Hé, [kia]. Tu es magnifique. Je suppose qu'il y a un tatouage que je dois voir."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2786
translate french c30s006_kia_50fe39a3:

    # kia "*Laugh* I guess being the second woman has the disadvantage of not surprising you anymore."
    kia "*Rires* Je suppose qu'être la deuxième femme a le désavantage de ne plus te surprendre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2788
translate french c30s006_kia_29efb65e:

    # kia "And I guess that, when you get to number [relaciones], it'll all feel repetitive."
    kia "Et je suppose que, quand tu arriveras à la numéro [relaciones], tout te semblera répétitif."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2790
translate french c30s006_kia_f9ce47ad:

    # kia "Although being the last one has some advantages."
    kia "Bien qu'être la dernière ait quelques avantages."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2792
translate french c30s006_kia_365373a3:

    # kia "As weird as it might seem to you, I don't want to wear your ring on my finger."
    kia "Aussi bizarre que cela puisse te paraître, je ne veux pas porter ta bague au doigt."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2793
translate french c30s006_kia_2b59368c:

    # kia "The one you made has a bad habit of falling apart and I don't want to lose it."
    kia "Celle que tu as fabriquée a la fâcheuse habitude de tomber en morceaux et je ne veux pas la perdre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2794
translate french c30s006_kia_a710453d:

    # mc "I already told you we'd buy a new ring, but I guess the tattoo solves that."
    mc "Je t'ai déjà dit qu'on achèterait une nouvelle bague, mais je suppose que le tatouage règle le problème."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2796
translate french c30s006_kia_7589cbb1:

    # kia "I know, but besides... I'd have to wear it on the same finger I've worn Solomon's on all these years."
    kia "Je sais, mais en plus... je devrais la porter sur le même doigt où j'ai porté celle de Solomon toutes ces années."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2797
translate french c30s006_kia_7ca22c53:

    # kia "And I don't want what we have, to have anything to do with him."
    kia "Et je ne veux pas que ce qu'on a ensemble ait quoi que ce soit à voir avec lui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2798
translate french c30s006_kia_72dc2ae8:

    # mc "And [mad.nick] solved the problem when she came up with the idea, right?"
    mc "Et [mad.nick] a résolu le problème quand elle a eu cette idée, pas vrai ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2800
translate french c30s006_kia_cd5dc508:

    # kia "Exactly..."
    kia "Exactement..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2804
translate french c30s006_kia_c6b20659:

    # kia "Well, you started all this at that beach, while we were watching the sunset."
    kia "Eh bien, tu as commencé tout ça sur cette plage, pendant qu'on regardait le coucher de soleil."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2805
translate french c30s006_kia_18958369:

    # mc "You mean the ring? Don't tell me you bought one."
    mc "Tu parles de la bague ? Ne me dis pas que tu en as acheté une."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2807
translate french c30s006_kia_365373a3_1:

    # kia "As weird as it might seem, I don't want to wear your ring on my finger."
    kia "Aussi bizarre que ça puisse paraître, je ne veux pas porter ta bague à mon doigt."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2808
translate french c30s006_kia_2b59368c_1:

    # kia "The one you made has a bad habit of falling apart, and I don't want to lose it."
    kia "Celle que tu as fabriquée a la fâcheuse habitude de tomber en morceaux, et je ne veux pas la perdre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2809
translate french c30s006_kia_00da53b6:

    # mc "I already told you we'd buy a new ring."
    mc "Je t'ai déjà dit qu'on achèterait une nouvelle bague."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2811
translate french c30s006_kia_938e7e4a:

    # kia "I know, but... I'd have to wear it on the same finger I've worn Solomon's on all these years."
    kia "Je sais, mais... je devrais la porter sur le même doigt où j'ai porté celle de Solomon pendant toutes ces années."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2812
translate french c30s006_kia_7ca22c53_1:

    # kia "And I don't want what we have, to have anything to do with him."
    kia "Et je ne veux pas que ce que nous avons ait quoi que ce soit à voir avec lui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2813
translate french c30s006_kia_ef4cd70d:

    # mc "I get it. What do you propose, then?"
    mc "Je comprends. Qu'est-ce que tu proposes, alors ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2815
translate french c30s006_kia_16b43e66:

    # kia "Something more permanent. Something I can never lose."
    kia "Quelque chose de plus permanent. Quelque chose que je ne pourrai jamais perdre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2817
translate french c30s006_kia_91f25e48:

    # kia "With this ring, I declare that I am your wife. Now and forever."
    kia "Avec cette bague, je déclare que je suis ta femme. Maintenant et pour toujours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2819
translate french c30s006_kia_b2b46501:

    # mc "What? You got a tattoo of the ring I made for you?"
    mc "Quoi ? Tu t'es fait tatouer la bague que je t'ai fabriquée ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2821
translate french c30s006_kia_d8c2f3f3:

    # mc "I love that you got a tattoo of the ring I made for you."
    mc "J'adore le fait que tu te sois fait tatouer la bague que je t'ai fabriquée."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2823
translate french c30s006_kia_61a555ca:

    # kia "*Laugh* It was either that or getting a cork tattooed. I preferred the ring."
    kia "*Rires* C'était ça ou me faire tatouer un bouchon en liège. J'ai préféré la bague."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2825
translate french c30s006_kia_27efe88d:

    # "Neither of you needs to say anything else. Your lips meet in an incredibly tender kiss."
    "Aucun de vous n'a besoin d'en dire plus. Vos lèvres se rencontrent dans un baiser incroyablement tendre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2826
translate french c30s006_kia_a8069392:

    # "During the birthday party, she told you her story right here and you were left wanting to kiss her..."
    "Pendant la fête d'anniversaire, elle t'a raconté son histoire juste ici et tu es resté avec l'envie de l'embrasser..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2827
translate french c30s006_kia_932216c6:

    # "Today, you share your first kiss as husband and wife."
    "Aujourd'hui, vous partagez votre premier baiser en tant que mari et femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2833
translate french c30s006_kia_dc138ab8:

    # kia "I wish you could stay with me all afternoon and all night, but..."
    kia "J'aimerais que tu puisses rester avec moi toute l'après-midi et toute la nuit, mais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2835
translate french c30s006_kia_e0fdee65:

    # mc "I know, Jamaal is waiting to take me to the next tattoo, right?"
    mc "Je sais, Jamaal attend pour m'emmener au prochain tatouage, c'est ça ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2837
translate french c30s006_kia_958a4665:

    # mc "I know, I'd like that too, but this was theoretically a party for Aunt [bet] and Meemaw, right?"
    mc "Je sais, j'aimerais bien aussi, mais c'était théoriquement une fête pour Tante [bet] et Mamie, non ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2838
translate french c30s006_kia_61bf2e18:

    # kia "Yeah. We'll have time for ourselves later. Even if I have to share you with the rest of the girls."
    kia "Ouais. On aura du temps pour nous plus tard. Même si je dois te partager avec le reste des filles."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2839
translate french c30s006_kia_8edda7aa:

    # kia "Save a dance for me."
    kia "Garde-moi une danse."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2841
translate french c30s006_kia_2a6778d6:

    # mc "See you later, gorgeous."
    mc "À plus tard, ma belle."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2843
translate french c30s006_kia_c6ec59ab:

    # mc "Shall we?"
    mc "On y va ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2848
translate french c30s006_sim_7ab13492:

    # "The next stop is [sim], after the mandatory walk around the house so the next girl can get into the position she chose."
    "Le prochain arrêt est [sim], après la promenade obligatoire autour de la maison pour que la fille suivante puisse se mettre dans la position qu'elle a choisie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2849
translate french c30s006_sim_82895414:

    # "Obviously, her chosen place is by the pool."
    "Évidemment, l'endroit qu'elle a choisi est au bord de la piscine."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2851
translate french c30s006_sim_fc52c4fd:

    # "Jamaal walks you over to where [sim] is."
    "Jamaal t'accompagne jusqu'à l'endroit où se trouve [sim]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2854
translate french c30s006_sim_341a986a:

    # jam "She's my sister. Treat her well, please."
    jam "C'est ma sœur. Traite-la bien, s'il te plaît."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2855
translate french c30s006_sim_7878f5b2:

    # mc "Have I ever treated her badly?... Well, better not answer that. But that was many years ago."
    mc "Est-ce que je l'ai déjà mal traitée ?... Bon, vaut mieux pas répondre à ça. Mais c'était il y a des années."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2856
translate french c30s006_sim_56c88dcf:

    # mc "Besides, it seems being with Anthony is softening you up. *Laugh* You care about [sim] now?"
    mc "D'ailleurs, on dirait qu'être avec Anthony t'adoucit. *Rires* Tu te soucies de [sim] maintenant ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2858
translate french c30s006_sim_3c3cdce9:

    # "You turn towards [sim] without giving him time to answer."
    "Tu te tournes vers [sim] sans lui laisser le temps de répondre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2859
translate french c30s006_sim_320c7b2f:

    # jam "*Laugh* I still don't know why I'm your friend. Asshole!"
    jam "*Rires* Je ne sais toujours pas pourquoi je suis ton pote. Connard !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2869
translate french c30s006_sim_29de4d14:

    # mc "Hey, [sim]. I don't know how you manage to look more beautiful every day."
    mc "Hé, [sim]. Je ne sais pas comment tu fais pour être de plus en plus belle chaque jour."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2870
translate french c30s006_sim_6effa933:

    # sim "Thank you. You look really handsome in that suit too."
    sim "Merci. Tu es vraiment très beau dans ce costume toi aussi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2871
translate french c30s006_sim_6fcce14b:

    # mc "I guess there's a tattoo I need to see, right?"
    mc "J'imagine qu'il y a un tatouage que je dois voir, non ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2872
translate french c30s006_sim_0c8346e6:

    # mc "Although in our case there was no ring, so it's going to be a surprise."
    mc "Même si dans notre cas il n'y a pas eu de bague, donc ça va être une surprise."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2874
translate french c30s006_sim_c2832089:

    # sim "When the idea of tattoos came up, I wanted something that represented us, something that was just ours."
    sim "Quand l'idée des tatouages a été évoquée, je voulais quelque chose qui nous représente, quelque chose qui n'appartienne qu'à nous."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2875
translate french c30s006_sim_ed88d02a:

    # sim "But we've spent so many years together that there isn't just one thing that stands out above the rest, so I went with something classic."
    sim "Mais on a passé tellement d'années ensemble qu'il n'y a pas qu'une seule chose qui ressort plus que le reste, alors j'ai choisi quelque chose de classique."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2876
translate french c30s006_sim_433fc9d7:

    # mc "Classic is always a good choice."
    mc "Le classique est toujours un bon choix."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2878
translate french c30s006_sim_3bee01b9:

    # sim "I also wanted something that would last forever. *Laugh* You're not getting away from me that easily. So, the tattoo was a great option."
    sim "Je voulais aussi quelque chose qui dure pour toujours. *Rires* Tu ne vas pas m'échapper aussi facilement. Donc, le tatouage était une super option."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2882
translate french c30s006_sim_3d43ab95:

    # sim "The other day, in your room, I asked you to marry me. And you said yes."
    sim "L'autre jour, dans ta chambre, je t'ai demandé de m'épouser. Et tu as dit oui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2883
translate french c30s006_sim_0e974e64:

    # mc "I could never have turned down a proposal like that, [sim]."
    mc "Je n'aurais jamais pu refuser une telle demande, [sim]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2884
translate french c30s006_sim_7f65a358:

    # sim "But I didn't have a ring to give you."
    sim "Mais je n'avais pas de bague à t'offrir."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2885
translate french c30s006_sim_cb4b13bf:

    # mc "We don't need a ring between us, [sim]."
    mc "On n'a pas besoin de bague entre nous, [sim]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2887
translate french c30s006_sim_41dfaa5e:

    # sim "I wanted something that would last forever. *Laugh* You're not getting away from me that easily."
    sim "Je voulais quelque chose qui dure pour toujours. *Rires* Tu ne vas pas m'échapper aussi facilement."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2888
translate french c30s006_sim_8e7553af:

    # mc "*Laugh* I have no intention of running away."
    mc "*Rires* Je n'ai aucune intention de m'enfuir."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2890
translate french c30s006_sim_9930679e:

    # sim "[mc], with this ring I declare myself your wife."
    sim "[mc], avec cet anneau, je me déclare ta femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2892
translate french c30s006_sim_4f02c3fe:

    # mc "What? You got a wedding ring tattooed?"
    mc "Quoi ? Tu t'es fait tatouer une alliance ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2893
translate french c30s006_sim_7cf64a1f:

    # mc "It's a beautiful tattoo. Very classic, just like us. The guy who dates his best friend's sister and..."
    mc "C'est un magnifique tatouage. Très classique, tout comme nous. Le mec qui sort avec la sœur de son meilleur pote et..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2894
translate french c30s006_sim_8fe612e9:

    # sim "And she ends up getting a ring tattooed. *Laugh* Instead of a classic ring, I got a chain; each link is a step that brought us here."
    sim "Et elle finit par se faire tatouer une bague. *Rires* Au lieu d'une bague classique, j'ai fait une chaîne ; chaque maillon est une étape qui nous a menés jusqu'ici."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2896
translate french c30s006_sim_2510998a:

    # mc "I see a lot of links... Have we taken that many steps?"
    mc "Je vois beaucoup de maillons... On a franchi tant d'étapes que ça ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2897
translate french c30s006_sim_588a79b1:

    # sim "This way it's sure to last forever. We have to give a meaning to each link."
    sim "Comme ça, c'est sûr que ça durera pour toujours. On doit donner un sens à chaque maillon."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2899
translate french c30s006_sim_c3441bd8:

    # "You kiss your new wife for the first time. In just a few days she has gone from friend to girlfriend, to fiancée, and to wife."
    "Tu embrasses ta nouvelle femme pour la première fois. En quelques jours à peine, elle est passée d'amie à petite amie, puis fiancée, et enfin épouse."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2900
translate french c30s006_sim_086ac068:

    # "A natural and classic evolution, albeit a fast one."
    "Une évolution naturelle et classique, bien que rapide."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2901
translate french c30s006_sim_075913c6:

    # "Just as fast, too fast, your kiss ends."
    "Tout aussi vite, trop vite, ton baiser prend fin."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2911
translate french c30s006_sim_e70f6d9a:

    # sim "You know I hate my brother right now, right?"
    sim "Tu sais que je déteste mon frère en ce moment, pas vrai ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2912
translate french c30s006_sim_1ef099e0:

    # mc "*Laugh* Right now? I think you've always hated him."
    mc "*Rires* En ce moment ? Je crois que tu l'as toujours détesté."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2914
translate french c30s006_sim_21716e15:

    # sim "*Laugh* Well, yes. But right now I hate him even more. He's over there signaling me to send you to him."
    sim "*Rires* Eh bien, oui. Mais là, je le déteste encore plus. Il est là-bas en train de me faire signe de t'envoyer vers lui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2915
translate french c30s006_sim_6fd89827:

    # sim "I think he has to take you somewhere else right now."
    sim "Je crois qu'il doit t'emmener ailleurs tout de suite."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2916
translate french c30s006_sim_e4d641f1:

    # mc "*Laugh* We all hate Jamaal."
    mc "*Rires* On déteste tous Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2921
translate french c30s006_sim_9433cf80:

    # "You kiss your wife again, this time as a brief farewell before returning to Jamaal."
    "Tu embrasses à nouveau ta femme, cette fois comme un bref adieu avant de retourner voir Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2923
translate french c30s006_sim_91dd84e7:

    # "You kiss your wife again, this time as a brief farewell before heading to the party."
    "Tu embrasses à nouveau ta femme, cette fois comme un bref adieu avant de te rendre à la fête."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2928
translate french c30s006_kat_5bca0224:

    # "The next girl is [kat]. She is waiting for you where you had the non-date."
    "La fille suivante est [kat]. Elle t'attend là où vous avez eu votre non-rendez-vous."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2930
translate french c30s006_kat_8e27dc46:

    # "Jamaal guides you to where [kat] is waiting for you, where you had your non-date."
    "Jamaal te guide jusqu'à l'endroit où [kat] t'attend, là où vous avez eu votre non-rendez-vous."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2941
translate french c30s006_kat_d8ea17bd:

    # mc "You look gorgeous, [kat]. I can't wait to see what you got tattooed."
    mc "Tu es magnifique, [kat]. J'ai hâte de voir ce que tu t'es fait tatouer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2942
translate french c30s006_kat_4bfa0b14:

    # kat "Who told you I got a tattoo?"
    kat "Qui t'a dit que je m'étais fait tatouer ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2943
translate french c30s006_kat_a0e03345:

    # mc "You didn't? You surprise me, Little Beluga."
    mc "Tu ne l'as pas fait ? Tu m'étonnes, Petit Béluga."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2945
translate french c30s006_kat_20c9ff1e:

    # kat "*Laugh* I did get one. But I assure you I didn't want to. It seems ridiculous to declare myself your wife after just a few kisses."
    kat "*Rires* Je l'ai fait. Mais je t'assure que je ne le voulais pas. Ça semble ridicule de me déclarer comme ta femme après seulement quelques baisers."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2946
translate french c30s006_kat_f18493d0:

    # mc "You don't have to do it if you don't want to."
    mc "Tu n'es pas obligée de le faire si tu n'en as pas envie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2948
translate french c30s006_kat_91ac0fe1:

    # kat "I said it seems ridiculous, not that I don't want to do it. What I didn't want was to get a tattoo."
    kat "J'ai dit que ça semblait ridicule, pas que je ne voulais pas le faire. Ce que je ne voulais pas, c'était me faire tatouer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2949
translate french c30s006_kat_10cfab11:

    # kat "You said it yourself. You don't know what I got tattooed. We don't have anything that defines us, that is just ours. It's too soon."
    kat "Tu l'as dit toi-même. Tu ne sais pas ce que je me suis fait tatouer. Nous n'avons rien qui nous définisse, qui ne soit qu'à nous. C'est trop tôt."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2951
translate french c30s006_kat_6ebec553:

    # mc "If I had to choose, I would have tattooed a waffle, you looked so cute when I gave you a piece of mine."
    mc "Si j'avais dû choisir, je me serais fait tatouer une gaufre, tu étais si mignonne quand je t'ai donné un morceau de la mienne."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2953
translate french c30s006_kat_8d32c36f:

    # mc "If I had to choose, I would have tattooed a waffle, you know, because of the non-date... You threatened to steal a piece from me."
    mc "Si je devais choisir, je me serais fait tatouer une gaufre, tu sais, à cause du non-rencard... Tu as menacé de m'en voler un bout."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2954
translate french c30s006_kat_8e6575bf:

    # mc "That would be just ours."
    mc "Ce serait juste à nous."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2958
translate french c30s006_kat_ab7588ba:

    # kat "I want to start by saying that I didn't want to do this. It seems ridiculous after just a few kisses."
    kat "Je veux commencer par dire que je ne voulais pas faire ça. Ça semble ridicule après seulement quelques baisers."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2960
translate french c30s006_kat_32806ade:

    # kat "But they forced me to do it..."
    kat "Mais on m'a forcée à le faire..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2962
translate french c30s006_kat_25e9d74e:

    # kat "But I didn't want you to leave for Aruba without doing it..."
    kat "Mais je ne voulais pas que tu partes pour Aruba sans le faire..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2963
translate french c30s006_kat_b0b0ec3d:

    # mc "Whatever you're going to do, you don't have to do it if you don't want to."
    mc "Quoi que tu t'apprêtes à faire, tu n'es pas obligée de le faire si tu n'en as pas envie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2965
translate french c30s006_kat_2492b700:

    # kat "I don't mean the act of doing it, but that we still don't have anything that defines us... Nothing that you look at and think of us as a couple."
    kat "Je ne parle pas de l'acte en lui-même, mais du fait qu'on n'a toujours rien qui nous définisse... Rien que tu puisses regarder en pensant à nous comme un couple."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2967
translate french c30s006_kat_8ba9850f:

    # mc "If I had to choose, I'd think of a waffle, you looked so cute when I gave you a piece of mine. Or a beluga..."
    mc "Si je devais choisir, je penserais à une gaufre, tu étais si mignonne quand je t'ai donné un bout de la mienne. Ou à un béluga..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2969
translate french c30s006_kat_d004c2ba:

    # mc "If I had to choose, I'd think of a waffle, you know, because of the non-date... You looked so cute when you threatened to steal a piece of mine. Or a beluga..."
    mc "Si je devais choisir, je penserais à une gaufre, tu sais, à cause du non-rencard... Tu étais si mignonne quand tu as menacé de m'en voler un bout. Ou à un béluga..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2970
translate french c30s006_kat_8e6575bf_1:

    # mc "That would be just ours."
    mc "Ce serait juste à nous."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2972
translate french c30s006_kat_6cd5389d:

    # kat "*Laugh* You're an asshole! But I like that you're starting to get to know me."
    kat "*Rire* T'es un connard ! Mais j'aime que tu commences à me connaître."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2973
translate french c30s006_kat_2bb99d7b:

    # kat "And now you're my asshole."
    kat "Et maintenant, tu es mon connard."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2975
translate french c30s006_kat_98ed6bfe:

    # kat "With this waffle, I declare myself your wife."
    kat "Avec cette gaufre, je me déclare ta femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2976
translate french c30s006_kat_f719922c:

    # mc "*Laugh* Are you proposing to me with a waffle?"
    mc "*Rire* Tu me demandes en mariage avec une gaufre ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2978
translate french c30s006_kat_ed2901cd:

    # kat "No. I'm telling you that, whether you like it or not, you're married to me. Instead of a wedding cake, we can have a wedding waffle."
    kat "Non. Je te dis que, que ça te plaise ou non, tu es marié avec moi. Au lieu d'un gâteau de mariage, on peut avoir une gaufre de mariage."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2979
translate french c30s006_kat_01709959:

    # kat "You may kiss the bride."
    kat "Tu peux embrasser la mariée."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2981
translate french c30s006_kat_0368d6c1:

    # kat "If you accept... of course..."
    kat "Si tu acceptes... bien sûr..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2983
translate french c30s006_kat_6fac804f:

    # "It would never cross your mind to reject such a proposal from a woman as wonderful as [kat]."
    "Il ne te viendrait jamais à l'esprit de rejeter une telle proposition venant d'une femme aussi merveilleuse que [kat]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2984
translate french c30s006_kat_eeefc345:

    # "You seal your future with a kiss as tender as it is passionate."
    "Tu scelles ton avenir par un baiser aussi tendre que passionné."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2985
translate french c30s006_kat_bee7b5f0:

    # "You could never have imagined it would end up like this when that girl with purple-dyed hair showed up at the airport."
    "Tu n'aurais jamais pu imaginer que ça finirait comme ça quand cette fille aux cheveux teints en violet s'est pointée à l'aéroport."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2987
translate french c30s006_kat_3b333f01:

    # mc "Of course I accept. Proposing to me... or declaring yourself my wife... with a waffle is... too sweet."
    mc "Bien sûr que j'accepte. Me demander en mariage... ou te déclarer ma femme... avec une gaufre, c'est... trop mignon."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2988
translate french c30s006_kat_5d49cda6:

    # kat "*Laugh* My God! I'm getting hungry just thinking about it. Remember that I eat when I get nervous..."
    kat "*Rire* Mon Dieu ! J'ai faim rien que d'y penser. N'oublie pas que je mange quand je suis nerveuse..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2989
translate french c30s006_kat_81d388b2:

    # mc "You don't have to be nervous about anything, honey. You're my wife now and that's never going to change."
    mc "Tu n'as pas à être nerveuse pour quoi que ce soit, chérie. Tu es ma femme maintenant et ça ne changera jamais."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2991
translate french c30s006_kat_9a64b041:

    # kat "I guess it would be a bit hard to find a judge to divorce us considering how the wedding went, right?"
    kat "J'imagine que ce serait un peu difficile de trouver un juge pour nous divorcer vu comment le mariage s'est passé, pas vrai ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2992
translate french c30s006_kat_5be526a0:

    # mc "I have no interest in looking for that judge, so we'll never know."
    mc "Je n'ai aucune envie de chercher ce juge, donc on ne le saura jamais."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3000
translate french c30s006_kat_3d9abbf4:

    # mc "Now all we need is to have our wedding night, right?"
    mc "Maintenant, tout ce qu'il nous reste à faire, c'est notre nuit de noces, n'est-ce pas ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3001
translate french c30s006_kat_ef4072c2:

    # kat "There will be time for that, though I won't deny I'm nervous about it."
    kat "On aura le temps pour ça, même si je ne vais pas nier que ça me rend nerveuse."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3002
translate french c30s006_kat_25973b5a:

    # mc "*Laugh* Don't worry, I'll make sure there are waffles next to the bed."
    mc "*Rires* Ne t'inquiète pas, je m'assurerai qu'il y ait des gaufres à côté du lit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3004
translate french c30s006_kat_5926bcb6:

    # kat "*Laugh* You're an asshole."
    kat "*Rires* T'es vraiment un connard."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3005
translate french c30s006_kat_6fa4c0db:

    # mc "*Laugh* I don't know if that says anything good about you. You just married me."
    mc "*Rires* Je ne sais pas si ça dit quoi que ce soit de bon sur toi. Tu viens juste de m'épouser."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3009
translate french c30s006_kat_eb3948e7:

    # kat "But I'm not the last girl you have to visit today, so the waffle next to the bed will have to wait."
    kat "Mais je ne suis pas la dernière fille que tu dois visiter aujourd'hui, donc la gaufre à côté du lit devra attendre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3010
translate french c30s006_kat_05ebc871:

    # mc "That means I have to go with Jamaal again, right?"
    mc "Ça veut dire que je dois encore y aller avec Jamaal, c'est ça ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3011
translate french c30s006_kat_dc1dc22f:

    # kat "Unless you want the next girl to come and kill me, yes."
    kat "À moins que tu veuilles que la prochaine fille vienne me tuer, oui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3013

    # "You kiss [kat] again before heading to where Jamaal is waiting for you."
    "Tu embrasses [kat] à nouveau avant de te diriger vers l'endroit où Jamaal t'attend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3015
translate french c30s006_kat_e7501f51:

    # kat "But we have to go see Aunt [bet] and [mee], so the waffle next to the bed will have to wait."
    kat "Mais on doit aller voir tante [bet] et [mee], donc la gaufre à côté du lit devra attendre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3016
translate french c30s006_kat_5d9f46bf:

    # mc "That means this ends here for now, right?"
    mc "Ça veut dire que ça s'arrête là pour le moment, c'est ça ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3017
translate french c30s006_kat_36a8567e:

    # kat "Unless you want two old ladies to come and kill me, yeah."
    kat "À moins que tu ne veuilles que deux vieilles dames viennent me tuer, ouais."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3021
translate french c30s006_kat_57bf7dac:

    # "You kiss [kat] again before heading to where the party is."
    "Tu embrasses [kat] à nouveau avant de te diriger vers la fête."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3022
translate french c30s006_kat_641410ce:

    # "Knowing that [kat] is already thinking about the wedding night is almost a surprise."
    "Savoir que [kat] pense déjà à la nuit de noces est presque une surprise."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3023
translate french c30s006_kat_66390b64:

    # "Although having discovered the effect your kisses on her neck have, the surprise is less than it would have been a few days ago."
    "Bien qu'ayant découvert l'effet que tes baisers dans son cou ont sur elle, la surprise est moindre qu'elle ne l'aurait été il y a quelques jours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3028
translate french c30s006_sam_ed654bf6:

    # "Jamaal accompanies you to where [sam] is."
    "Jamaal t'accompagne là où se trouve [sam]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3030
translate french c30s006_sam_a144cab5:

    # jam "She's my mother, so I'll run you over if you do anything stupid."
    jam "C'est ma mère, alors je t'écrase si tu fais une connerie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3032
translate french c30s006_sam_c804c698:

    # mc "Don't worry. I won't."
    mc "T'inquiète pas. Je ne ferai rien."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3033
translate french c30s006_sam_ede396d7:

    # mc "But I have a question, is there any order to the girls you're taking me to?"
    mc "Mais j'ai une question, y a-t-il un ordre pour les filles vers lesquelles tu m'emmènes ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3035
translate french c30s006_sam_7351a00f:

    # jam "I decide the order based on which of them are ready when you come back to me."
    jam "Je décide de l'ordre en fonction de celles qui sont prêtes quand tu reviens me voir."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3036
translate french c30s006_sam_d0c0c656:

    # jam "Though some of them have asked for a specific position on the list."
    jam "Même si certaines d'entre elles ont demandé une place précise sur la liste."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3039
translate french c30s006_sam_87e8a84c:

    # jam "*Laugh* After my mom, maybe I'll let you pick the next one. Maybe."
    jam "*Rires* Après ma mère, je te laisserai peut-être choisir la suivante. Peut-être."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3040
translate french c30s006_sam_d868b8b4:

    # jam "I promise. If there's more than one girl ready, of course."
    jam "Je te le promets. S'il y a plus d'une fille prête, bien sûr."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3041
translate french c30s006_sam_75a96f00:

    # jam "*Laugh* I swear I couldn't make my mom wait any longer."
    jam "*Rires* Je te jure que je ne pouvais plus faire attendre ma mère."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3042
translate french c30s006_sam_a99e4942:

    # mc "I get it. She'd ground you and not let you have any pastries for a couple of weeks."
    mc "Je comprends. Elle te punirait et te priverait de pâtisseries pendant quelques semaines."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3044
translate french c30s006_sam_866fe3e7:

    # mc "Don't worry. I won't make her wait, even though I don't know what this is all about."
    mc "T'inquiète pas. Je ne la ferai pas attendre, même si je ne sais pas de quoi il s'agit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3055
translate french c30s006_sam_b637596d:

    # mc "You look gorgeous, [sam.nick]."
    mc "Tu es magnifique, [sam.nick]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3056
translate french c30s006_sam_88596a41:

    # sam "Thanks, [mc]. The occasion called for it."
    sam "Merci, [mc]. L'occasion l'exigeait."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3058
translate french c30s006_sam_5ae625dc:

    # mc "I'm guessing I'm supposed to see a tattoo, right?"
    mc "J'imagine que je suis censé voir un tatouage, c'est ça ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3060
translate french c30s006_sam_61922772:

    # sam "You guess right. It was tough to decide what to get tattooed, though. I feel like I've known you forever."
    sam "Tu imagines bien. Ça a été dur de décider quoi me faire tatouer, par contre. J'ai l'impression de te connaître depuis toujours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3061
translate french c30s006_sam_226b0425:

    # mc "I wouldn't know what to pick either. We've been through so much together that..."
    mc "Je ne saurais pas quoi choisir non plus. On a traversé tellement de choses ensemble que..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3063
translate french c30s006_sam_73c7a7d6:

    # sam "Exactly. *Laugh* And getting a tattoo of a tub of ointment for your bruises didn't seem right."
    sam "Exactement. *Rires* Et me faire tatouer un pot de pommade pour tes bleus ne me semblait pas très approprié."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3064
translate french c30s006_sam_ffb0d457:

    # sam "Even though it all started then, your bruises aren't something I want to remember."
    sam "Même si tout a commencé à ce moment-là, tes bleus ne sont pas quelque chose dont je veux me souvenir."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3065
translate french c30s006_sam_c77936f6:

    # mc "*Laugh* Totally understandable. Surprise me."
    mc "*Rires* Totalement compréhensible. Surprends-moi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3068
translate french c30s006_sam_c79ab70b:

    # mc "What's this about, [sam.nick]? What do you want to talk to me about?"
    mc "C'est à quel sujet, [sam.nick] ? De quoi tu veux me parler ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3070
translate french c30s006_sam_d2794059:

    # sam "You know I've known you for what seems like forever..."
    sam "Tu sais que je te connais depuis ce qui me semble être une éternité..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3071
translate french c30s006_sam_9d40879e:

    # mc "I know..."
    mc "Je sais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3073
translate french c30s006_sam_1e07a5a5:

    # sam "*Laugh* Okay, that wasn't the right way to start."
    sam "*Rires* Ok, ce n'était pas la bonne façon de commencer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3074
translate french c30s006_sam_dfdae274:

    # sam "I mean we've known each other for many years, but in the last few weeks our relationship has changed a lot."
    sam "Je veux dire, on se connaît depuis des années, mais ces dernières semaines, notre relation a beaucoup changé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3075
translate french c30s006_sam_d699e29d:

    # mc "It's changed for the better, I'd say."
    mc "Pour le mieux, je dirais."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3077
translate french c30s006_sam_144d13e1:

    # sam "Yeah. It's something I couldn't have imagined, but you've brought a new... spark... to my life."
    sam "Ouais. C'est quelque chose que je n'aurais pas pu imaginer, mais tu as apporté une nouvelle... étincelle... dans ma vie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3079
translate french c30s006_sam_cf4c3dba:

    # sam "I wanted to do something before you left for Aruba."
    sam "Je voulais faire quelque chose avant que tu partes pour Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3081
translate french c30s006_sam_47a785e2:

    # sam "The girls in the harem wanted to do something before you left for Aruba."
    sam "Les filles du harem voulaient faire quelque chose avant que tu partes pour Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3082
translate french c30s006_sam_607dddd4:

    # mc "Do you realize you're beating around the bush without telling me anything?"
    mc "Tu te rends compte que tu tournes autour du pot sans rien me dire ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3084
translate french c30s006_sam_92cf1fe1:

    # sam "*Laugh* You're so impatient!"
    sam "*Rire* Tu es tellement impatient !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3085
translate french c30s006_sam_206eb73f:

    # mc "*Laugh* No, I'm just curious. You've got me on edge with all this beating around the bush."
    mc "*Rire* Non, je suis juste curieux. Tu me rends dingue à tourner autour du pot comme ça."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3087
translate french c30s006_sam_cb939cdd:

    # sam "With these rings, I declare myself your fiancée and your wife."
    sam "Avec ces bagues, je me déclare ta fiancée et ta femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3089
translate french c30s006_sam_6800f0ac:

    # mc "What? I love it! Though I would've liked to be the one to propose."
    mc "Quoi ? J'adore ! Même si j'aurais aimé être celui qui fait la demande."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3091
translate french c30s006_sam_b8126e29:

    # mc "Two rings instead of one? I love it! Though I would've liked to be the one to propose."
    mc "Deux bagues au lieu d'une ? J'adore ! Même si j'aurais aimé être celui qui fait la demande."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3093
translate french c30s006_sam_8804adcf:

    # sam "Since you weren't asking me to be your fiancée, I had to take the step myself."
    sam "Puisque tu ne me demandais pas d'être ta fiancée, j'ai dû faire le premier pas moi-même."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3095
translate french c30s006_sam_13f306ac:

    # sam "And once you told [mar] that she was your wife, the next step was clear."
    sam "Et une fois que tu as dit à [mar] qu'elle était ta femme, la prochaine étape était claire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3096
translate french c30s006_sam_39f74a24:

    # mc "I'm glad you took the step. Can I kiss my wife?"
    mc "Je suis content que tu aies fait le premier pas. Je peux embrasser ma femme ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3098
translate french c30s006_sam_b85eb229:

    # "You both know that's a rhetorical question. You sealed your fate a long time ago."
    "Vous savez tous les deux que c'est une question rhétorique. Tu as scellé ton destin il y a longtemps."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3099
translate french c30s006_sam_ffda13c6:

    # "The kiss with [sam] tastes slightly different this time. It's the first time you're kissing her as your wife."
    "Le baiser avec [sam] a une saveur légèrement différente cette fois. C'est la première fois que tu l'embrasses en tant que ta femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3100
translate french c30s006_sam_3c2af9a5:

    # "Not only does it taste different. It also feels too short when your lips start to part. But that's normal whenever you kiss [sam]."
    "Non seulement sa saveur est différente. Il semble aussi trop court quand vos lèvres commencent à se séparer. Mais c'est normal à chaque fois que tu embrasses [sam]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3110
translate french c30s006_sam_8bbfd658:

    # sam "You know I'll never say I hate my son, and as a rule I don't, but right now..."
    sam "Tu sais que je ne dirai jamais que je déteste mon fils, et en règle générale ce n'est pas le cas, mais là tout de suite..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3111
translate french c30s006_sam_d9da0db4:

    # mc "*Laugh* In this case he's just the messenger."
    mc "*Rires* Dans ce cas, il n'est que le messager."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3113
translate french c30s006_sam_05dcd112:

    # sam "*Laugh* I know. And it wasn't even his idea, so I won't punish him with no pastries."
    sam "*Rires* Je sais. Et ce n'était même pas son idée, alors je ne le punirai pas en le privant de pâtisseries."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3114
translate french c30s006_sam_5695adb9:

    # mc "Your revenge could be really harsh when he brings Anthony home and you only make pastries for him."
    mc "Ta vengeance pourrait être vraiment cruelle quand il ramènera Anthony à la maison et que tu ne feras des pâtisseries que pour lui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3115
translate french c30s006_sam_7e5a1b71:

    # sam "*Laugh* You're cruel to my son! But I like the idea..."
    sam "*Rires* Tu es cruel avec mon fils ! Mais j'aime l'idée..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3116
translate french c30s006_sam_8f902589:

    # mc "Well, as hard as it is to tear myself away from you, I think it's time for me to go."
    mc "Eh bien, aussi dur que ce soit de m'arracher à toi, je crois qu'il est temps pour moi d'y aller."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3120
translate french c30s006_sam_625c9207:

    # "You share one last kiss... for now."
    "Vous partagez un dernier baiser... pour l'instant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3122
translate french c30s006_sam_5ca2a104:

    # "It's shorter than either of you would like. Neither of you wants to see Jamaal impatient."
    "Il est plus court que vous ne le voudriez tous les deux. Aucun de vous ne veut voir Jamaal s'impatienter."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3124
translate french c30s006_sam_e81c45ad:

    # "It's shorter than either of you would like. You both know they're waiting for you to start the party."
    "C'est plus court que ce que vous auriez voulu tous les deux. Vous savez tous les deux qu'ils n'attendent que vous pour commencer la fête."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3129
translate french c30s006_eri_7ff68955:

    # jam "Well, the next girl is your favorite goth."
    jam "Eh bien, la prochaine fille est ta gothique préférée."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3131
translate french c30s006_eri_97ce6f11:

    # "Jamaal walks you over to where [eri] is."
    "Jamaal t'accompagne jusqu'à l'endroit où se trouve [eri]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3142
translate french c30s006_eri_348e7084:

    # mc "You look gorgeous, [eri]. And I suppose I have a tattoo to see, right?"
    mc "Tu es magnifique, [eri]. Et je suppose que j'ai un tatouage à voir, pas vrai ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3143
translate french c30s006_eri_9814907f:

    # eri "I would have liked to be the first to see your surprised face. It loses a bit of fun this way."
    eri "J'aurais aimé être la première à voir ton visage surpris. Ça gâche un peu le plaisir comme ça."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3144
translate french c30s006_eri_fecc4def:

    # mc "Can I say something before you show me the tattoo?"
    mc "Je peux dire quelque chose avant que tu me montres le tatouage ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3147
translate french c30s006_eri_3710895c:

    # mc "Can I say something before whatever you have to tell me?"
    mc "Je peux dire quelque chose avant ce que tu as à me dire ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3148
translate french c30s006_eri_12700803:

    # eri "Of course."
    eri "Bien sûr."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3150
translate french c30s006_eri_276ac219:

    # mc "[eri] Marks, will you marry me?"
    mc "[eri] Marks, veux-tu m'épouser ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3151
translate french c30s006_eri_39447b64:

    # eri "What? Where did you get that ring from?"
    eri "Quoi ? D'où tu sors cette bague ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3152
translate french c30s006_eri_40628261:

    # mc "*Laugh* From my pocket. But are you going to answer?"
    mc "*Rires* De ma poche. Mais tu vas répondre ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3153
translate french c30s006_eri_d1610f3e:

    # eri "Of course I will!"
    eri "Bien sûr que oui !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3155
translate french c30s006_eri_4acff324:

    # "You stand up and melt into a kiss that conveys everything needed in a moment like this."
    "Tu te lèves et te fonds dans un baiser qui exprime tout ce qui est nécessaire dans un moment comme celui-ci."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3156
translate french c30s006_eri_287611f5:

    # "It's not one of those kisses that start on the lips of the mouth and end on other lips. It's not a sexual kiss."
    "Ce n'est pas un de ces baisers qui commencent sur les lèvres de la bouche et finissent sur d'autres lèvres. Ce n'est pas un baiser sexuel."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3157
translate french c30s006_eri_41303dfa:

    # "It's a kiss that conveys all the love you have for each other."
    "C'est un baiser qui exprime tout l'amour que vous vous portez."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3159
translate french c30s006_eri_c1271ea3:

    # eri "How long have you had this ring?"
    eri "Depuis combien de temps as-tu cette bague ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3160
translate french c30s006_eri_4ee4a6be:

    # mc "A little over a week. But I haven't found the chance to give it to you."
    mc "Un peu plus d'une semaine. Mais je n'avais pas trouvé l'occasion de te la donner."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3161
translate french c30s006_eri_82338b72:

    # mc "I would have given it to you when I went to fix the outlet, but I didn't have it on me that day."
    mc "Je te l'aurais donnée quand je suis allé réparer la prise, mais je ne l'avais pas sur moi ce jour-là."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3162
translate french c30s006_eri_debe06c5:

    # mc "It hasn't left my pocket since, at least when I have pockets."
    mc "Elle n'a pas quitté ma poche depuis, du moins quand j'ai des poches."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3164
translate french c30s006_eri_c108c3d2:

    # eri "It's beautiful. It matches the earrings and..."
    eri "Elle est magnifique. Elle est assortie aux boucles d'oreilles et..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3166
translate french c30s006_eri_bce4a262:

    # eri "*Laugh*"
    eri "*Rires*"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3167
translate french c30s006_eri_d4e260c9:

    # mc "What are you laughing at?"
    mc "Qu'est-ce qui te fait rire ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3169
translate french c30s006_eri_bd98b8fb:

    # mc "Did you get the earrings tattooed?"
    mc "Tu t'es fait tatouer les boucles d'oreilles ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3171
translate french c30s006_eri_3bada43b:

    # eri "With this triskelion, I declare myself your wife."
    eri "Avec ce triskèle, je me déclare ta femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3172
translate french c30s006_eri_b7e025d2:

    # eri "I was going to say your fiancée and your wife, but you made me your fiancée with the ring."
    eri "J'allais dire ta fiancée et ta femme, mais tu as fait de moi ta fiancée avec la bague."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3174
translate french c30s006_eri_16485396:

    # mc "I think you're almost the only one whose tattoo I could've guessed."
    mc "Je crois que tu es presque la seule dont j'aurais pu deviner le tatouage."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3175
translate french c30s006_eri_2c81c059:

    # mc "Though I don't know how you knew I was going to give you that ring."
    mc "Bien que je ne sache pas comment tu savais que j'allais t'offrir cette bague."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3177
translate french c30s006_eri_ca8405a1:

    # mc "What? Had you seen the ring before today? I love it!"
    mc "Quoi ? Tu avais vu la bague avant aujourd'hui ? J'adore !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3179
translate french c30s006_eri_7625aac1:

    # eri "It's not exactly the same. The triskelion is smaller on the tattoo than on the ring."
    eri "Ce n'est pas exactement pareil. Le triskèle est plus petit sur le tatouage que sur la bague."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3180
translate french c30s006_eri_1959a8b0:

    # eri "But when I had to choose a design for the tattoo, I knew exactly what I wanted. The triskelion represents evolution and change."
    eri "Mais quand j'ai dû choisir un motif pour le tatouage, je savais exactement ce que je voulais. Le triskèle représente l'évolution et le changement."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3181
translate french c30s006_eri_84f950af:

    # eri "You've changed me. And I hope that, from now on, we evolve together."
    eri "Tu m'as changée. Et j'espère qu'à partir de maintenant, nous évoluerons ensemble."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3182
translate french c30s006_eri_61aeb00b:

    # mc "It's a tattoo that makes a lot of sense. Something with meaning, like all your tattoos."
    mc "C'est un tatouage qui a beaucoup de sens. Quelque chose avec une signification, comme tous tes tatouages."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3184
translate french c30s006_eri_59bc3fd1:

    # eri "That tattoo is the only one I know I'll never get removed. I wanted it to mean something that's special to us."
    eri "Ce tatouage est le seul que je sais que je ne ferai jamais enlever. Je voulais qu'il signifie quelque chose de spécial pour nous."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3185
translate french c30s006_eri_87d13489:

    # eri "It's not just that it matches the earrings. It's that it represents us."
    eri "Ce n'est pas seulement que ça va avec les boucles d'oreilles. C'est que ça nous représente."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3186
translate french c30s006_eri_954cd86e:

    # mc "Can I kiss my wife? I've kissed my fiancée, but not my wife."
    mc "Est-ce que je peux embrasser ma femme ? J'ai embrassé ma fiancée, mais pas ma femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3188
translate french c30s006_eri_5374ecdc:

    # "The girl realizes she's rambling about the tattoo and decides to shut her mouth by pressing her lips against yours."
    "La fille réalise qu'elle divague sur le tatouage et décide de la fermer en pressant ses lèvres contre les tiennes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3189
translate french c30s006_eri_ded55c2b:

    # "You both knew you were destined for this since that first kiss that seems so long ago."
    "Vous saviez tous les deux que vous étiez destinés à ça depuis ce premier baiser qui semble si lointain."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3190
translate french c30s006_eri_bb5e0d25:

    # "This is your first kiss as husband and wife. Obviously, it won't be the last."
    "C'est votre premier baiser en tant que mari et femme. Évidemment, ce ne sera pas le dernier."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3192
translate french c30s006_eri_746022c3:

    # eri "I don't know about you, but to me this kiss tasted... different."
    eri "Je ne sais pas pour toi, mais pour moi, ce baiser avait un goût... différent."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3193
translate french c30s006_eri_fb6a6b99:

    # mc "I didn't notice any difference. You know that 'girlfriend', 'fiancée', or 'wife' are just labels."
    mc "Je n'ai remarqué aucune différence. Tu sais que 'petite amie', 'fiancée' ou 'femme' ne sont que des étiquettes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3194
translate french c30s006_eri_91585782:

    # mc "It hasn't changed how I feel about you at all. I doubt it ever will, except for loving you more every day."
    mc "Ça n'a pas du tout changé ce que je ressens pour toi. Je doute que ça change un jour, à part t'aimer un peu plus chaque jour."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3196
translate french c30s006_eri_4a8a836f:

    # mc "By the way..."
    mc "Au fait..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3199
translate french c30s006_eri_c2113220:

    # mc "I have no complaints about you getting the tattoo, but... what would have happened if I hadn't wanted you to get any more?"
    mc "Je n'ai rien contre le fait que tu te sois fait tatouer, mais... que se serait-il passé si je n'avais pas voulu que tu en fasses d'autres ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3200
translate french c30s006_eri_13f079c0:

    # eri "My skin, my choice. You accepted me with tattoos and one more wasn't going to change anything."
    eri "Ma peau, mon choix. Tu m'as acceptée avec des tatouages et un de plus n'allait rien changer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3201
translate french c30s006_eri_6e5a167b:

    # eri "As long as I didn't tattoo my entire body, I didn't think you'd mind."
    eri "Tant que je ne me tatouais pas tout le corps, je me suis dit que ça ne te dérangerait pas."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3202
translate french c30s006_eri_cae86b26:

    # mc "I don't mind. At least that one is ours. It has nothing to do with a past where you needed tattoos to support you."
    mc "Ça ne me dérange pas. Au moins, celui-là est à nous. Ça n'a rien à voir avec un passé où tu avais besoin de tatouages pour te soutenir."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3203
translate french c30s006_eri_d07838cf:

    # mc "Now I'm here to support you with whatever you need."
    mc "Maintenant, je suis là pour te soutenir dans tout ce dont tu as besoin."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3209
translate french c30s006_eri_bf3975b8:

    # eri "And now you're going to have to leave. The next girl is waiting for you, and you don't want to keep her waiting, do you?"
    eri "Et maintenant, tu vas devoir y aller. La prochaine fille t'attend, et tu ne veux pas la faire poireauter, n'est-ce pas ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3210
translate french c30s006_eri_316092bf:

    # mc "As eager as I am to see her, it sucks that our time ends here."
    mc "Aussi impatient que je sois de la voir, ça fait chier que notre moment s'arrête là."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3211
translate french c30s006_eri_3cfa4dd7:

    # eri "Only for now, honey. Come on, go before I have to kiss you again and Jamaal has to come looking for you."
    eri "Seulement pour l'instant, chéri. Allez, file avant que je doive t'embrasser à nouveau et que Jamaal doive venir te chercher."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3218
