translate french c30s006_deb_4c1d7ed7:

    # deb "I know it's not a ring or anything like that, but it means so much more to me."
    deb "Je sais que ce n'est pas une bague ou quoi que ce soit du genre, mais ça représente tellement plus pour moi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3406
translate french c30s006_deb_1e00f5b6:

    # mc "I love it. It certainly is a declaration of 'forever', or at least I hope so."
    mc "J'adore. C'est certainement une déclaration de 'pour toujours', ou du moins je l'espère."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3408
translate french c30s006_deb_dd5d27f1:

    # mc "What? I love it!"
    mc "Quoi ? J'adore !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3410
translate french c30s006_deb_2f490d44:

    # deb "For a moment I hesitated between the heart stone and the whirlpool flower, but the stone seemed more fitting."
    deb "Pendant un moment, j'ai hésité entre la pierre de cœur et la fleur de tourbillon, mais la pierre me semblait plus appropriée."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3411
translate french c30s006_deb_192cce28_1:

    # deb "Flowers wither or dry up, ending up crushed between the pages of a book."
    deb "Les fleurs se fanent ou se dessèchent, et finissent écrasées entre les pages d'un livre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3412
translate french c30s006_deb_2dae0f89_1:

    # deb "That's not what I want for us."
    deb "Ce n'est pas ce que je veux pour nous."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3413
translate french c30s006_deb_a8b19e90:

    # mc "I think the stone has a lot more symbolism for us and better reflects the concept of 'forever'."
    mc "Je pense que la pierre a beaucoup plus de symbolisme pour nous et reflète mieux le concept de 'pour toujours'."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3415
translate french c30s006_deb_47a0ea06:

    # "This time the kiss is just as tender, but it reflects more confidence."
    "Cette fois, le baiser est tout aussi tendre, mais il reflète plus de confiance."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3416
translate french c30s006_deb_cf5af8c8:

    # "You're sure that [deb.nick] had been doubting whether you'd reject her at the last moment."
    "Tu es sûr que [deb.nick] craignait que tu la rejettes au dernier moment."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3417
translate french c30s006_deb_6d086e15:

    # "Her insecurity, although unnecessary, is part of her charm."
    "Son manque d'assurance, bien qu'inutile, fait partie de son charme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3419
translate french c30s006_deb_1287a13c:

    # deb "I have to apologize to you..."
    deb "Je dois te présenter mes excuses..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3420
translate french c30s006_deb_9e445bce:

    # mc "Why? It was really beautiful."
    mc "Pourquoi ? C'était vraiment magnifique."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3421
translate french c30s006_deb_6846fa25:

    # deb "Not for this, but... do you remember the other day at the pool?"
    deb "Pas pour ça, mais... tu te souviens de l'autre jour à la piscine ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3422
translate french c30s006_deb_71b6e6cc:

    # mc "When you said you couldn't swim because you were bleeding?"
    mc "Quand tu as dit que tu ne pouvais pas nager parce que tu saignais ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3424
translate french c30s006_deb_5855f050:

    # deb "Yeah... Between [dap] and [sca], they made you think it was... another type of bleeding. And I didn't do anything to stop it."
    deb "Ouais... Entre [dap] et [sca], elles t'ont fait croire que c'était... un autre type de saignement. Et je n'ai rien fait pour les arrêter."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3425
translate french c30s006_deb_219d551b:

    # mc "There's nothing like talking about periods to make us guys shut up."
    mc "Y a rien de tel que de parler de règles pour faire fermer leur gueule aux mecs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3426
translate french c30s006_deb_345c88b4:

    # mc "It was because of the tattoo, right?"
    mc "C'était à cause du tatouage, c'est ça ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3428
translate french c30s006_deb_951c72a8:

    # deb "Yeah. It got a little infected and the scab fell off. We didn't lie, but we made you think that..."
    deb "Ouais. Ça s'est un peu infecté et la croûte est tombée. On n'a pas menti, mais on t'a fait croire que..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3429
translate french c30s006_deb_d38ceb6d:

    # mc "I get it. If you guys had told me the truth, it would've ruined the surprise."
    mc "Je capte. Si vous m'aviez dit la vérité, ça aurait gâché la surprise."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3430
translate french c30s006_deb_9a610033:

    # mc "But it doesn't matter, I've played that game, making someone believe something without saying it, way too many times to be offended."
    mc "Mais c'est pas grave, j'ai joué à ce jeu, faire croire un truc à quelqu'un sans le dire, bien trop de fois pour être vexé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3434
translate french c30s006_deb_573b867d:

    # "[deb.nick] leans over you, putting her lips right next to your ear."
    "[deb.nick] se penche sur toi, plaçant ses lèvres juste à côté de ton oreille."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3435
translate french c30s006_deb_79d8a6f8:

    # deb "Besides, for nine months I won't be having that... other kind of bleeding."
    deb "En plus, pendant neuf mois, je n'aurai pas cet... autre type de saignement."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3436
translate french c30s006_deb_901e993c:

    # mc "What? You're pregnant? How? When?"
    mc "Quoi ? T'es enceinte ? Comment ? Quand ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3438
translate french c30s006_deb_7171009f:

    # deb "Yes! You already know the 'how'. But if you mean when I found out, it was when [ama] took the tests."
    deb "Oui ! Tu sais déjà le 'comment'. Mais si tu veux dire quand je l'ai découvert, c'est quand [ama] a fait les tests."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3439
translate french c30s006_deb_85be953c:

    # deb "We couldn't tell you we were going to do it. Are you disappointed we didn't look at it together?"
    deb "On ne pouvait pas te dire qu'on allait le faire. T'es déçu qu'on n'ait pas regardé ensemble ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3440
translate french c30s006_deb_0dda1c77:

    # mc "Disappointed? I'm thrilled with the result! What about you? Are you happy? Your swimming career..."
    mc "Déçue ? Je suis ravi du résultat ! Et toi ? Tu es heureuse ? Ta carrière de nageuse..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3441
translate french c30s006_deb_32757cfd:

    # "The words stumble out of your mouth. You want to ask too many questions at once."
    "Les mots se bousculent dans ta bouche. Tu veux poser trop de questions à la fois."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3443
translate french c30s006_deb_b827ed6e:

    # deb "Don't worry about my career right now. Yes. I'm happy. Very much so."
    deb "Ne t'inquiète pas pour ma carrière pour le moment. Oui. Je suis heureuse. Vraiment très heureuse."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3444
translate french c30s006_deb_c16cf036:

    # deb "I didn't know how I'd feel if it came back positive or negative. While I was waiting for the test to beep, I realized I wanted to see a positive."
    deb "Je ne savais pas comment je réagirais s'il était positif ou négatif. Pendant que j'attendais que le test sonne, j'ai réalisé que je voulais voir un positif."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3445
translate french c30s006_deb_9c2cf527:

    # mc "Can I kiss my wife and the mother of my children?"
    mc "Je peux embrasser ma femme et la mère de mes enfants ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3447
translate french c30s006_deb_2badb92d:

    # "She doesn't need to answer. At least not with words."
    "Elle n'a pas besoin de répondre. Du moins pas avec des mots."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3448
translate french c30s006_deb_473bd0aa:

    # "The kiss conveys happiness, relief, and a security that [deb.nick] has never had before."
    "Le baiser transmet du bonheur, du soulagement et une sécurité que [deb.nick] n'a jamais eue auparavant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3449
translate french c30s006_deb_8d402a86:

    # "You think she's going to be a great mother. She's already a great wife."
    "Tu penses qu'elle fera une mère formidable. C'est déjà une épouse fantastique."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3451
translate french c30s006_deb_9340ffca:

    # mc "We're not going to have a honeymoon..."
    mc "On ne va pas avoir de lune de miel..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3453
translate french c30s006_deb_b53925ce:

    # mc "And we won't be able to celebrate the baby properly..."
    mc "Et on ne pourra pas fêter l'arrivée du bébé correctement..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3454
translate french c30s006_deb_4f34cd82:

    # deb "There will be time for that and for all the celebrations we want. Remember, a stone is forever."
    deb "Il y aura du temps pour ça et pour toutes les célébrations qu'on voudra. N'oublie pas, une pierre c'est pour toujours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3455
translate french c30s006_deb_6e1f720f:

    # deb "And I hope to be a stone for you for the rest of your life. Even if that sounds awful."
    deb "Et j'espère être une pierre pour toi pour le reste de ta vie. Même si ça sonne affreux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3456
translate french c30s006_deb_602c387f:

    # mc "*Laugh* You know a diamond is a stone, right?"
    mc "*Rires* Tu sais qu'un diamant est une pierre, pas vrai ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3459
translate french c30s006_deb_4a8a836f:

    # mc "By the way..."
    mc "Au fait..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3467
translate french c30s006_deb_5ada139a:

    # deb "You should go back to Jam now. There's another girl waiting for you."
    deb "Tu devrais retourner voir Jam maintenant. Il y a une autre fille qui t'attend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3468
translate french c30s006_deb_1c9e7866:

    # mc "You're not going to leave me any time to enjoy this, are you?"
    mc "Tu ne vas pas me laisser le temps d'en profiter, pas vrai ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3470
translate french c30s006_deb_0099bef5:

    # deb "*Laugh* It's your fault for having a harem."
    deb "*Rires* C'est de ta faute si tu as un harem."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3471
translate french c30s006_deb_fba7313c:

    # mc "*Laugh* If you put it that way..."
    mc "*Rires* Vu comme ça..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3472
translate french c30s006_deb_2dba3b62:

    # deb "And I'm very happy to belong to that harem. *Giggles* Even if it has a few downsides."
    deb "Et je suis très heureuse d'appartenir à ce harem. *Gloussements* Même s'il a quelques inconvénients."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3473
translate french c30s006_deb_2a6778d6:

    # mc "See you later, gorgeous."
    mc "À plus tard, ma belle."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3475
translate french c30s006_deb_a8cffeed:

    # "You share one last kiss as a temporary goodbye. Like [deb.nick] said, there's another girl waiting for you."
    "Vous partagez un dernier baiser en guise d'au revoir temporaire. Comme l'a dit [deb.nick], il y a une autre fille qui t'attend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3479
translate french c30s006_deb_e7cf6289:

    # "You share one last kiss as a temporary goodbye. You have to join the welcome party."
    "Vous partagez un dernier baiser en guise d'au revoir temporaire. Tu dois rejoindre la fête de bienvenue."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3483
translate french c30s006_oma_ed664fb5:

    # "Jamaal walks you to the stairs of [nor]'s jacuzzi."
    "Jamaal t'accompagne jusqu'aux escaliers du jacuzzi de [nor]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3484
translate french c30s006_oma_0cef4413:

    # "[oma] is waiting for you upstairs, motioning for you to follow her."
    "[oma] t'attend en haut et te fait signe de la suivre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3498
translate french c30s006_oma_a8f8a0e4:

    # mc "Hello, Officer. I'm here to file a report. Looking that beautiful must be a crime."
    mc "Bonjour, officier. Je suis ici pour déposer une plainte. Être aussi belle devrait être un crime."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3500
translate french c30s006_oma_2b0d6442:

    # mc "Can I report you? Looking that beautiful must be a crime."
    mc "Je peux porter plainte contre toi ? Être aussi belle devrait être un crime."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3502
translate french c30s006_oma_ca40571d:

    # oma "*Laugh* You're an idiot. You know that, right?"
    oma "*Rires* T'es vraiment un idiot. Tu le sais, n'est-ce pas ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3503
translate french c30s006_oma_fdc7cf93:

    # mc "*Laugh* What I know is that you girls spend too much time with [kia] and [eil]. Eventually you'll forget my name and all call me 'idiot'."
    mc "*Rires* Ce que je sais, c'est que vous passez trop de temps avec [kia] et [eil] les filles. Vous finirez par oublier mon prénom et m'appellerez toutes 'idiot'."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3505
translate french c30s006_oma_aed7e532:

    # oma "That wouldn't be bad. I could ask [emm], 'have you seen my idiot husband?'"
    oma "Ce ne serait pas si mal. Je pourrais demander à [emm] : 'tu as vu mon idiot de mari ?'"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3507
translate french c30s006_oma_f1cd029d:

    # mc "Which brings us to the tattoo, right? I can't wait to see what you got tattooed."
    mc "Ce qui nous amène au tatouage, pas vrai ? J'ai hâte de voir ce que tu t'es fait tatouer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3510
translate french c30s006_oma_8f2c865f:

    # mc "*Laugh* Your husband? When did we get married?"
    mc "*Rires* Ton mari ? Quand est-ce qu'on s'est mariés ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3512
translate french c30s006_oma_c95c2f7c:

    # oma "Now."
    oma "Maintenant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3513
translate french c30s006_oma_740c7447:

    # oma "With this ring I declare myself your wife. Now and forever."
    oma "Avec cette bague, je me déclare ta femme. Maintenant et pour toujours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3514
translate french c30s006_oma_c6d7744c:

    # oma "Besides, in Spanish the word 'esposa', wife, is the same for the wife you marry and the handcuffs you get arrested with."
    oma "D'ailleurs, en espagnol, le mot 'esposa', épouse, est le même pour la femme que tu épouses et les menottes avec lesquelles tu te fais arrêter."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3516
translate french c30s006_oma_d29f9324:

    # mc "I love it! But... a crab?"
    mc "J'adore ! Mais... un crabe ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3518
translate french c30s006_oma_8c2e880e:

    # mc "What? Are you asking me to marry you?"
    mc "Quoi ? Tu me demandes de t'épouser ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3519
translate french c30s006_oma_96d567c2:

    # oma "No. I'm informing you that you're married to me."
    oma "Non. Je t'informe que tu es marié avec moi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3520
translate french c30s006_oma_5045b71d:

    # mc "But are we marrying with a crab as a ring?"
    mc "Mais on se marie avec un crabe en guise d'alliance ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3522
translate french c30s006_oma_e6383646:

    # oma "Don't you remember?"
    oma "Tu ne te souviens pas ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3523
translate french c30s006_oma_ac2c3dba:

    # mc "That I confused Krav Maga with a crab because of how you pronounced it? Of course I do."
    mc "Que j'ai confondu le Krav Maga avec un crabe à cause de ta façon de le prononcer ? Bien sûr que si."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3525
translate french c30s006_oma_e94144fd:

    # oma "That day, everything started between us. It's a day I never want to forget, and I think it's something unique."
    oma "Ce jour-là, tout a commencé entre nous. C'est un jour que je ne veux jamais oublier, et je trouve que c'est quelque chose d'unique."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3527
translate french c30s006_oma_4ed9aef1:

    # oma "Cuando empezamos a hablar del tatuaje, es en lo primero que pensé, con lo que seguí mi instinto. No se me ocurría nada mejor."
    oma "Quand on a commencé à parler du tatouage, c'est la première chose à laquelle j'ai pensé, alors j'ai suivi mon instinct."
    oma "Je ne pouvais rien imaginer qui nous représente mieux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3529
translate french c30s006_oma_d0074087:

    # oma "When I thought about what tattoo I wanted to get, it was the first thing that came to mind, so I followed my instinct."
    oma "Quand j'ai réfléchi au tatouage que je voulais faire, c'est la première chose qui m'est venue à l'esprit, alors j'ai suivi mon instinct."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3530
translate french c30s006_oma_37774ef0:

    # mc "I love the tattoo, and I love the symbolism, but... Can I kiss my wife now?"
    mc "J'adore le tatouage, et j'adore le symbolisme, mais... Je peux embrasser ma femme maintenant ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3532
translate french c30s006_oma_1f798cf0:

    # "You throw yourselves into each other's arms as your lips seek and find one another."
    "Vous vous jetez dans les bras l'un de l'autre alors que vos lèvres se cherchent et se trouvent."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3533
translate french c30s006_oma_672f1759:

    # "You both wanted this moment to come someday. You couldn't have imagined it would happen like this."
    "Vous vouliez tous les deux que ce moment arrive un jour. Vous n'auriez jamais imaginé que ça se passerait comme ça."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3534
translate french c30s006_oma_4919b0ce:

    # "In a way, you two had chosen each other for the rest of your lives, so this just means changing the label."
    "D'une certaine manière, vous vous étiez choisis pour le reste de votre vie, alors ça signifie juste changer d'étiquette."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3535
translate french c30s006_oma_a5040191:

    # "Sometimes you don't hate labels... too much."
    "Parfois, tu ne détestes pas les étiquettes... tant que ça."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3544
translate french c30s006_oma_ab1693cf:

    # mc "About what you said regarding the meaning of 'esposa' in Spanish..."
    mc "À propos de ce que tu as dit sur la signification de 'esposa' en espagnol..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3545
translate french c30s006_oma_eb72d3f0:

    # oma "Yeah..."
    oma "Ouais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3546
translate french c30s006_oma_223fd1c0:

    # mc "I think it makes a lot of sense. I'm going to be tied to you for life..."
    mc "Je trouve que c'est très logique. Je vais être lié à toi pour la vie..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3548
translate french c30s006_oma_8f2369eb:

    # oma "*Laugh* You better be. I'm Catholic and we don't get divorced."
    oma "*Rires* Tu as intérêt. Je suis catholique et on ne divorce pas."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3549
translate french c30s006_oma_30731ee9:

    # oma "*Laugh* And if you ever try to break us up, like by making dumb comments about being tied down, I'll dig up every last traffic ticket you have."
    oma "*Rires* Et si jamais tu essaies de nous séparer, genre en faisant des remarques à la con sur le fait d'être attaché, je déterrerai la moindre de tes contraventions."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3550
translate french c30s006_oma_bc101338:

    # mc "*Laugh* Don't worry. I won't try."
    mc "*Rires* T'inquiète pas. Je n'essaierai pas."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3553
translate french c30s006_oma_d1b3625d:

    # oma "But you should go now. There's another tattoo waiting to be discovered."
    oma "Mais tu devrais y aller maintenant. Il y a un autre tatouage qui attend d'être découvert."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3556
translate french c30s006_oma_c97008e2:

    # mc "Can I get one last kiss for the road?"
    mc "Je peux avoir un dernier baiser pour la route ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3558
translate french c30s006_oma_8873526b:

    # "You kiss in a way that tastes like a goodbye."
    "Vous vous embrassez d'une façon qui a le goût des adieux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3560
translate french c30s006_oma_a696cd8c:

    # "Neither of you wants the next girl to wait too long for you."
    "Aucun de vous ne veut que la prochaine fille t'attende trop longtemps."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3562
translate french c30s006_oma_e55373af:

    # "You both know that as soon as you join the party, you won't be able to be alone."
    "Vous savez tous les deux que dès que vous rejoindrez la fête, vous ne pourrez plus être seuls."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3566
translate french c30s006_eva_6321557e:

    # "Jamaal walks you to the thinking corner, where [eva] is waiting for you."
    "Jamaal t'accompagne jusqu'au coin réflexion, où [eva] t'attend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3580
translate french c30s006_eva_68a81cc2:

    # mc "We were right here yesterday, but the circumstances seem to have changed, haven't they?"
    mc "On était juste ici hier, mais les circonstances semblent avoir changé, n'est-ce pas ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3581
translate french c30s006_eva_717ffe5c:

    # eva "A little..."
    eva "Un peu..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3582
translate french c30s006_eva_02000dc2:

    # mc "Is something wrong, [eva]?"
    mc "Quelque chose ne va pas, [eva] ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3584
translate french c30s006_eva_12be9cc0:

    # mc "Yesterday you were sad, and today you seem angry."
    mc "Hier tu étais triste, et aujourd'hui tu as l'air en colère."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3585
translate french c30s006_eva_74430733:

    # eva "It makes sense that I'm angry."
    eva "C'est logique que je sois en colère."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3586
translate french c30s006_eva_609901a4:

    # mc "Explain to me why. I don't understand anything..."
    mc "Explique-moi pourquoi. Je ne comprends rien..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3588
translate french c30s006_eva_5fbe73c5:

    # mc "Didn't you want to get the tattoo?"
    mc "Tu ne voulais pas te faire tatouer ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3590
translate french c30s006_eva_4f644e19:

    # eva "Look. With this stupid tattoo I declare myself your wife."
    eva "Regarde. Avec ce tatouage à la con, je me déclare comme ta femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3592
translate french c30s006_eva_1ac3f3b1:

    # mc "What? I don't get it. Or why you're mad."
    mc "Quoi ? Je ne pige pas. Ni pourquoi tu es en colère."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3594
translate french c30s006_eva_f0bef838:

    # mc "I don't understand why you're mad."
    mc "Je ne comprends pas pourquoi tu es énervée."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3595
translate french c30s006_eva_30365316:

    # mc "And I don't get why the tattoo is stupid. I think it looks really cool."
    mc "Et je ne pige pas pourquoi le tatouage est stupide. Je trouve qu'il est vraiment cool."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3597
translate french c30s006_eva_b508e859:

    # eva "Because the tattoo doesn't make any sense. It only makes sense to me."
    eva "Parce que le tatouage n'a aucun sens. Il n'a de sens que pour moi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3598
translate french c30s006_eva_48efdd15:

    # mc "Well... you're the worn-out bullet? And... I'm the ring that... hugs you?... Right?"
    mc "Eh bien... tu es la balle usée ? Et... je suis l'anneau qui... t'enlace ?... C'est ça ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3600
translate french c30s006_eva_e13cd98d:

    # eva "You figured it out! More or less... And it's not a bullet. It's a cartridge. I'm going to have to keep teaching you."
    eva "Tu as deviné ! Plus ou moins... Et ce n'est pas une balle. C'est une cartouche. Je vais devoir continuer à t'apprendre des trucs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3601
translate french c30s006_eva_06294409:

    # mc "I don't care what it's called... Bullet or cartridge. To me it's called [eva] and I'm never going to get tired of hugging you."
    mc "Je m'en fous de comment ça s'appelle... Balle ou cartouche. Pour moi, ça s'appelle [eva] et je ne me lasserai jamais de te serrer dans mes bras."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3602
translate french c30s006_eva_fbfd66ad:

    # mc "And you were mad about that? Because I might not get the meaning of a tattoo?"
    mc "Et tu étais en colère pour ça ? Parce que je pourrais ne pas comprendre la signification d'un tatouage ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3604
translate french c30s006_eva_8f54f3e4:

    # eva "No. I'm mad because they told me I only have a few minutes to do this with you. I would've liked to have had more time, but..."
    eva "Non. Je suis en colère parce qu'ils m'ont dit que je n'avais que quelques minutes pour faire ça avec toi. J'aurais aimé avoir plus de temps, mais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3607
translate french c30s006_eva_fe2c5e10:

    # eva "The next girl is already waiting, and you can't keep her waiting."
    eva "La prochaine fille attend déjà, et tu ne peux pas la faire attendre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3609
translate french c30s006_eva_97aa1882:

    # eva "Aunt [bet] and [mee] are probably waiting for us already."
    eva "Tante [bet] et [mee] nous attendent probablement déjà."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3611
translate french c30s006_eva_4868bb8c:

    # eva "And you left me for last. Although if I had been the first, it would be another girl waiting instead of them."
    eva "Et tu m'as gardée pour la fin. Même si j'avais été la première, ce serait une autre fille qui attendrait à leur place."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3612
translate french c30s006_eva_5ba675cd:

    # mc "Then let's make the most of those minutes we have."
    mc "Alors profitons au maximum de ces minutes que nous avons."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3614
translate french c30s006_eva_88f174c9:

    # "You already have [eva] in your arms, so you kiss your wife sweetly."
    "Tu as déjà [eva] dans tes bras, alors tu embrasses tendrement ta femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3615
translate french c30s006_eva_c28e304c:

    # "You can feel with your lips how a smile appears on her mouth, definitely replacing her angry expression."
    "Tu peux sentir avec tes lèvres comment un sourire se dessine sur sa bouche, remplaçant définitivement son expression de colère."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3616
translate french c30s006_eva_77141af4:

    # "Yes, [eva] is a woman of many talents and she can smile while kissing."
    "Oui, [eva] est une femme aux multiples talents et elle peut sourire tout en embrassant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3618
translate french c30s006_eva_a7edb271:

    # mc "Do you think this is a good way to make the most of these minutes?"
    mc "Tu penses que c'est une bonne façon de profiter au maximum de ces minutes ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3619
translate french c30s006_eva_8231dd21:

    # eva "*Giggles* The best. Or almost..."
    eva "*Glousse* La meilleure. Ou presque..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3620
translate french c30s006_eva_f3b977fb:

    # mc "I guess now I have the answer to why you were wearing a wetsuit yesterday."
    mc "Je suppose que je sais maintenant pourquoi tu portais une combinaison hier."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3622
translate french c30s006_eva_cccee3f7:

    # eva "If I had worn a bikini you would have been able to see the tattoo."
    eva "Si j'avais porté un bikini, tu aurais pu voir le tatouage."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3624
translate french c30s006_eva_9db06e3b:

    # eva "Except for [dap] and [sca], I don't think you've seen any of our shoulders since Saturday. Some even before that."
    eva "À part [dap] et [sca], je ne crois pas que tu aies vu l'une de nos épaules depuis samedi. Certaines même avant ça."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3626
translate french c30s006_eva_c0a75ff7:

    # eva "I don't think you've seen any of our shoulders since Saturday. Some even before that."
    eva "Je ne crois pas que tu aies vu l'une de nos épaules depuis samedi. Certaines même avant ça."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3628
translate french c30s006_eva_fe84cbc3:

    # eva "Not even the ones who didn't get any tattoos. So, you wouldn't suspect the ones of anyone who did."
    eva "Même pas celles de celles qui n'ont pas fait de tatouage. Donc, tu ne pouvais pas te douter pour celles qui en ont fait."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3629
translate french c30s006_eva_a67e4ca8:

    # mc "Are you going to hurt me if I tell you I didn't notice? Well, except in your case, of course."
    mc "Tu vas me faire du mal si je te dis que je n'avais rien remarqué ? Enfin, sauf dans ton cas, bien sûr."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3631
translate french c30s006_eva_92976fa2:

    # eva "*Laugh* I won't hurt you because you noticed it on me. But you'd better not tell the others."
    eva "*Rire* Je ne te ferai pas de mal parce que tu l'as remarqué sur moi. Mais tu ferais bien de ne pas le dire aux autres."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3632
translate french c30s006_eva_be6cc02d:

    # mc "*Laugh* Well, now I have a wife who can defend me."
    mc "*Rire* Eh bien, maintenant j'ai une femme qui peut me défendre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3634
translate french c30s006_eva_6e664e3e:

    # "You kiss again. This time there's no change of expression on her lips. That smile is going to be permanently on her mouth for a long time."
    "Vous vous embrassez à nouveau. Cette fois, il n'y a aucun changement d'expression sur ses lèvres. Ce sourire va rester en permanence sur sa bouche pendant un long moment."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3635
translate french c30s006_eva_d9be54a8:

    # "Joy runs through you both as your tongues explore each other's mouths."
    "La joie vous envahit tous les deux alors que vos langues explorent la bouche de l'autre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3637
translate french c30s006_eva_e4fa82e5:

    # eva "It's still a good way to make the most of the minutes we've been given."
    eva "C'est quand même une bonne façon de profiter au maximum des minutes qui nous ont été accordées."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3639
translate french c30s006_eva_941685a7:

    # eva "But you should get going, or I won't be able to defend you from the next girl."
    eva "Mais tu devrais y aller, ou je ne pourrai pas te défendre contre la prochaine fille."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3641
translate french c30s006_eva_67847f41:

    # eva "But we should head to the party before Aunt [bet] and [mee] get mad."
    eva "Mais on devrait aller à la fête avant que Tante [bet] et [mee] ne se mettent en colère."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3642
translate french c30s006_eva_9d201223:

    # mc "Before we go, I want to tell you something."
    mc "Avant qu'on y aille, je veux te dire quelque chose."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3643
translate french c30s006_eva_1e373d1a:

    # mc "I promise you we'll have more than five minutes for our vow renewal."
    mc "Je te promets qu'on aura plus de cinq minutes pour le renouvellement de nos vœux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3645
translate french c30s006_eva_c01ce725:

    # eva "But that's in 10 years!"
    eva "Mais c'est dans 10 ans !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3646
translate french c30s006_eva_1f06ddb3:

    # mc "We can renew them when you come to Aruba. It's going to feel like a long time not seeing you for a month. Almost like 10 years passing."
    mc "On pourra les renouveler quand tu viendras à Aruba. Ça va me paraître long de ne pas te voir pendant un mois. Presque comme si 10 ans s'étaient écoulés."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3648
translate french c30s006_eva_4a8a836f:

    # mc "By the way..."
    mc "Au fait..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3656
translate french c30s006_eva_3b65869d:

    # eva "You should go now or I'm going to kiss you until Jamaal comes looking for you."
    eva "Tu devrais y aller maintenant, sinon je vais t'embrasser jusqu'à ce que Jamaal vienne te chercher."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3658
translate french c30s006_eva_f8f725b0:

    # eva "We should go now or I'm going to kiss you until they come looking for us."
    eva "On devrait y aller maintenant, sinon je vais t'embrasser jusqu'à ce qu'ils viennent nous chercher."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3659
translate french c30s006_eva_8659eac3:

    # eva "And I don't know if I could control myself to keep it just a kiss..."
    eva "Et je ne sais pas si je pourrais me contrôler pour m'en tenir à un simple baiser..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3660
translate french c30s006_eva_7586ba68:

    # mc "Then I guess it's for the best."
    mc "Alors je suppose que c'est pour le mieux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3662
translate french c30s006_eva_b067daa5:

    # "The moment you pull away from [eva], your arms feel empty."
    "Au moment où tu t'écartes de [eva], tes bras te semblent vides."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3663
translate french c30s006_eva_d1ca1244:

    # "You've been holding her since you figured out the meaning of the tattoo, and now you're missing something in your hands."
    "Tu la tenais depuis que tu avais compris la signification du tatouage, et maintenant, il te manque quelque chose entre les mains."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3667
translate french c30s006_kim_e72b83cb:

    # "Jamaal walks you to the pool, where [kim] is glowing."
    "Jamaal t'accompagne jusqu'à la piscine, où [kim] est rayonnante."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3681
translate french c30s006_kim_e6874455:

    # mc "Is it important? Jamaal has been very mysterious."
    mc "C'est important ? Jamaal a été très mystérieux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3682
translate french c30s006_kim_187719a7:

    # mc "By the way... You look gorgeous, [kim], but I guess I don't need to tell you that."
    mc "Au fait... Tu es magnifique, [kim], mais je suppose que je n'ai pas besoin de te le dire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3684
translate french c30s006_kim_4aff8088:

    # mc "You look gorgeous, [kim], but I guess I don't need to tell you that."
    mc "Tu es magnifique, [kim], mais je suppose que je n'ai pas besoin de te le dire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3685
translate french c30s006_kim_413926de:

    # kim "I like it when you tell me. I don't think I'll ever get tired of hearing you say it."
    kim "J'aime quand tu me le dis. Je ne pense pas que je me lasserai un jour de te l'entendre dire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3687
translate french c30s006_kim_be4c5371:

    # kim "And yes. It's important, at least to me. But nothing you need to worry too much about..."
    kim "Et oui. C'est important, du moins pour moi. Mais rien dont tu doives trop t'inquiéter..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3688
translate french c30s006_kim_f717eada:

    # mc "*Laugh* You're making it even more mysterious."
    mc "*Rires* Tu rends ça encore plus mystérieux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3691
translate french c30s006_kim_d417033d:

    # kim "Let's see how I explain this... Us girls have talked and we all want our relationships to move forward."
    kim "Voyons comment je peux expliquer ça... Nous les filles, on a discuté et on veut toutes que nos relations avancent."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3692
translate french c30s006_kim_4d408b09:

    # kim "Both the individual ones and the harem."
    kim "Aussi bien les relations individuelles que le harem."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3693
translate french c30s006_kim_36d46fc7:

    # kim "And I've decided I don't want to be your girlfriend anymore."
    kim "Et j'ai décidé que je ne voulais plus être ta petite amie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3694
translate french c30s006_kim_38df1f4c:

    # "It doesn't make much sense, but you notice she's nervous about something."
    "Ça n'a pas beaucoup de sens, mais tu remarques qu'elle est nerveuse à propos de quelque chose."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3696
translate french c30s006_kim_7eaa9a62:

    # kim "Let's see how I explain this... I don't want to be your girlfriend when you go to Aruba."
    kim "Voyons comment je peux expliquer ça... Je ne veux pas être ta petite amie quand tu iras à Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3697
translate french c30s006_kim_ff8d1273:

    # mc "Are you breaking up with me?"
    mc "Tu romps avec moi ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3699
translate french c30s006_kim_91b901e5:

    # kim "*Laugh* What? No! I just mean that I want to be something more than your girlfriend."
    kim "*Rire* Quoi ? Non ! Je veux juste dire que je veux être plus que ta petite amie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3702
translate french c30s006_kim_5789a106:

    # kim "It ruins the surprise a bit not being the first, right?"
    kim "Ça gâche un peu la surprise de ne pas être la première, non ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3703
translate french c30s006_kim_0d394afe:

    # mc "Well, depending on what you got tattooed, it could be a surprise."
    mc "Eh bien, selon ce que tu t'es fait tatouer, ça pourrait être une surprise."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3705
translate french c30s006_kim_03ab7395:

    # kim "*Laugh* You're right! What do you think I got tattooed?"
    kim "*Rire* Tu as raison ! Qu'est-ce que tu penses que je me suis fait tatouer ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3707
translate french c30s006_kim_5180b267:

    # mc "To be honest, I don't know what kind of ring could reflect us."
    mc "Pour être honnête, je ne sais pas quel genre de bague pourrait nous représenter."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3708
translate french c30s006_kim_55a2a7a5:

    # mc "If it wasn't a ring, I guess something related to a map."
    mc "Si ce n'était pas une bague, je dirais quelque chose en rapport avec une carte."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3710
translate french c30s006_kim_21ab5668:

    # mc "If it wasn't for [deb.nick] breaking the ring trend..."
    mc "Si [deb.nick] n'avait pas brisé la tendance des bagues..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3712
translate french c30s006_kim_127cba17:

    # mc "If it wasn't for [emm] and [kat] breaking the ring trend..."
    mc "Si [emm] et [kat] n'avaient pas brisé la tendance des bagues..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3714
translate french c30s006_kim_085ebe35:

    # mc "If it wasn't for [kat] breaking the ring trend..."
    mc "Si [kat] n'avait pas brisé la tendance des bagues..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3716
translate french c30s006_kim_56150f1e:

    # mc "If it wasn't for [emm] breaking the ring trend..."
    mc "Si [emm] n'avait pas brisé la mode des bagues..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3717
translate french c30s006_kim_44609472:

    # mc "I'd have no idea what you could have gotten tattooed."
    mc "Je n'aurais eu aucune idée de ce que tu aurais pu te faire tatouer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3718
translate french c30s006_kim_18a8460d:

    # mc "Once broken... I guess something related to a map."
    mc "Une fois brisée... J'imagine quelque chose en rapport avec une carte."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3719
translate french c30s006_kim_8e3b602a:

    # mc "Not a boat. That would surely bring back unpleasant memories."
    mc "Pas un bateau. Ça rappellerait sûrement de mauvais souvenirs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3721
translate french c30s006_kim_80d61114:

    # kim "With this compass, I declare myself your wife. This way you won't get lost on the map of my skin."
    kim "Avec cette boussole, je me déclare ta femme. Comme ça, tu ne te perdras pas sur la carte de ma peau."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3723
translate french c30s006_kim_9381ad11:

    # mc "What? My wife? I love it! And the tattoo is... so us..."
    mc "Quoi ? Ma femme ? J'adore ! Et le tatouage est... tellement nous..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3725
translate french c30s006_kim_3e056b5b:

    # mc "I love it! It's... so us..."
    mc "J'adore ! C'est... tellement nous..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3727
translate french c30s006_kim_e26b13b6:

    # kim "*Speaking fast* I wanted to say that, with the compass, you'd always find your way back to me, especially now that you're leaving..."
    kim "*Parlant vite* Je voulais dire qu'avec la boussole, tu retrouverais toujours ton chemin vers moi, surtout maintenant que tu pars..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3728
translate french c30s006_kim_b9f62b35:

    # kim "*Speaking fast* But then you'd have to have the compass and not me having it tattooed on my skin, and..."
    kim "*Parlant vite* Mais alors il faudrait que tu aies la boussole et pas que je l'aie tatouée sur ma peau, et..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3729
translate french c30s006_kim_f60cf86f:

    # mc "I'm always the one you guys accuse of talking too much, [kim]."
    mc "C'est toujours moi que vous accusez de trop parler, [kim]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3731
translate french c30s006_kim_8866c810:

    # "You kiss your wife for the first time. Or for the first time since she became your wife."
    "Tu embrasses ta femme pour la première fois. Ou pour la première fois depuis qu'elle est devenue ta femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3732
translate french c30s006_kim_90715d39:

    # "The clumsy and insecure girl who got off that plane is gone, but her charm remains intact."
    "La fille maladroite et peu sûre d'elle qui est descendue de cet avion a disparu, mais son charme reste intact."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3733
translate french c30s006_kim_7901b650:

    # "And her lips taste as good as ever. Sometimes you wonder why you didn't kiss her sooner."
    "Et ses lèvres sont toujours aussi délicieuses. Parfois, tu te demandes pourquoi tu ne l'as pas embrassée plus tôt."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3735
translate french c30s006_kim_55a6e169:

    # kim "*Pant* I think I'm going to need a moment to catch my breath..."
    kim "*Halète* Je crois que je vais avoir besoin d'un moment pour reprendre mon souffle..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3736
translate french c30s006_kim_111299b5:

    # mc "Take all the time you need."
    mc "Prends tout le temps qu'il te faut."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3737
translate french c30s006_kim_a9795fff:

    # kim "*Pant* If only I could have all the time I need..."
    kim "*Halète* Si seulement je pouvais avoir tout le temps qu'il me faut..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3750
translate french c30s006_kim_5bfbe0d8:

    # kim "And now, even though I don't want you to, you should go. There's someone else waiting for you."
    kim "Et maintenant, même si je n'en ai pas envie, tu devrais y aller. Il y a quelqu'un d'autre qui t'attend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3751
translate french c30s006_kim_b936daa1:

    # mc "I know. I don't want to leave you here alone either. It pisses me off that we have to rush something as important as this."
    mc "Je sais. Je n'ai pas envie de te laisser seule ici non plus. Ça me fait chier qu'on doive précipiter un truc aussi important."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3753
translate french c30s006_kim_7f1cb870:

    # kim "*Laugh* If you weren't collecting girlfriends..."
    kim "*Rire* Si tu ne collectionnais pas les petites amies..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3754
translate french c30s006_kim_5d82ffbb:

    # mc "*Laugh* Now it seems like I'm collecting wives."
    mc "*Rire* Maintenant, on dirait que je collectionne les épouses."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3758
translate french c30s006_kim_598b853e:

    # "You kiss the beautiful [kim] again. This time it's a calmer kiss than the last one, but no less tender."
    "Tu embrasses à nouveau la magnifique [kim]. Cette fois, c'est un baiser plus calme que le précédent, mais pas moins tendre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3760
translate french c30s006_kim_53d812de:

    # "On one hand, you don't want to go back to Jamaal. On the other hand, you want to see the next girl."
    "D'un côté, tu n'as pas envie de retourner voir Jamaal. De l'autre, tu veux voir la prochaine fille."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3762
translate french c30s006_kim_f68740fc:

    # "On one hand, you don't want to go to the welcome party. On the other hand, you're looking forward to seeing [mee] and Aunt [bet]."
    "D'un côté, tu n'as pas envie d'aller à la fête de bienvenue. De l'autre, tu as hâte de voir [mee] et tante [bet]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3763
translate french c30s006_kim_73105b40:

    # "The kiss lasts less than you'd like, before you have to pull apart."
    "Le baiser dure moins longtemps que tu ne l'aurais voulu, avant que vous ne deviez vous séparer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3770
translate french c30s006_meg_c2a8a2bf:

    # "Jamaal walks you to the back of [nor]'s house, where [meg] is waiting for you."
    "Jamaal t'accompagne à l'arrière de la maison de [nor], où [meg] t'attend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3782
translate french c30s006_meg_82a2c0a8:

    # mc "You look gorgeous, [meg]."
    mc "Tu es magnifique, [meg]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3783
translate french c30s006_meg_d9d1234d:

    # meg "You too. I love how that suit looks on you."
    meg "Toi aussi. J'adore comment ce costume te va."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3784
translate french c30s006_meg_c8c103a1:

    # mc "And I guess it's my turn to see a tattoo now, right?"
    mc "Et je suppose que c'est à mon tour de voir un tatouage maintenant, pas vrai ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3786
translate french c30s006_meg_2e8f76ce:

    # meg "This feels really weird. I never thought we'd get to this point."
    meg "Ça fait vraiment bizarre. Je n'aurais jamais cru qu'on en arriverait là."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3788
translate french c30s006_meg_9b0c92cd:

    # mc "I still don't know what 'this' is."
    mc "Je ne sais toujours pas ce qu'est 'ça'."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3790
translate french c30s006_meg_5f8a0527:

    # mc "It feels completely natural to me. Or did you just want something casual with me?"
    mc "Ça me paraît complètement naturel. Ou tu voulais juste un truc sans prise de tête avec moi ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3792
translate french c30s006_meg_a99946ba:

    # meg "When you left my apartment that day in Westport, I thought this would be something casual. I didn't think you were interested in anything serious with me."
    meg "Quand tu as quitté mon appartement ce jour-là à Westport, je pensais que ce serait juste un truc sans lendemain. Je ne pensais pas que tu étais intéressé par quelque chose de sérieux avec moi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3793
translate french c30s006_meg_8aa83788:

    # mc "But..."
    mc "Mais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3795
translate french c30s006_meg_ec77b3ba:

    # meg "Hush! Let me speak! I rehearsed this in front of the mirror."
    meg "Chut ! Laisse-moi parler ! J'ai répété ça devant le miroir."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3796
translate french c30s006_meg_b16a0d6b:

    # mc "Okay. I'll keep my mouth shut."
    mc "D'accord. Je vais la fermer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3798
translate french c30s006_meg_cffe318c:

    # meg "You never showed any interest in me in Portland. Yeah, I know you were with [sai]..."
    meg "Tu n'as jamais montré d'intérêt pour moi à Portland. Ouais, je sais que tu étais avec [sai]..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3799
translate french c30s006_meg_57a23de3:

    # meg "But, despite your open relationship, you never noticed me..."
    meg "Mais, malgré votre relation libre, tu ne m'as jamais remarquée..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3801
translate french c30s006_meg_925c581a:

    # meg "But that day you spilled coffee on me and... then my world shattered into pieces."
    meg "Mais ce jour-là, tu as renversé du café sur moi et... ensuite mon monde a volé en éclats."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3802
translate french c30s006_meg_75e4aa8b:

    # meg "I've never been as happy as I am since I've been with you."
    meg "Je n'ai jamais été aussi heureuse que depuis que je suis avec toi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3803
translate french c30s006_meg_68347c93:

    # meg "I spend my days wishing for the weekend to arrive so I can come to Newport."
    meg "Je passe mes journées à espérer que le week-end arrive pour pouvoir venir à Newport."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3805
translate french c30s006_meg_2a4f9b3b:

    # meg "And, as if that weren't enough, you've given me a family where I didn't expect to find one."
    meg "Et, comme si ça ne suffisait pas, tu m'as donné une famille là où je ne m'attendais pas à en trouver une."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3806
translate french c30s006_meg_516bb13a:

    # meg "For all of that..."
    meg "Pour tout ça..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3808
translate french c30s006_meg_380da4b7:

    # meg "With this ring and this mug, as shattered as my world, I declare myself your wife."
    meg "Avec cette bague et ce mug, aussi brisé que mon monde, je me déclare ta femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3810
translate french c30s006_meg_6799f278:

    # mc "What? I'm so surprised! I had no idea what this was about..."
    mc "Quoi ? Je suis tellement surpris ! Je n'avais aucune idée de ce dont il s'agissait..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3811
translate french c30s006_meg_77d25111:

    # mc "I love it! I'm so happy to be your husband."
    mc "J'adore ! Je suis tellement heureux d'être ton mari."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3813
translate french c30s006_meg_289973d4:

    # meg "You don't think it's stupid?"
    meg "Tu ne trouves pas ça stupide ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3815
translate french c30s006_meg_27cb444a:

    # meg "Or that I'm imposing myself without giving you the chance to reject me?"
    meg "Ou que je m'impose sans te laisser la chance de me rejeter ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3817
translate french c30s006_meg_f98558de:

    # meg "Or that we're imposing ourselves without giving you the chance to reject us?"
    meg "Ou qu'on s'impose sans te laisser la chance de nous rejeter ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3818
translate french c30s006_meg_8858cf8c:

    # mc "[meg], you know me well. You know what I would do if I believed a decision I didn't want to make was being imposed on me."
    mc "[meg], tu me connais bien. Tu sais ce que je ferais si je pensais qu'on m'imposait une décision que je ne voulais pas prendre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3819
translate french c30s006_meg_e9cf8b47:

    # mc "And it wouldn't be this."
    mc "Et ce ne serait pas ça."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3821
translate french c30s006_meg_b27a67ee:

    # "You take her in your arms and kiss her passionately, showing her that the decision is already made."
    "Tu la prends dans tes bras et l'embrasses passionnément, lui montrant que la décision est déjà prise."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3822
translate french c30s006_meg_2324307d:

    # "And it's the right decision."
    "Et c'est la bonne décision."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3823
translate french c30s006_meg_88fd5c3c:

    # "You've shown her a hundred times that you're crazy about her, and despite everything, her insecurity rears its ugly head from time to time."
    "Tu lui as montré cent fois que tu es fou d'elle, et malgré tout, son insécurité refait surface de temps en temps."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3824
translate french c30s006_meg_5b5df66f:

    # "You'll have to show her even more times. A thousand times. A million times. A thousand kisses or a million. It will never be enough."
    "Tu devras lui montrer encore plus de fois. Mille fois. Un million de fois. Mille baisers ou un million. Ce ne sera jamais assez."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3826
translate french c30s006_meg_4be9b312:

    # meg "Okay. I get it now."
    meg "D'accord. J'ai compris maintenant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3827
translate french c30s006_meg_bdd1bac9:

    # meg "*Laugh* Well. No. I'm not completely sure. Can I have another kiss just to clear up my doubts?"
    meg "*Rire* Eh bien. Non. Je ne suis pas complètement sûre. Est-ce que je peux avoir un autre baiser juste pour dissiper mes doutes ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3828
translate french c30s006_meg_84c33e1e:

    # mc "*Laugh* You can have all the kisses you want, [meg]. There are many waiting for you to come and get them."
    mc "*Rire* Tu peux avoir tous les baisers que tu veux, [meg]. Il y en a plein qui n'attendent que toi pour venir les chercher."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3830
translate french c30s006_meg_355a60d7:

    # "She is the one seeking your mouth with hers, now."
    "C'est elle qui cherche ta bouche avec la sienne, maintenant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3831
translate french c30s006_meg_7755c500:

    # "Obviously, the doubts no longer exist. Now you're just addicted to each other's mouths, enjoying your fix."
    "Évidemment, les doutes n'existent plus. Maintenant, vous êtes juste accros à la bouche de l'autre, profitant de votre dose."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3832
translate french c30s006_meg_b6058bee:

    # "It's such a huge addiction that the withdrawals will start the moment you part your lips."
    "C'est une addiction tellement énorme que le manque commencera au moment où vous séparerez vos lèvres."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3845
translate french c30s006_meg_49ad0d1d:

    # meg "I could spend hours kissing you, but then I'd become the most hated girl in the house."
    meg "Je pourrais passer des heures à t'embrasser, mais je deviendrais la fille la plus détestée de la maison."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3846
translate french c30s006_meg_8fd2964d:

    # mc "And we don't want that, do we?"
    mc "Et on ne veut pas ça, n'est-ce pas ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3847
translate french c30s006_meg_adc28b59:

    # meg "Neither that nor Jamaal coming to tell us that dinner will be delayed because of us."
    meg "Ni ça, ni que Jamaal vienne nous dire que le dîner sera retardé à cause de nous."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3848
translate french c30s006_meg_df2106c7:

    # mc "*Laugh* Fucking glutton!"
    mc "*Rire* Putain de glouton !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3850
translate french c30s006_meg_97395f2e:

    # meg "Go with him. I'm sure he's getting impatient to take you to the next girl."
    meg "Vas-y avec lui. Je suis sûre qu'il s'impatiente de t'emmener voir la prochaine fille."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3851
translate french c30s006_meg_bd196d56:

    # mc "See you in a bit, honey."
    mc "À tout à l'heure, chérie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3857
translate french c30s006_lis_67a47a1f:

    # "You go with Jamaal to the side of [nor]'s house, where [lis] is waiting for you."
    "Tu vas avec Jamaal sur le côté de la maison de [nor], où [lis] t'attend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3858
translate french c30s006_lis_8937708c:

    # "You've never seen [lis] in this part of the garden. You don't come here much either."
    "Tu n'as jamais vu [lis] dans cette partie du jardin. Tu ne viens pas souvent ici non plus."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3870
translate french c30s006_lis_e8fcf484:

    # mc "You look gorgeous, [lis]. Although that's nothing new."
    mc "Tu es magnifique, [lis]. Bien que ce ne soit pas nouveau."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3871
translate french c30s006_lis_08d23236:

    # lis "Thank you, [mc]. That boosts any girl's self-esteem."
    lis "Merci, [mc]. Ça booste l'estime de soi de n'importe quelle fille."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3872
translate french c30s006_lis_767edbdd:

    # mc "I can't wait to see what you got tattooed. I didn't think you were the kind of girl to get tattoos."
    mc "J'ai hâte de voir ce que tu t'es fait tatouer. Je ne pensais pas que tu étais le genre de fille à te faire tatouer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3874
translate french c30s006_lis_1ce434e3:

    # lis "I've never liked them, but when we talked about it amongst ourselves, I thought that, if I ever got a tattoo, this would be the best reason."
    lis "Je n'ai jamais aimé ça, mais quand on en a parlé entre nous, je me suis dit que si je devais me faire un tatouage un jour, ce serait la meilleure raison."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3875
translate french c30s006_lis_12269735:

    # lis "Today is a day for new things. That's why I chose this part of the garden. I'd never been here before."
    lis "Aujourd'hui est un jour pour les nouveautés. C'est pour ça que j'ai choisi cette partie du jardin. Je n'étais jamais venue ici avant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3880
translate french c30s006_lis_78b91a1c:

    # lis "It's my turn to be the first, so I'm going to have to explain it to you from the beginning."
    lis "C'est à mon tour d'être la première, alors je vais devoir t'expliquer depuis le début."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3881
translate french c30s006_lis_b4f612bf:

    # lis "We know we'll never be able to marry you, but we want to do it somehow, even if it's not official."
    lis "On sait qu'on ne pourra jamais t'épouser, mais on veut le faire d'une manière ou d'une autre, même si ce n'est pas officiel."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3883
translate french c30s006_lis_a14ebcf0:

    # lis "Just like you did with [mar]."
    lis "Tout comme tu l'as fait avec [mar]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3884
translate french c30s006_lis_d1d97b50:

    # lis "My life changed the day you kissed me in my room, and I want it to keep changing."
    lis "Ma vie a changé le jour où tu m'as embrassée dans ma chambre, et je veux qu'elle continue de changer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3886
translate french c30s006_lis_ddad0172:

    # lis "I know it's too early to talk about marriage, but I know I want to spend the rest of my life with you."
    lis "Je sais qu'il est trop tôt pour parler de mariage, mais je sais que je veux passer le reste de ma vie avec toi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3887
translate french c30s006_lis_eec975c5:

    # lis "The rest of my life started the day you kissed me in my room, and I want it to continue like this."
    lis "Le reste de ma vie a commencé le jour où tu m'as embrassée dans ma chambre, et je veux que ça continue comme ça."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3888
translate french c30s006_lis_58677631:

    # mc "I think that's a great idea. And you looked so cute in those cow pajamas."
    mc "Je trouve que c'est une excellente idée. Et tu étais si mignonne dans ce pyjama vache."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3890
translate french c30s006_lis_12269735_1:

    # lis "Today is a day for new things. That's why I chose this part of the garden. I've never been here before."
    lis "Aujourd'hui est un jour pour de nouvelles choses. C'est pourquoi j'ai choisi cette partie du jardin. Je n'étais jamais venue ici avant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3891
translate french c30s006_lis_c0edf315:

    # lis "If we're going to make new memories together, this is a perfect place, where they won't get mixed up with other memories."
    lis "Si on doit se créer de nouveaux souvenirs ensemble, c'est l'endroit parfait, où ils ne se mélangeront pas avec d'autres souvenirs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3892
translate french c30s006_lis_0c682f5e:

    # mc "It's always seemed like the most boring part of [nor]'s garden to me, but I think that'll change today."
    mc "Ça m'a toujours semblé être la partie la plus ennuyeuse du jardin de [nor], mais je pense que ça va changer aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3894
translate french c30s006_lis_3e9388f5:

    # lis "With this ring, I declare myself your wife. *Laugh* You better not reject me. Like I told you at the party, I have friends who know how to bury a body."
    lis "Avec cette bague, je me déclare ta femme. *Rires* Tu as intérêt à ne pas me rejeter. Comme je te l'ai dit à la fête, j'ai des amis qui savent comment enterrer un corps."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3895
translate french c30s006_lis_722b5ed0:

    # lis "*Laugh* And I guess the threat of spending eternity in a pink bag with a bow is enough to stop you from doing it."
    lis "*Rires* Et je suppose que la menace de passer l'éternité dans un sac rose avec un nœud est suffisante pour t'en dissuader."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3897
translate french c30s006_lis_8c2e880e:

    # mc "What? Are you asking me to marry you?"
    mc "Quoi ? Tu me demandes de t'épouser ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3898
translate french c30s006_lis_d572a052:

    # lis "*Laugh* No, I'm informing you that you are now married."
    lis "*Rires* Non, je t'informe que tu es maintenant marié."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3899
translate french c30s006_lis_412e10d6:

    # mc "I wouldn't reject you even if you hadn't threatened me. I might be crazy, but that would be too crazy even for me."
    mc "Je ne te rejetterais pas même si tu ne m'avais pas menacé. Je suis peut-être fou, mais ce serait trop fou, même pour moi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3901
translate french c30s006_lis_b2c57ae5:

    # lis "You know you have a sister-in-law and in-laws now, right? I come with family baggage too."
    lis "Tu sais que tu as une belle-sœur et des beaux-parents maintenant, pas vrai ? Je viens aussi avec mon bagage familial."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3903
translate french c30s006_lis_475f1dc4:

    # mc "*Laugh* Until a moment ago, you were my sister-in-law."
    mc "*Rire* Jusqu'à il y a un instant, c'était toi ma belle-sœur."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3905
translate french c30s006_lis_e321ed0a:

    # mc "*Laugh* I guess [deb.nick] is waiting for you to go tell her how this went."
    mc "*Rire* J'imagine que [deb.nick] t'attend pour que tu ailles lui raconter comment ça s'est passé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3906
translate french c30s006_lis_80297e41:

    # mc "And about my in-laws... I'm a bit intimidated to meet them after what you told me."
    mc "Et à propos de mes beaux-parents... Je suis un peu intimidé à l'idée de les rencontrer après ce que tu m'as dit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3908
translate french c30s006_lis_3d2ca2d1:

    # lis "Don't worry about that. At least until you get back from Aruba. There'll be time when you return..."
    lis "Ne t'inquiète pas pour ça. Du moins jusqu'à ce que tu reviennes d'Aruba. On aura le temps à ton retour..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3910
translate french c30s006_lis_7b7818ac:

    # lis "I'll be six months pregnant by then, so I'll have to tell them before that..."
    lis "Je serai enceinte de six mois d'ici là, donc je devrai leur dire avant ça..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3911
translate french c30s006_lis_7a110d79:

    # mc "What? You're pregnant?"
    mc "Quoi ? Tu es enceinte ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3914
translate french c30s006_lis_20691ece:

    # "You wrap your arms around your new wife and kiss her passionately."
    "Tu passes tes bras autour de ta nouvelle femme et l'embrasses passionnément."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3916
translate french c30s006_lis_7c5b405c:

    # "You don't care too much about what her parents are like or how they'll receive you. The important thing is that your baby is growing inside her."
    "Tu te fiches un peu de comment sont ses parents ou de comment ils vont t'accueillir. L'important, c'est que ton bébé grandit en elle."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3918
translate french c30s006_lis_a7e1bcdd:

    # "You don't care too much about what her parents are like or how they'll receive you. The important thing is that [lis] is happy."
    "Tu te fiches un peu de comment sont ses parents ou de comment ils vont t'accueillir. L'important, c'est que [lis] soit heureuse."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3919
translate french c30s006_lis_89bdec89:

    # "The kiss doesn't last long enough, but it conveys what you both feel. That this is a new beginning for both of you."
    "Le baiser ne dure pas assez longtemps, mais il transmet ce que vous ressentez tous les deux. Que c'est un nouveau départ pour vous deux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3921
translate french c30s006_lis_a281df25:

    # mc "I love you, by the way."
    mc "Je t'aime, au fait."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3922
translate french c30s006_lis_c21ccbfc:

    # lis "*Laugh* I love you too, but that 'by the way' at the end of the sentence..."
    lis "*Rires* Je t'aime aussi, mais ce 'au fait' à la fin de la phrase..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3923
translate french c30s006_lis_9b809284:

    # mc "*Laugh* Didn't you like it?"
    mc "*Rires* Ça ne t'a pas plu ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3925
translate french c30s006_lis_ce5bbdeb:

    # lis "I loved it. It's so... you..."
    lis "J'ai adoré. C'est tellement... toi..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3926
translate french c30s006_lis_a1b2b08c:

    # mc "Just like I guess the tattoo is part of you. I only saw a ring, but I don't know if it has any extra meaning."
    mc "Tout comme je suppose que le tatouage fait partie de toi. Je n'ai vu qu'un anneau, mais je ne sais pas s'il a une signification particulière."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3928
translate french c30s006_lis_a1c74d5d:

    # lis "I was hoping you wouldn't ask... I chose it on an impulse and..."
    lis "J'espérais que tu ne demanderais pas... Je l'ai choisi sur un coup de tête et..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3929
translate french c30s006_lis_1bb76413:

    # mc "You don't have to explain it to me if you don't want to."
    mc "Tu n'as pas à m'expliquer si tu n'en as pas envie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3930
translate french c30s006_lis_6725231f:

    # lis "I don't want to keep secrets from my husband, so here goes. I hope you don't think I'm too... silly."
    lis "Je ne veux pas avoir de secrets pour mon mari, alors voilà. J'espère que tu ne me trouveras pas trop... bête."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3932
translate french c30s006_lis_8a5bad29:

    # lis "I wanted a wedding ring, but not the typical, smooth wedding ring."
    lis "Je voulais une alliance, mais pas l'alliance typique et lisse."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3933
translate french c30s006_lis_f8fdc4f3:

    # lis "You know I can be... rough... sometimes. And I know that someday I'll get bitchy and say something I shouldn't..."
    lis "Tu sais que je peux être... dure... parfois. Et je sais qu'un jour je serai une vraie garce et que je dirai quelque chose que je ne devrais pas..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3934
translate french c30s006_lis_696c1878:

    # lis "With the ring, rough on the outside and smooth on the inside, I wanted to represent that our relationship is going to have rough patches, but on the inside it's going to be wonderful."
    lis "Avec cet anneau, rugueux à l'extérieur et lisse à l'intérieur, je voulais représenter le fait que notre relation va connaître des moments difficiles, mais qu'à l'intérieur, elle sera merveilleuse."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3935
translate french c30s006_lis_185270a9:

    # mc "And because of that I was supposed to think you're silly?"
    mc "Et à cause de ça, j'étais censé penser que tu es bête ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3936
translate french c30s006_lis_ea81299b:

    # mc "It seems to me you've put a lot of thought into the meaning of that tattoo. That's the exact opposite of being silly to me."
    mc "Il me semble que tu as beaucoup réfléchi à la signification de ce tatouage. C'est exactement l'inverse d'être bête pour moi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3938
translate french c30s006_lis_8db5d2dc:

    # mc "And speaking of jewelry... It's weird seeing you dressed like that, but without earrings or a necklace."
    mc "Et en parlant de bijoux... Ça fait bizarre de te voir habillée comme ça, mais sans boucles d'oreilles ni collier."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3939
translate french c30s006_lis_b9fa4c66:

    # lis "*Laugh* The jewel I wanted to wear is tattooed on my back."
    lis "*Rires* Le bijou que je voulais porter est tatoué sur mon dos."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3940
translate french c30s006_lis_bf5a70d7:

    # lis "And I didn't want anything to take the spotlight away from the tattoo or this wonderful dress."
    lis "Et je ne voulais rien qui vole la vedette au tatouage ou à cette magnifique robe."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3941
translate french c30s006_lis_2dfb680b:

    # mc "But the bracelets..."
    mc "Mais les bracelets..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3943
translate french c30s006_lis_c0d01515:

    # lis "The bracelets came with the dress... If the designer made them to go together..."
    lis "Les bracelets étaient fournis avec la robe... Si le créateur les a faits pour aller ensemble..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3944
translate french c30s006_lis_6ced6da7:

    # mc "*Laugh* And you couldn't resist wearing them, right?"
    mc "*Rires* Et tu n'as pas pu résister à l'envie de les porter, pas vrai ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3946
translate french c30s006_lis_169e68d0:

    # lis "*Laugh* Of course not."
    lis "*Rires* Bien sûr que non."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3959
translate french c30s006_lis_03f7f4f6:

    # lis "Don't tell Jamaal, but right now I hate him a little bit."
    lis "Ne le dis pas à Jamaal, mais en ce moment, je le déteste un peu."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3960
translate french c30s006_lis_22edcca7:

    # mc "*Laugh* Well, you have the right to. He's actually your brother-in-law now."
    mc "*Rires* Eh bien, tu en as le droit. C'est ton beau-frère maintenant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3961
translate french c30s006_lis_5ad69b49:

    # mc "But I know what you mean. We don't want him intruding on our new memories by showing up to come get me."
    mc "Mais je vois ce que tu veux dire. On ne veut pas qu'il s'incruste dans nos nouveaux souvenirs en débarquant pour venir me chercher."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3965
translate french c30s006_lis_1195807f:

    # "You wrap your arms around your wife again and give her a tender kiss."
    "Tu enroules à nouveau tes bras autour de ta femme et lui donnes un tendre baiser."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3967
translate french c30s006_lis_a2a55821:

    # "It's a brief goodbye, until you can meet again at the party."
    "C'est un bref au revoir, en attendant de vous retrouver à la fête."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3969
translate french c30s006_lis_ba496539:

    # "It's a brief goodbye. No more kisses until you reach the party. If you stop every two meters to kiss, you'll never get there."
    "C'est un bref au revoir. Plus de bisous jusqu'à la fête. Si vous vous arrêtez tous les deux mètres pour vous embrasser, vous n'y arriverez jamais."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3972
translate french c30s006_scaSpa_172a335e:

    # mc "I don't know why you'd be surprised. You know that's what I think."
    mc "Je ne sais pas pourquoi tu es surprise. Tu sais que c'est ce que je pense."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3974
translate french c30s006_scaSpa_384715d2:

    # sca "I know, but after so many years waiting for you to notice me... It feels weird that we're here now."
    sca "Je sais, mais après tant d'années à attendre que tu me remarques... Ça fait bizarre qu'on en soit là maintenant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3975
translate french c30s006_scaSpa_985f0df6:

    # mc "Well, a lot has changed since then. Now you live here and we're together."
    mc "Eh bien, beaucoup de choses ont changé depuis. Maintenant tu vis ici et on est ensemble."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3976
translate french c30s006_scaSpa_816ba868:

    # mc "I still remember the day you came to this house to stay for good."
    mc "Je me souviens encore du jour où tu es venue dans cette maison pour t'y installer définitivement."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3978
translate french c30s006_scaSpa_c4dd432b:

    # sca "That's why I chose this place. It's where all the girls welcomed me... Well, more like in front of the garage..."
    sca "C'est pour ça que j'ai choisi cet endroit. C'est là que toutes les filles m'ont accueillie... Enfin, plutôt devant le garage..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3979
translate french c30s006_scaSpa_db3615dd:

    # sca "It's a place that brings back happy memories, and I want to add one more to the collection."
    sca "C'est un endroit qui me rappelle de bons souvenirs, et je veux en ajouter un de plus à la collection."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3983
translate french c30s006_sca_8c4594b1:

    # "Jamaal walks you to the fence of [nor]'s house, where [sca] is waiting for you."
    "Jamaal t'accompagne jusqu'à la clôture de la maison de [nor], où [sca] t'attend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3995
translate french c30s006_sca_1d1f8c41:

    # mc "You look gorgeous, [sca]."
    mc "Tu es magnifique, [sca]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3997
translate french c30s006_sca_61175f57:

    # sca "You know I still get surprised when you tell me that?"
    sca "Tu sais que ça me surprend toujours quand tu me dis ça ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3999
translate french c30s006_sca_867ec9d8:

    # mc "*Laugh* Now all you have to tell me is that you got a plate of spaghetti tattooed."
    mc "*Rire* Maintenant, il ne te reste plus qu'à me dire que tu t'es fait tatouer une assiette de spaghettis."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4001
translate french c30s006_sca_37fe1f45:

    # sca "I thought about it, but... I still consider that plate of spaghetti a failure."
    sca "J'y ai pensé, mais... je considère toujours cette assiette de spaghettis comme un échec."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4002
translate french c30s006_sca_7625bc4d:

    # mc "*Laugh* As food or as building material?"
    mc "*Rire* En tant que nourriture ou comme matériau de construction ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4004
translate french c30s006_sca_4ad5434a:

    # sca "But it's time to make more happy memories."
    sca "Mais il est temps de créer d'autres souvenirs heureux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4008
translate french c30s006_sca_64eb58d0:

    # sca "Do you know I still get surprised when you tell me I'm pretty?"
    sca "Tu sais que ça me surprend toujours quand tu me dis que je suis jolie ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4010
translate french c30s006_sca_e81aca87:

    # mc "*Laugh* And you can use the memory of the spaghetti to cement it all together."
    mc "*Rire* Et tu peux utiliser le souvenir des spaghettis pour cimenter tout ça."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4012
translate french c30s006_sca_40d51db3:

    # sca "I still consider that plate of spaghetti a failure..."
    sca "Je considère toujours cette assiette de spaghettis comme un échec..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4013
translate french c30s006_sca_ccdecebc:

    # mc "*Laugh* As food or as building material? Better not answer."
    mc "*Rire* En tant que nourriture ou comme matériau de construction ? Mieux vaut ne pas répondre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4014
translate french c30s006_sca_473bd89c:

    # mc "But you still haven't told me what we're doing here."
    mc "Mais tu ne m'as toujours pas dit ce qu'on fait ici."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4016
translate french c30s006_sca_182d2a20:

    # sca "Creating more happy memories."
    sca "Créer encore plus de souvenirs heureux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4018
translate french c30s006_sca_72a55296:

    # sca "With this ring, I declare myself your wife. I've always wanted to be, and..."
    sca "Avec cet anneau, je me déclare ta femme. J'ai toujours voulu l'être, et..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4020
translate french c30s006_sca_b2238db1:

    # sca "We know we'll never be able to get married because we're half-siblings..."
    sca "Nous savons que nous ne pourrons jamais nous marier parce que nous sommes demi-frère et sœur..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4022
translate french c30s006_sca_e1ad1235:

    # sca "We know we'll never be able to get married because I don't want to be the only one you marry..."
    sca "Nous savons que nous ne pourrons jamais nous marier parce que je ne veux pas être la seule avec qui tu te maries..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4024
translate french c30s006_sca_05cc603f:

    # sca "I've never asked you if you want to officially get married in the future..."
    sca "Je ne t'ai jamais demandé si tu voulais te marier officiellement à l'avenir..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4026
translate french c30s006_sca_c1617417:

    # mc "What? I think it's an incredible idea!"
    mc "Quoi ? Je trouve que c'est une idée incroyable !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4028
translate french c30s006_sca_a950cff0:

    # "You have nothing to add. You know that, after being in love with you for so long, taking this step is very important for [sca]."
    "Tu n'as rien à ajouter. Tu sais qu'après avoir été amoureuse de toi pendant si longtemps, franchir cette étape est très important pour [sca]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4029
translate french c30s006_sca_9dbbf15d:

    # "Your first kiss as husband and wife is spectacular. The kissing lessons are a thing of the past."
    "Votre premier baiser en tant que mari et femme est spectaculaire. Les leçons de baiser font partie du passé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4030
translate french c30s006_sca_dc57ba56:

    # "Today you're not a proud teacher, but a happy husband."
    "Aujourd'hui, tu n'es pas un professeur fier, mais un mari heureux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4032
translate french c30s006_sca_e5794297:

    # sca "I hope you never stop taking my breath away with every kiss."
    sca "J'espère que tu ne cesseras jamais de me couper le souffle à chaque baiser."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4033
translate french c30s006_sca_1b74192a:

    # mc "I hope so too. But you're a great kisser now. You take my breath away too."
    mc "Je l'espère aussi. Mais tu embrasses super bien maintenant. Tu me coupes le souffle aussi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4034
translate french c30s006_sca_18ea3d61:

    # mc "The ring is beautiful. Where did you get the idea?"
    mc "La bague est magnifique. D'où t'est venue l'idée ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4036
translate french c30s006_sca_8ae54c5e:

    # sca "It's a mix of Escher's drawings, my multiple plans to end up here, and... spaghetti. *Giggles*"
    sca "C'est un mélange des dessins d'Escher, de mes multiples plans pour finir ici, et... de spaghettis. *Glousse*"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4037
translate french c30s006_sca_e2d24fc1:

    # mc "*Laugh* I knew the spaghetti would be with us forever."
    mc "*Rire* Je savais que les spaghettis resteraient avec nous pour toujours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4039
translate french c30s006_sca_fb25f0a2:

    # sca "That day you talked about grandkids for the first time."
    sca "Ce jour-là, tu as parlé de petits-enfants pour la première fois."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4040
translate french c30s006_sca_88c86085:

    # sca "I'm not going to get a plate of spaghetti tattooed on my shoulder, but this will remind me of the beautiful parts of that night."
    sca "Je ne vais pas me faire tatouer une assiette de spaghettis sur l'épaule, mais ça me rappellera les beaux moments de cette nuit-là."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4042
translate french c30s006_sca_5b7436fc:

    # "You say 'I love you' in sign language. You know exactly what she means by the beautiful parts."
    "Tu dis 'Je t'aime' en langue des signes. Tu sais exactement ce qu'elle veut dire par les beaux moments."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4043
translate french c30s006_sca_c6f30c60:

    # "You've learned to say more things in sign language since then, but you're saving the surprise for another time."
    "Tu as appris à dire d'autres choses en langue des signes depuis, mais tu gardes la surprise pour une autre fois."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4045
translate french c30s006_sca_5ca28aa9:

    # sca "I love you too, [mc]."
    sca "Je t'aime aussi, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4046
translate french c30s006_sca_ddbfc8ed:

    # "There are no tears like the first time. Just a radiant smile that you adore."
    "Il n'y a pas de larmes comme la première fois. Juste un sourire radieux que tu adores."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4048
translate french c30s006_sca_55e28dec:

    # "You kiss each other again. It's a kiss that will repeat for the rest of your lives."
    "Vous vous embrassez à nouveau. C'est un baiser qui se répétera pour le reste de vos vies."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4049
translate french c30s006_sca_97082a8c:

    # "Tender and full of love. You don't need anything else."
    "Tendre et plein d'amour. Tu n'as besoin de rien d'autre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4062
translate french c30s006_sca_dffd77c8:

    # mc "I think I hate Jamaal. I bet it was his idea to set this up, so we'd only have a few minutes together."
    mc "Je crois que je déteste Jamaal. Je parie que c'était son idée d'organiser ça, pour qu'on n'ait que quelques minutes ensemble."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4063
translate french c30s006_sca_7f027a43:

    # sca "Well, sort of. We proposed more time, but Jamaal said it would get too late for the party."
    sca "Eh bien, en quelque sorte. On a proposé plus de temps, mais Jamaal a dit qu'il se ferait trop tard pour la fête."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4064
translate french c30s006_sca_626d82f4:

    # sca "[meg] and [sam.nick] have to go to work, and..."
    sca "[meg] et [sam.nick] doivent aller travailler, et..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4065
translate french c30s006_sca_e861bc6f:

    # mc "And I better get going, right?"
    mc "Et je ferais mieux d'y aller, c'est ça ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4066
translate french c30s006_sca_23db0430:

    # sca "*Laugh* And I better not answer that."
    sca "*Rires* Et je ferais mieux de ne pas répondre à ça."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4072
translate french c30s006_dap_1d48deec:

    # "You accompany Jamaal through the garden. You walk around [nor]'s house, as if he were killing time."
    "Vous accompagnez Jamaal à travers le jardin. Vous faites le tour de la maison de [nor], comme s'il tuait le temps."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4073
translate french c30s006_dap_be7e0b1b:

    # "A mischievous smile plays on his face the entire walk."
    "Un sourire malicieux se dessine sur son visage pendant toute la promenade."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4075
translate french c30s006_dap_02ab889e:

    # "Finally, he walks you to where [dap] is."
    "Finalement, il vous conduit là où se trouve [dap]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4087
translate french c30s006_dap_b629431d:

    # mc "I don't know what's more spectacular, the dress or your smile, [dap]"
    mc "Je ne sais pas ce qui est le plus spectaculaire, la robe ou ton sourire, [dap]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4090
translate french c30s006_dap_08765051:

    # mc "I mean it. I don't know what's more spectacular, the dress or your smile, [dap]"
    mc "Je suis sérieux. Je ne sais pas ce qui est le plus spectaculaire, la robe ou ton sourire, [dap]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4092
translate french c30s006_dap_8826a7e5:

    # dap "Well, I think I'm going to be really bad at this..."
    dap "Eh bien, je crois que je vais être vraiment nulle à ça..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4093
translate french c30s006_dap_ba0734c2:

    # mc "I don't know of anything you're particularly bad at, if we exclude social skills, and you've improved a lot at that."
    mc "Je ne connais rien pour lequel tu sois particulièrement mauvaise, si on exclut les compétences sociales, et tu t'es beaucoup améliorée à ce niveau."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4094
translate french c30s006_dap_f1aa8275:

    # dap "This is part of social skills. And I haven't trained this one in particular."
    dap "Ça fait partie des compétences sociales. Et je ne me suis pas entraînée pour celle-ci en particulier."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4096
translate french c30s006_dap_72538b9d:

    # dap "You know the night at the medieval hotel was the best night of my life, right?"
    dap "Tu sais que la nuit à l'hôtel médiéval a été la meilleure de ma vie, n'est-ce pas ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4097
translate french c30s006_dap_fa08f7a3:

    # mc "It was a fantastic night."
    mc "C'était une nuit fantastique."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4098
translate french c30s006_dap_153f3889:

    # dap "And I know I'll never be able to forget it. That's why I wanted to do it this way."
    dap "Et je sais que je ne pourrai jamais l'oublier. C'est pour ça que je voulais faire les choses ainsi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4099
translate french c30s006_dap_f9397d13:

    # mc "I don't get it. I don't see anything medieval about the dress."
    mc "Je ne pige pas. Je ne vois rien de médiéval dans cette robe."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4101
translate french c30s006_dap_64e13c9d:

    # dap "It's not the dress, but the ring. With this ring, I declare myself your wife. If you accept, of course."
    dap "Ce n'est pas la robe, mais la bague. Avec cette bague, je me déclare ta femme. Si tu acceptes, bien sûr."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4103
translate french c30s006_dap_bec28955:

    # mc "What? My wife?"
    mc "Quoi ? Ma femme ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4104
translate french c30s006_dap_4e09a2ca:

    # mc "Of course I accept. I just hope there isn't a noble nearby who wants to claim his right to Prima Nocta."
    mc "Bien sûr que j'accepte. J'espère juste qu'il n'y a pas un noble dans le coin qui voudrait réclamer son droit de Prima Nocta."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4106
translate french c30s006_dap_f3a5418c:

    # dap "Well, that didn't really exist... or only on rare occasions. Historians still haven't found proof about..."
    dap "Eh bien, ça n'a pas vraiment existé... ou seulement en de rares occasions. Les historiens n'ont toujours pas trouvé de preuves concernant..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4108
translate french c30s006_dap_8379288d:

    # "You don't want a history lesson. You want to kiss your wife."
    "Tu ne veux pas d'une leçon d'histoire. Tu veux embrasser ta femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4109
translate french c30s006_dap_10f1cd87:

    # "Woe to the noble, real or fictional, who wants to tear her from your arms."
    "Malheur au noble, réel ou fictif, qui voudrait l'arracher de tes bras."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4110
translate french c30s006_dap_241218f0:

    # "The kiss is as mind-blowing as the woman whose mouth your tongue explores."
    "Le baiser est aussi époustouflant que la femme dont ta langue explore la bouche."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4112
translate french c30s006_dap_e550d4ac:

    # dap "... if that happened, it's either just legends or misinterpretations of historical documents."
    dap "... si ça s'est produit, c'est soit de simples légendes, soit de mauvaises interprétations de documents historiques."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4113
translate french c30s006_dap_d60cb9e5:

    # mc "*Laugh* You had to finish the sentence, didn't you?"
    mc "*Rires* Il fallait que tu finisses ta phrase, pas vrai ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4114
translate french c30s006_dap_8ed1ec15:

    # dap "Of course. *Laugh* You know I don't like being interrupted when I'm talking about something I'm passionate about."
    dap "Bien sûr. *Rires* Tu sais que je n'aime pas être interrompue quand je parle d'un sujet qui me passionne."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4115
translate french c30s006_dap_36b8ab70:

    # mc "*Laugh* Not even with a kiss?"
    mc "*Rires* Même pas par un baiser ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4117
translate french c30s006_dap_1e8ab5d7:

    # dap "Well... there can always be exceptions."
    dap "Eh bien... il peut toujours y avoir des exceptions."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4118
translate french c30s006_dap_660341a8:

    # mc "Speaking of things you're passionate about. Is that a Celtic braid on the ring?"
    mc "En parlant de choses qui te passionnent. C'est une tresse celtique sur la bague ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4120
translate french c30s006_dap_482089d3:

    # dap "You don't need to give me more reasons to marry you."
    dap "Tu n'as pas besoin de me donner plus de raisons de t'épouser."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4121
translate french c30s006_dap_d6d8d4d9:

    # dap "The fact that you recognized the braid isn't going to make me any more your wife than I already am."
    dap "Le fait que tu aies reconnu la tresse ne va pas faire de moi davantage ta femme que je ne le suis déjà."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4122
translate french c30s006_dap_15b480a6:

    # mc "*Laugh* Well, to live the full medieval experience... I think I'll buy you a chastity belt for when I go to Aruba."
    mc "*Rires* Eh bien, pour vivre l'expérience médiévale à fond... Je crois que je vais t'acheter une ceinture de chasteté pour quand j'irai à Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4124
translate french c30s006_dap_5a05aca0:

    # dap "*Laugh* You're an idiot."
    dap "*Rire* T'es un idiot."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4125
translate french c30s006_dap_ad11834c:

    # mc "*Laugh* You're a bigger idiot, since you're the one who married me."
    mc "*Rire* T'es une plus grande idiote, vu que c'est toi qui m'as épousé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4138
translate french c30s006_dap_360843a5:

    # dap "Go with Jamaal before I kidnap you."
    dap "Va avec Jamaal avant que je te kidnappe."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4139
translate french c30s006_dap_208eb672:

    # mc "*Laugh* Jamaal or being kidnapped by a gorgeous redhead. I think you framed that wrong."
    mc "*Rire* Jamaal ou être kidnappé par une magnifique rousse. Je crois que tu as mal formulé ça."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4144
translate french c30s006_dap_e7a7260d:

    # "You give her a goodbye kiss before going back to your best friend. A friend you hate right now."
    "Tu lui donnes un baiser d'au revoir avant de retourner vers ton meilleur ami. Un ami que tu détestes en ce moment."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4146
translate french c30s006_dap_7bf98d36:

    # "You kiss before heading to where the welcome party is going to be held."
    "Vous vous embrassez avant de vous diriger vers l'endroit où la fête de bienvenue va se tenir."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4149
translate french c30s006_waiting_b212a456:

    # sai "And now you should go. [personaje] is waiting for you and it's getting late."
    sai "Et maintenant tu devrais y aller. [personaje] t'attend et il se fait tard."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4151
translate french c30s006_waiting_fe61f00d:

    # sai "*Laugh* I'm dying to know what the redheaded witch has prepared. She's hidden her tattoo from all of us."
    sai "*Rire* Je meurs d'envie de savoir ce que la sorcière rousse a préparé. Elle a caché son tatouage à tout le monde."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4155
translate french c30s006_sai_67c52d8f:

    # "Jamaal guides you to the pool. Taking the long way around."
    "Jamaal te guide vers la piscine. En prenant le chemin le plus long."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4167
translate french c30s006_sai_61cda3b0:

    # mc "You look gorgeous, [sai]. I've never seen you in this dress."
    mc "Tu es magnifique, [sai]. Je ne t'ai jamais vue dans cette robe."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4170
translate french c30s006_sai_e4884a3d:

    # mc "I've never seen you in that dress."
    mc "Je ne t'ai jamais vue dans cette robe."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4173
translate french c30s006_sai_e395a783:

    # sai "Most of us bought new dresses for today."
    sai "La plupart d'entre nous ont acheté de nouvelles robes pour aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4175
translate french c30s006_sai_b09607c8:

    # sai "I bought it for today."
    sai "Je l'ai achetée pour aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4176
translate french c30s006_sai_c1702079:

    # sai "I also went to the hair salon to get my ends trimmed. But expecting you to notice that is wishful thinking."
    sai "Je suis aussi allée chez le coiffeur pour me faire couper les pointes. Mais espérer que tu le remarques, c'est un vœu pieux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4178
translate french c30s006_sai_b46fd0e4:

    # mc "For today? The welcome party?"
    mc "Pour aujourd'hui ? La fête de bienvenue ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4180
translate french c30s006_sai_d1698e30:

    # mc "I guess you needed an off-the-shoulder dress. You don't have too many of those."
    mc "J'imagine que tu avais besoin d'une robe à épaules dénudées. Tu n'en as pas beaucoup."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4181
translate french c30s006_sai_6a61e338:

    # mc "You can see I purposely ignored the fallacy about me not noticing your hairstyle changes."
    mc "Tu remarqueras que j'ai volontairement ignoré cette absurdité selon laquelle je ne remarque pas tes changements de coiffure."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4183
translate french c30s006_sai_6221e6e5:

    # sai "Before we start, let me explain something to you."
    sai "Avant qu'on commence, laisse-moi t'expliquer quelque chose."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4184
translate french c30s006_sai_cff3b865:

    # mc "Go ahead..."
    mc "Vas-y..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4186
translate french c30s006_sai_f09f8e1b:

    # mc "Although I don't know what you mean by 'start'."
    mc "Même si je ne sais pas ce que tu entends par 'commencer'."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4188
translate french c30s006_sai_91112266:

    # sai "In Portland, you wanted to make the relationship official and I wasn't ready."
    sai "À Portland, tu voulais officialiser notre relation et je n'étais pas prête."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4189
translate french c30s006_sai_bdc1e0a9:

    # sai "I acted like an idiot, but I know that if I hadn't, we probably wouldn't be here today, under these circumstances."
    sai "J'ai agi comme une idiote, mais je sais que si je ne l'avais pas fait, nous ne serions probablement pas là aujourd'hui, dans ces circonstances."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4190
translate french c30s006_sai_f27d9acf:

    # mc "It would be unlikely..."
    mc "Ce serait peu probable..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4192
translate french c30s006_sai_a9f86b0c:

    # sai "With this ring I declare myself your wife. I hope you're not the one acting like an idiot now."
    sai "Avec cette bague, je me déclare ta femme. J'espère que ce n'est pas toi qui te comportes comme un idiot maintenant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4194
translate french c30s006_sai_c24a8cc6:

    # mc "What? You want to marry me?"
    mc "Quoi ? Tu veux m'épouser ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4195
translate french c30s006_sai_a234826d:

    # mc "*Laugh* You went from not wanting to be my girlfriend to wanting to be my wife?"
    mc "*Rires* Tu es passée de ne pas vouloir être ma petite amie à vouloir être ma femme ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4197
translate french c30s006_sai_3286805c:

    # sai "You don't get it. I don't want to be your wife. I {b}AM{/b} your wife. If you don't reject me..."
    sai "Tu ne comprends pas. Je ne veux pas être ta femme. Je {b}SUIS{/b} ta femme. Si tu ne me rejettes pas..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4199
translate french c30s006_sai_da2f211f:

    # "You wouldn't reject a proposal like that for all the gold in the world."
    "Tu ne rejetterais pas une telle demande pour tout l'or du monde."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4200
translate french c30s006_sai_f5802446:

    # "Your lips meet in a kiss you've shared a thousand times. And each of those times has been different from the last."
    "Vos lèvres se rencontrent dans un baiser que vous avez partagé mille fois. Et chacune de ces fois a été différente de la précédente."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4201
translate french c30s006_sai_7ca822a0:

    # "This time is not different. Or maybe it is. It's unlike any kiss you've ever had, yet it's just like all the ones before."
    "Cette fois n'est pas différente. Ou peut-être que si. Ça ne ressemble à aucun baiser que tu as jamais reçu, et pourtant c'est exactement comme tous les précédents."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4203
translate french c30s006_sai_d354d4b0:

    # sai "I'll take that to mean I'm going to keep being the only idiot in this relationship."
    sai "Je vais prendre ça comme signifiant que je vais continuer à être la seule idiote dans cette relation."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4204
translate french c30s006_sai_ae8c2294:

    # mc "*Laugh* Well, the rest of the family would disagree. I don't even know if my name is [mc] or 'Idiot' anymore."
    mc "*Rires* Eh bien, le reste de la famille ne serait pas d'accord. Je ne sais même plus si mon nom est [mc] ou 'Idiot'."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4206
translate french c30s006_sai_baebe3a3:

    # sai "*Laugh* Well, they're not too far off."
    sai "*Rires* Eh bien, ils ne sont pas si loin de la vérité."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4207
translate french c30s006_sai_d8bedc16:

    # mc "By the way, I love the ring. It's very original."
    mc "Au fait, j'adore la bague. Elle est très originale."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4209
translate french c30s006_sai_5a77b5e2:

    # sai "I looked up ring designs online, and when I saw one like this, an unclosed circle, it reminded me of our open relationship."
    sai "J'ai cherché des modèles de bagues en ligne, et quand j'en ai vu une comme ça, un cercle non fermé, ça m'a rappelé notre relation libre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4211
translate french c30s006_sai_de0a23ab:

    # sai "I added the bars as a representation of the harem. Like every girl you add helps close the circle."
    sai "J'ai ajouté les barres pour représenter le harem. Comme si chaque fille que tu ajoutes aidait à fermer le cercle."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4212
translate french c30s006_sai_32fa8174:

    # sai "And each bar is different to reflect that each of us is different too."
    sai "Et chaque barre est différente pour refléter le fait que chacune de nous est différente aussi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4214
translate french c30s006_sai_e9f060d9:

    # sai "The ring was a bit plain, so I added the bars, as if every step we took closed the circle a little bit."
    sai "La bague était un peu simple, alors j'ai ajouté les barres, comme si chaque pas que nous faisions fermait le cercle un petit peu."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4215
translate french c30s006_sai_bc853c29:

    # sai "Some steps are bigger than others, and that's why the bars are different."
    sai "Certains pas sont plus grands que d'autres, et c'est pour ça que les barres sont différentes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4216
translate french c30s006_sai_fb777412:

    # mc "That's a very beautiful explanation, [sai]. And a very original design."
    mc "C'est une très belle explication, [sai]. Et un design très original."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4217
translate french c30s006_sai_07bc7ef5:

    # mc "But why now?"
    mc "Mais pourquoi maintenant ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4219
translate french c30s006_sai_a7980798:

    # mc "I know the rest of the harem pushed you to do it, but why do {b}you{/b} want to do this now?"
    mc "Je sais que le reste du harem t'a poussée à le faire, mais pourquoi est-ce que {b}toi{/b} tu veux faire ça maintenant ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4221
translate french c30s006_sai_c28b53dc:

    # sai "Because now you're leaving again."
    sai "Parce que maintenant tu repars."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4222
translate french c30s006_sai_44be9ac9:

    # sai "The last time you left, I had to travel halfway across the world... twice... to find you again."
    sai "La dernière fois que tu es parti, j'ai dû traverser la moitié du monde... deux fois... pour te retrouver."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4223
translate french c30s006_sai_2ab0e5fd:

    # sai "When you left Portland, we had decided to call it quits. This is my way of telling you that I'll still be here when you get back."
    sai "Quand tu as quitté Portland, on avait décidé d'en rester là. C'est ma façon de te dire que je serai toujours là à ton retour."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4225
translate french c30s006_sai_f807fac9:

    # "You have no words to express what her words mean to you, because you know how much they mean to her too."
    "Tu n'as pas de mots pour exprimer ce que ses paroles signifient pour toi, car tu sais à quel point elles comptent pour elle aussi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4226
translate french c30s006_sai_655f22ce:

    # "Yeah, even you are left speechless... sometimes."
    "Ouais, même toi tu en restes sans voix... parfois."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4227
translate french c30s006_sai_67090958:

    # "Luckily, your lips speak better than you do on those occasions."
    "Heureusement, tes lèvres parlent mieux que toi dans ces occasions."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4255
translate french c30s006_sai_e9977e23:

    # "After a quick kiss, you say goodbye to [sai] and return to Jamaal."
    "Après un baiser rapide, tu dis au revoir à [sai] et retournes voir Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4260
translate french c30s006_eil_ca34ac36:

    # "Jamaal makes you walk around the house until you reach the place where the next girl is waiting."
    "Jamaal te fait faire le tour de la maison jusqu'à ce que tu atteignes l'endroit où la prochaine fille t'attend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4261
translate french c30s006_eil_a4b7ded6:

    # "This time it's [eil] who's waiting for you."
    "Cette fois, c'est [eil] qui t'attend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4263
translate french c30s006_eil_5ae7a3b9:

    # "Jamaal accompanies you to where [eil] is waiting for you."
    "Jamaal t'accompagne là où [eil] t'attend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4275
translate french c30s006_eil_ea0676ab:

    # mc "Hey, honey. You look beautiful."
    mc "Hé, chérie. Tu es magnifique."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4276
translate french c30s006_eil_ae1edf16:

    # eil "Thanks, sweetie. You look great in that suit."
    eil "Merci, mon cœur. Tu es superbe dans ce costume."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4280
translate french c30s006_eil_282317b0:

    # eil "Here we are coming full circle, aren't we?"
    eil "La boucle est bouclée, n'est-ce pas ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4281
translate french c30s006_eil_11fd5fe5:

    # mc "I don't know what circle you're talking about, [eil.nick]."
    mc "Je ne sais pas de quel cercle tu parles, [eil.nick]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4283
translate french c30s006_eil_66ad5ba8:

    # eil "We started dating in high school, tried a long-distance relationship, broke up, and now we're back together."
    eil "On a commencé à sortir ensemble au lycée, on a essayé une relation à distance, on a rompu, et maintenant on est de nouveau ensemble."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4284
translate french c30s006_eil_76917942:

    # eil "Doesn't it feel like an incomplete circle? The first kiss we had here, at your house, was right here. On the lounge chairs that are usually here."
    eil "Tu n'as pas l'impression que c'est un cercle incomplet ? Le premier baiser qu'on a échangé ici, chez toi, c'était juste là. Sur les chaises longues qui sont d'habitude ici."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4285
translate french c30s006_eil_2f020688:

    # mc "I couldn't forget it. You didn't want to go up to my room in case I wanted to move too fast."
    mc "Je ne pourrais pas l'oublier. Tu ne voulais pas monter dans ma chambre au cas où je voudrais aller trop vite."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4286
translate french c30s006_eil_26abd808:

    # mc "You didn't want to kiss me with my family around, and we were reading Romeo and Juliet right here, under the sun."
    mc "Tu ne voulais pas m'embrasser avec ma famille dans les parages, et on lisait Roméo et Juliette juste ici, sous le soleil."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4288
translate french c30s006_eil_149a7ec2:

    # eil "And I wasn't paying attention to anything we were reading. I just wanted to kiss you while you recited Shakespeare."
    eil "Et je ne faisais pas attention à ce qu'on lisait. Je voulais juste t'embrasser pendant que tu récitais du Shakespeare."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4289
translate french c30s006_eil_284b092e:

    # mc "My legs were shaking. Luckily we were sitting down and you couldn't notice..."
    mc "Mes jambes tremblaient. Heureusement qu'on était assis et que tu ne pouvais rien remarquer..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4291
translate french c30s006_eil_21be6e06:

    # eil "*Laugh* We've never talked about it, but I noticed. You kept bouncing your leg, like when you're concentrating, but faster."
    eil "*Rire* On n'en a jamais parlé, mais je l'ai remarqué. Tu n'arrêtais pas de faire rebondir ta jambe, comme quand tu te concentres, mais en plus rapide."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4292
translate french c30s006_eil_8a6cfb64:

    # mc "And, despite everything, you kissed me."
    mc "Et, malgré tout, tu m'as embrassé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4294
translate french c30s006_eil_77a344d9:

    # eil "I couldn't hold back anymore, and I didn't care that your family was home."
    eil "Je ne pouvais plus me retenir, et je me fichais que ta famille soit à la maison."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4295
translate french c30s006_eil_c9849209:

    # eil "You were irresistible then, and you still are now, honey."
    eil "Tu étais irrésistible à l'époque, et tu l'es toujours maintenant, chéri."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4296
translate french c30s006_eil_41238e83:

    # eil "*Laugh* I forbid you from reading Shakespeare to any girl in Aruba. Well, you can read it to [ama], [eva], or Aunt [bet]..."
    eil "*Rire* Je t'interdis de lire du Shakespeare à n'importe quelle fille à Aruba. Enfin, tu peux en lire à [ama], [eva], ou Tante [bet]..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4298
translate french c30s006_eil_66bfdd0e:

    # mc "But I don't know what that has to do with closing the circle."
    mc "Mais je ne vois pas ce que ça a à voir avec le fait de fermer le cercle."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4300
translate french c30s006_eil_6908eb69:

    # mc "And now you want to close the circle right here."
    mc "Et maintenant tu veux fermer le cercle juste ici."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4302
translate french c30s006_eil_630f2f6c:

    # eil "With this ring I declare myself your wife. I wanted it to be both a circle and a ring..."
    eil "Avec cet anneau, je me déclare ta femme. Je voulais que ce soit à la fois un cercle et une bague..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4305
translate french c30s006_eil_2df82cab:

    # eil "Although after seeing the other tattoos... it looks plain."
    eil "Même si après avoir vu les autres tatouages... il a l'air simple."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4307
translate french c30s006_eil_85d2e4a1:

    # eil "I know it looks a bit plain..."
    eil "Je sais qu'il a l'air un peu simple..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4308
translate french c30s006_eil_6d556fde:

    # mc "It looks perfect to me. And not just as a circle we're closing today, but for everything it means."
    mc "Il me semble parfait. Et pas seulement comme un cercle que nous fermons aujourd'hui, mais pour tout ce qu'il signifie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4309
translate french c30s006_eil_60010b50:

    # mc "A circle is a line. A line is a set of points. And we've traveled them all, you and I, together."
    mc "Un cercle est une ligne. Une ligne est un ensemble de points. Et nous les avons tous parcourus, toi et moi, ensemble."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4312
translate french c30s006_eil_d4129b88:

    # eil "You don't seem surprised that I declared myself your wife instead of asking you to marry me."
    eil "Tu n'as pas l'air surpris que je me sois déclarée ta femme au lieu de te demander de m'épouser."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4314
translate french c30s006_eil_8713ae2f:

    # eil "I hope you're not disappointed that I told you like this... Instead of asking you to marry me."
    eil "J'espère que tu n'es pas déçu que je te l'aie dit comme ça... Au lieu de te demander de m'épouser."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4315
translate french c30s006_eil_aca3df8a:

    # eil "I know I'm not the first, but..."
    eil "Je sais que je ne suis pas la première, mais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4316
translate french c30s006_eil_18220fc4:

    # mc "I'm not. The moment you talked about closing the circle..."
    mc "Je ne le suis pas. Au moment où tu as parlé de fermer le cercle..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4317
translate french c30s006_eil_07eb4f19:

    # mc "Asking me to marry you would just be another point on the circle. We'd have to close it at the wedding."
    mc "Me demander en mariage ne serait qu'un point de plus sur le cercle. On devrait le fermer lors du mariage."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4319
translate french c30s006_eil_707f665d:

    # eil "I always knew you'd ask me someday. Or at least I hoped you would..."
    eil "J'ai toujours su que tu me le demanderais un jour. Ou du moins, je l'espérais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4320
translate french c30s006_eil_dc12fcaf:

    # mc "I already did, [eil.nick]. Many times. And you always said yes."
    mc "Je l'ai déjà fait, [eil.nick]. Plein de fois. Et tu as toujours dit oui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4322
translate french c30s006_eil_ef24bf69:

    # eil "What? When?"
    eil "Quoi ? Quand ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4323
translate french c30s006_eil_7af9a0c4:

    # mc "Every time you slept over in my room during our senior year of high school."
    mc "À chaque fois que tu dormais dans ma chambre pendant notre dernière année de lycée."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4324
translate french c30s006_eil_9eb44d41:

    # mc "Who always fell asleep first?"
    mc "Qui s'endormait toujours en premier ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4326
translate french c30s006_eil_e502bffb:

    # eil "Me. *Laugh* I'd fall asleep the moment my head touched your chest. You were so comfortable..."
    eil "Moi. *Rires* Je m'endormais à la seconde où ma tête touchait ton torse. Tu étais tellement confortable..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4327
translate french c30s006_eil_184e3723:

    # mc "When you had been sleeping for a few minutes and my arm went numb, I always said the same thing."
    mc "Quand tu dormais depuis quelques minutes et que mon bras s'engourdissait, je disais toujours la même chose."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4328
translate french c30s006_eil_60183f2e:

    # mc "'I love you. One day I'll marry you. Will you marry me, [eil.nick]?'"
    mc "'Je t'aime. Un jour je t'épouserai. Veux-tu m'épouser, [eil.nick] ?'"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4330
translate french c30s006_eil_df31f998:

    # eil "*Laugh* And did I answer?"
    eil "*Rires* Et est-ce que je répondais ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4331
translate french c30s006_eil_bad375a1:

    # mc "You always said the same thing. 'Yes. Tomorrow.'"
    mc "Tu disais toujours la même chose. 'Oui. Demain.'"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4332
translate french c30s006_eil_9a0c29ba:

    # mc "And 'tomorrow' is today."
    mc "Et 'demain', c'est aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4334
translate french c30s006_eil_24e05be0:

    # "You take your wife in your arms for the first time as newlyweds."
    "Tu prends ta femme dans tes bras pour la première fois en tant que jeunes mariés."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4335
translate french c30s006_eil_e01ac0ed:

    # "You kiss as if you've been married for 25 years. As if your relationship had just begun. As if... As if you were made for each other."
    "Vous vous embrassez comme si vous étiez mariés depuis 25 ans. Comme si votre relation venait de commencer. Comme si... Comme si vous étiez faits l'un pour l'autre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4336
translate french c30s006_eil_3e06dcba:

    # "Your life with her flashes before your closed eyes as you remember every kiss, every embrace, every..."
    "Ta vie avec elle défile devant tes yeux fermés alors que tu te souviens de chaque baiser, de chaque étreinte, de chaque..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4338
translate french c30s006_eil_c1dbc1d6:

    # eil "I love you too."
    eil "Je t'aime aussi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4339
translate french c30s006_eil_0bdbade6:

    # mc "*Laugh* I just remembered something a little while ago. I don't know if I can love a liar."
    mc "*Rires* Je viens de me souvenir de quelque chose il y a un instant. Je ne sais pas si je peux aimer une menteuse."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4341
translate french c30s006_eil_994ddd17:

    # eil "What did that twisted mind of yours remember?"
    eil "De quoi ton esprit tordu s'est-il souvenu ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4342
translate french c30s006_eil_1b970c90:

    # mc "Do you remember the first time we talked about getting married one day? While you were awake, of course."
    mc "Tu te souviens de la première fois où on a parlé de se marier un jour ? Pendant que tu étais réveillée, bien sûr."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4344
translate french c30s006_eil_ad3fb2a5:

    # eil "*Laugh* I said we'd pay for Jamaal to get one of those online ordinations, so he could marry us."
    eil "*Rires* J'avais dit qu'on paierait Jamaal pour qu'il obtienne une de ces ordinations en ligne, pour qu'il puisse nous marier."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4345
translate french c30s006_eil_57d59f5f:

    # mc "*Laugh* I've been waiting for a while for Jamaal to show up in a robe or put on a clerical collar."
    mc "*Rires* Ça fait un moment que j'attends que Jamaal se pointe en soutane ou mette un col romain."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4346
translate french c30s006_eil_9868d037:

    # eil "*Laugh* He's still by the garage door. And he's still dressed... normally."
    eil "*Rire* Il est toujours près de la porte du garage. Et il est toujours habillé... normalement."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4347
translate french c30s006_eil_f3749152:

    # mc "*Laugh* I'm glad you broke your promise."
    mc "*Rire* Je suis content que tu aies rompu ta promesse."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4349
translate french c30s006_eil_d2f68ef5:

    # eil "Me too. This is just ours. It's our moment, even if it has to be very short."
    eil "Moi aussi. C'est juste à nous. C'est notre moment, même s'il doit être très court."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4351
translate french c30s006_eil_c555b884:

    # eil "And even if we have to share it with another of your girls."
    eil "Et même si on doit le partager avec une autre de tes filles."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4353
translate french c30s006_eil_d4d18733:

    # eil "And even if we have to share it with your other girls."
    eil "Et même si on doit le partager avec tes autres filles."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4355
translate french c30s006_eil_12a75e24:

    # mc "By the way, do you know you're wearing the same dress as [sai]?"
    mc "Au fait, tu sais que tu portes la même robe que [sai] ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4357
translate french c30s006_eil_bf119dfd:

    # eil "*Laugh* We discovered that a little while ago. Luckily the color is different."
    eil "*Rire* On a découvert ça il y a peu de temps. Heureusement que la couleur est différente."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4358
translate french c30s006_eil_a8338645:

    # eil "It makes sense to a certain extent. We share a taste in our husband and in dresses... Well, we share a husband."
    eil "C'est logique dans une certaine mesure. On partage les mêmes goûts pour notre mari et pour les robes... Enfin, on partage un mari."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4360
translate french c30s006_eil_e511e78f:

    # mc "I know. But..."
    mc "Je sais. Mais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4362
translate french c30s006_eil_50d8828a:

    # mc "I know."
    mc "Je sais."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4375
translate french c30s006_eil_3d7ee003:

    # eil "And now you should go with our master of ceremonies."
    eil "Et maintenant tu devrais y aller avec notre maître de cérémonie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4376
translate french c30s006_eil_1f51a10d:

    # eil "There's another girl waiting for you and, as First Concubine, I have to take care of her and not steal more time from her than necessary."
    eil "Il y a une autre fille qui t'attend et, en tant que Première Concubine, je dois prendre soin d'elle et ne pas lui voler plus de temps que nécessaire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4379
translate french c30s006_eil_32d399b7:

    # eil "We shouldn't steal any more time from them."
    eil "Nous ne devrions pas leur voler plus de temps."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4381
translate french c30s006_eil_e663a11e:

    # "You steal a little time to prolong the kiss as much as possible before having to separate."
    "Tu voles un peu de temps pour prolonger le baiser autant que possible avant de devoir vous séparer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4382
translate french c30s006_eil_27e396cb:

    # "Your wedding with [eil] felt too short. As short as every one of your kisses seems, regardless of how long they last."
    "Ton mariage avec [eil] a semblé trop court. Aussi court que chacun de vos baisers, peu importe combien de temps ils durent."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4386
translate french c30s006_bet_d701c163:

    # "Jamaal accompanies you to where [bet] is waiting for you."
    "Jamaal t'accompagne là où [bet] t'attend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4398
translate french c30s006_bet_1eaec4a7:

    # mc "You look gorgeous, [bet]."
    mc "Tu es magnifique, [bet]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4401
translate french c30s006_bet_f4523fc7:

    # mc "Welcome back home."
    mc "Bienvenue à la maison."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4402
translate french c30s006_bet_a63ecc15:

    # mc "It feels weird seeing you dressed like this and... wearing makeup."
    mc "Ça fait bizarre de te voir habillée comme ça et... maquillée."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4404
translate french c30s006_bet_d55f5189:

    # "After several days apart, your lips seek each other out before the ex-nun can answer."
    "Après plusieurs jours séparés, vos lèvres se cherchent avant que l'ex-nonne ne puisse répondre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4405
translate french c30s006_bet_ac130ccf:

    # "It's a brief kiss, but it's enough to satisfy the hunger for each other you've had these past few days. At least for now."
    "C'est un baiser bref, mais c'est suffisant pour satisfaire la faim que vous aviez l'un de l'autre ces derniers jours. Du moins pour l'instant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4407
translate french c30s006_bet_bf07ec13:

    # bet "A woman has to make herself look pretty for what we're about to do, right?"
    bet "Une femme doit se faire belle pour ce qu'on s'apprête à faire, non ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4408
translate french c30s006_bet_57a619cd:

    # mc "You didn't have to do it. I know you don't like wearing makeup. And you're beautiful without it, too."
    mc "Tu n'étais pas obligée de le faire. Je sais que tu n'aimes pas te maquiller. Et tu es magnifique sans, aussi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4410
translate french c30s006_bet_41b9b8af:

    # mc "But I still don't know what we're going to do..."
    mc "Mais je ne sais toujours pas ce qu'on va faire..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4412
translate french c30s006_bet_b57a0e2f:

    # bet "Some girls told me about a crazy idea over a video call a few days ago..."
    bet "Certaines filles m'ont parlé d'une idée folle lors d'un appel vidéo il y a quelques jours..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4414
translate french c30s006_bet_428b3337:

    # bet "And the harem thought it was fine... I didn't think so at first, but..."
    bet "Et le harem a trouvé ça bien... Je ne le pensais pas au début, mais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4418
translate french c30s006_bet_d5fc6ccc:

    # bet "When [mad.nick] suggested the tattoo thing, the day we were leaving, right after the post-it, I thought it was crazy."
    bet "Quand [mad.nick] a suggéré le truc du tatouage, le jour de notre départ, juste après le post-it, j'ai trouvé ça dingue."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4420
translate french c30s006_bet_981c554d:

    # bet "When they suggested the tattoo thing, during a video call, I thought it was crazy."
    bet "Quand elles ont suggéré le truc du tatouage, pendant un appel vidéo, j'ai trouvé ça dingue."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4421
translate french c30s006_bet_eac4f0c6:

    # bet "The more I thought about it, the better it looked."
    bet "Plus j'y pensais, plus ça me plaisait."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4422
translate french c30s006_bet_15b4725f:

    # mc "Sometimes you girls are scary when you start planning things."
    mc "Parfois, vous faites peur les filles quand vous commencez à planifier des trucs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4424
translate french c30s006_bet_3244ad36:

    # bet "The makeup was the final touch. Without it I felt a bit... plain."
    bet "Le maquillage, c'était la touche finale. Sans ça, je me sentais un peu... quelconque."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4425
translate french c30s006_bet_11f72a8d:

    # mc "Plain? In that dress? You look incredible!"
    mc "Quelconque ? Dans cette robe ? Tu es incroyable !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4427
translate french c30s006_bet_e5bf5c27:

    # bet "I'm not talking about the dress. With this ring I declare myself your wife. I know it's a very simple ring, but..."
    bet "Je ne parle pas de la robe. Avec cette bague, je me déclare ta femme. Je sais que c'est une bague très simple, mais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4429
translate french c30s006_bet_c24a8cc6:

    # mc "What? You want to marry me?"
    mc "Quoi ? Tu veux m'épouser ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4430
translate french c30s006_bet_57392c9f:

    # bet "No, I'm just informing you that we are married."
    bet "Non, je t'informe juste que nous sommes mariés."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4432
translate french c30s006_bet_93e02c5a:

    # mc "It's super cool!"
    mc "C'est super cool !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4434
translate french c30s006_bet_8501b711:

    # bet "*Laugh* If I didn't ask God for permission when I married Him, I'm not asking you either. Though I hope our marriage ends up better."
    bet "*Rires* Si je n'ai pas demandé la permission à Dieu quand je L'ai épousé, je ne te la demande pas non plus. Même si j'espère que notre mariage finira mieux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4435
translate french c30s006_bet_0adc99db:

    # mc "*Laugh* He gave you his implicit permission, if he exists. If he hadn't wanted it, he would've struck you with a vengeful lightning bolt or something."
    mc "*Rires* Il t'a donné sa permission implicite, s'il existe. S'il n'en avait pas voulu, il t'aurait frappée avec un éclair vengeur ou un truc du genre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4436
translate french c30s006_bet_4450d272:

    # bet "*Laugh* Yeah, that'd be very much his style."
    bet "*Rires* Ouais, ce serait tout à fait son genre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4438
translate french c30s006_bet_bf94198a:

    # bet "What about you? Do you take me as your wife?"
    bet "Et toi ? Tu me prends pour épouse ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4439
translate french c30s006_bet_350d51ec:

    # mc "*Laugh* Well, I can't shoot vengeful lightning bolts... The Mjolnir thing is just a nickname."
    mc "*Rires* Eh bien, je ne peux pas lancer d'éclairs vengeurs... Cette histoire de Mjolnir, c'est juste un surnom."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4440
translate french c30s006_bet_3fa46961:

    # mc "But I can do this."
    mc "Mais je peux faire ça."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4442
translate french c30s006_bet_7841d839:

    # "You take the ex-nun in your arms and give her a passionate kiss."
    "Tu prends l'ex-nonne dans tes bras et lui donnes un baiser passionné."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4443
translate french c30s006_bet_e182ed99:

    # "She doesn't need to wear makeup or change anything to be a wonderful woman. Though you have to admit it suits her well."
    "Elle n'a pas besoin de se maquiller ou de changer quoi que ce soit pour être une femme merveilleuse. Même si tu dois admettre que ça lui va bien."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4444
translate french c30s006_bet_60fcf5a9:

    # "A part of your brain expects a vengeful lightning bolt to strike during the whole kiss."
    "Une partie de ton cerveau s'attend à ce qu'un éclair vengeur te frappe pendant tout le baiser."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4445
translate french c30s006_bet_6bbb53e4:

    # "That part of your brain thinks that stealing God's wife might have unexpected consequences. Did you just netoried God?"
    "Cette partie de ton cerveau pense que voler la femme de Dieu pourrait avoir des conséquences inattendues. Tu viens de NTR Dieu ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4447
translate french c30s006_bet_b2b1ee82:

    # "By the time the kiss ends, the rest of your mind has silenced the part that worried too much."
    "Au moment où le baiser se termine, le reste de ton esprit a fait taire la partie qui s'inquiétait trop."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4448
translate french c30s006_bet_da3416b3:

    # bet "*Laugh* You don't shoot lightning bolts, but a current ran from head to toe with that kiss."
    bet "*Rires* Tu ne lances pas d'éclairs, mais un courant m'a traversée de la tête aux pieds avec ce baiser."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4449
translate french c30s006_bet_16f104b7:

    # mc "*Laugh* It might just turn out that I really am a god after all."
    mc "*Rires* Il se pourrait bien que je sois vraiment un dieu après tout."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4451
translate french c30s006_bet_8b717354:

    # bet "*Laugh* Don't let it go to your head."
    bet "*Rires* Ne prends pas la grosse tête."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4453
translate french c30s006_bet_efb16b55:

    # bet "*Laugh* In the end, I traded a god's harem for a divine husband's."
    bet "*Rires* Au final, j'ai échangé le harem d'un dieu contre celui d'un mari divin."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4455
translate french c30s006_bet_a6f37f25:

    # bet "*Laugh* In the end, I traded one divine husband for another."
    bet "*Rires* Au final, j'ai échangé un mari divin contre un autre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4456
translate french c30s006_bet_2cb3ebe0:

    # mc "*Laugh* I think if you keep saying things like that, it really is going to go to my head."
    mc "*Rires* Je crois que si tu continues à dire des choses comme ça, je vais vraiment prendre la grosse tête."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4458
translate french c30s006_bet_865ef142:

    # bet "*Giggles* Well, I think togas and tunics look better on him, if that helps bring you down a peg."
    bet "*Gloussements* Eh bien, je trouve que les toges et les tuniques lui vont mieux, si ça peut t'aider à redescendre sur terre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4459
translate french c30s006_bet_94427f9b:

    # mc "*Laugh* Right where it hurts. You all agree that clothes look bad on me. Even Jamaal."
    mc "*Rires* En plein dans le mille. Vous êtes tous d'accord pour dire que les vêtements me vont mal. Même Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4460
translate french c30s006_bet_6d5f71b1:

    # bet "*Laugh* It's just that, except for this suit, almost everything looks bad on you."
    bet "*Rires* C'est juste qu'à part ce costume, presque tout te va mal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4461
translate french c30s006_bet_60b586be:

    # mc "*Laugh* Sometimes I hate you all..."
    mc "*Rires* Parfois je vous déteste toutes..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4462
translate french c30s006_bet_c2af87c6:

    # mc "Changing the subject, I like that you chose a ring that's simple yet beautiful."
    mc "Pour changer de sujet, j'aime que tu aies choisi une bague à la fois simple et magnifique."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4464
translate french c30s006_bet_ade5eaa7:

    # bet "I think it defines us quite well. Our relationship is... more beautiful than passionate..."
    bet "Je trouve que ça nous définit plutôt bien. Notre relation est... plus belle que passionnée..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4465
translate french c30s006_bet_26527847:

    # bet "Don't get me wrong. I'm not complaining... I doubt many women could have a night like the one we had in Monterey."
    bet "Ne te méprends pas. Je ne m'en plains pas... Je doute que beaucoup de femmes puissent vivre une nuit comme celle qu'on a eue à Monterey."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4466
translate french c30s006_bet_1da42911:

    # mc "We haven't had much time to be together since we got back from Monterey... At least I hope to spend time with you in Aruba."
    mc "On n'a pas eu beaucoup de temps pour être ensemble depuis notre retour de Monterey... J'espère au moins passer du temps avec toi à Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4468
translate french c30s006_bet_dc116e3f:

    # mc "But I have a question..."
    mc "Mais j'ai une question..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4480
translate french c30s006_bet_89ae90ed:

    # bet "And now I think you should go. There's another girl waiting for you."
    bet "Et maintenant, je pense que tu devrais y aller. Il y a une autre fille qui t'attend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4481
translate french c30s006_bet_754d4ffd:

    # mc "And then there's the party to welcome you and Meemaw."
    mc "Et puis il y a la fête pour vous accueillir, toi et Meemaw."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4483
translate french c30s006_bet_352265c1:

    # bet "And now I think we should get going. [mee] must be getting impatient."
    bet "Et maintenant, je pense qu'on devrait y aller. [mee] doit commencer à s'impatienter."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4484
translate french c30s006_bet_64468151:

    # mc "Let's go before she stops being impatient and starts getting angry."
    mc "Allons-y avant qu'elle n'arrête de s'impatienter et commence à s'énerver."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4486
translate french c30s006_bet_44ec7625:

    # bet "*Laugh* Besides, [nor] promised me she'd order pizza."
    bet "*Rire* En plus, [nor] m'a promis qu'elle commanderait des pizzas."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4488
translate french c30s006_bet_50d08048:

    # "You give her a quick kiss while thinking if there's anything [bet] prefers over pizza."
    "Tu lui donnes un baiser rapide tout en te demandant s'il y a quelque chose que [bet] préfère à la pizza."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4489
translate french c30s006_bet_16e7c5e5:

    # "Other than kisses, hugs, and sex."
    "À part les bisous, les câlins et le sexe."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4490
translate french c30s006_bet_c909a0a9:

    # "The avenging lightning bolt doesn't strike this time either."
    "La foudre vengeresse ne s'abat pas cette fois non plus."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4494
translate french c30s006_mee_0454fc12:

    # "You walk with Jamaal to the front of [nor]'s house, where [mee] is waiting for you."
    "Tu marches avec Jamaal jusqu'à l'avant de la maison de [nor], où [mee] t'attend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4495
translate french c30s006_mee_d9538034:

    # "She's in the same spot where she waited for you, soaking wet, on the day of your date."
    "Elle est au même endroit où elle t'a attendu, trempée jusqu'aux os, le jour de votre rencard."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4507
translate french c30s006_mee_3d5a0eea:

    # mc "You look gorgeous, Meemaw."
    mc "Tu es magnifique, Mamie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4511
translate french c30s006_mee_77cd268a:

    # "You kiss the beautiful old lady, welcoming her back to the madhouse."
    "Tu embrasses la belle vieille dame, lui souhaitant un bon retour dans cette maison de fous."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4513
translate french c30s006_mee_6207dd43:

    # mc "Welcome back home, by the way."
    mc "Bon retour à la maison, d'ailleurs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4514
translate french c30s006_mee_f39ccf73:

    # mee "Are you ever going to stop calling me Meemaw? We're together and..."
    mee "Tu vas arrêter de m'appeler Mamie un jour ? On est ensemble et..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4515
translate french c30s006_mee_128ba819:

    # mc "I don't think so, if it doesn't bother you. To me you'll always be Meemaw. I can't think of you as [mee]."
    mc "Je ne pense pas, si ça ne te dérange pas. Pour moi, tu seras toujours Mamie. Je n'arrive pas à te voir comme [mee]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4516
translate french c30s006_mee_63b3a05b:

    # mc "I know we're dating now, but that doesn't stop you from being my Meemaw."
    mc "Je sais qu'on sort ensemble maintenant, mais ça ne t'empêche pas d'être ma Mamie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4517
translate french c30s006_mee_f995842d:

    # mc "Though, if it bothers you, I could try."
    mc "Cependant, si ça te dérange, je pourrais essayer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4519
translate french c30s006_mee_6b355fbb:

    # mee "It doesn't bother me. I just thought that, maybe, you'd want to start calling me by my name."
    mee "Ça ne me dérange pas. Je me disais juste que, peut-être, tu voudrais commencer à m'appeler par mon prénom."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4521
translate french c30s006_mee_21adc95b:

    # mee "And stop thinking of me as your grandmother."
    mee "Et arrêter de me voir comme ta grand-mère."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4523
translate french c30s006_mee_306d2530:

    # mee "And stop thinking of me as your pseudo-grandmother."
    mee "Et arrêter de me voir comme ta pseudo-grand-mère."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4524
translate french c30s006_mee_8c778ea0:

    # mc "I'll never stop thinking of you that way. Just because we're together doesn't mean we should stop being who we are."
    mc "Je n'arrêterai jamais de te voir comme ça. Ce n'est pas parce qu'on est ensemble qu'on doit arrêter d'être qui nous sommes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4525
translate french c30s006_mee_f65cda30:

    # mc "Though I don't understand why you want me to stop calling you Meemaw all of a sudden."
    mc "Même si je ne comprends pas pourquoi tu veux que j'arrête de t'appeler Mamie tout d'un coup."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4527
translate french c30s006_mee_10b3834d:

    # mee "I don't, but if you wanted to, this tattoo would lose a bit of its meaning."
    mee "Je ne le veux pas, mais si tu le voulais, ce tatouage perdrait un peu de son sens."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4528
translate french c30s006_mee_22038707:

    # mee "With these rings, I declare myself your wife. One for grandmother, one for lover, and the third for wife."
    mee "Avec ces anneaux, je me déclare ta femme. Un pour la grand-mère, un pour l'amante, et le troisième pour l'épouse."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4530
translate french c30s006_mee_8c2e880e:

    # mc "What? Are you asking me to marry you?"
    mc "Quoi ? Tu es en train de me demander en mariage ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4531
translate french c30s006_mee_cbc28dda:

    # mee "*Laugh* No, I'm informing you that we're married."
    mee "*Rires* Non, je t'informe que nous sommes mariés."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4532
translate french c30s006_mee_61e0bbc6:

    # mc "I love it. You've found a beautiful meaning for the tattoo."
    mc "J'adore. Tu as trouvé une belle signification pour le tatouage."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4534
translate french c30s006_mee_117f96c3:

    # mee "Don't look too much into the colors of the rings..."
    mee "Ne t'attarde pas trop sur les couleurs des anneaux..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4535
translate french c30s006_mee_88334ecb:

    # mc "Before saying what each ring meant, I thought about your hair. From black to white, passing through silver."
    mc "Avant de dire ce que chaque anneau signifiait, j'ai pensé à tes cheveux. Du noir au blanc, en passant par l'argenté."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4536
translate french c30s006_mee_bbe1de8d:

    # mc "It sums up our whole history, although I don't remember you with black hair other than in the photos I've seen."
    mc "Ça résume toute notre histoire, même si je ne me souviens pas de toi avec des cheveux noirs, à part sur les photos que j'ai vues."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4538
translate french c30s006_mee_425df98e:

    # mee "*Laugh* I think I already had some gray hair when you were born. I was [nor]'s age."
    mee "*Rires* Je crois que j'avais déjà des cheveux gris quand tu es né. J'avais l'âge de [nor]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4539
translate french c30s006_mee_90e57846:

    # mc "Someday we'll have to sit down and look at photos of you when you were young to see what I missed."
    mc "Un jour, il faudra qu'on s'assoie et qu'on regarde des photos de toi quand tu étais jeune pour voir ce que j'ai raté."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4540
translate french c30s006_mee_d95acac8:

    # mc "Don't get me wrong, I wouldn't trade this version of you for any other, but I've never looked at your old photos seeing you as a woman."
    mc "Ne te méprends pas, je n'échangerais cette version de toi pour aucune autre, mais je n'ai jamais regardé tes vieilles photos en te voyant comme une femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4541
translate french c30s006_mee_f1b98564:

    # mc "You've always been Meemaw. And you always will be."
    mc "Tu as toujours été Meemaw. Et tu le seras toujours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4543
translate french c30s006_mee_71cd67eb:

    # mee "You'll be surprised by some of those old photos... Some of them are a bit risqué. Although those aren't in the family photo album."
    mee "Tu seras surpris par certaines de ces vieilles photos... Certaines sont un peu osées. Bien qu'elles ne soient pas dans l'album photo de famille."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4544
translate french c30s006_mee_75be8823:

    # mc "I'm looking forward to seeing those. But I think, right now, I need to kiss my wife."
    mc "J'ai hâte de voir ça. Mais je crois que, là tout de suite, j'ai besoin d'embrasser ma femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4546
translate french c30s006_mee_3ce60a68:

    # "You wrap your arms around the woman and kiss her passionately."
    "Tu passes tes bras autour de la femme et l'embrasses passionnément."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4547
translate french c30s006_mee_c7d3002a:

    # "You remember how fragile she seemed when she came home, still recovering from chemotherapy."
    "Tu te souviens à quel point elle semblait fragile quand elle est rentrée à la maison, se remettant encore de sa chimiothérapie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4548
translate french c30s006_mee_ca2dd766:

    # "That fragility has disappeared, replaced by strength and a joy for life."
    "Cette fragilité a disparu, remplacée par de la force et une joie de vivre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4550
translate french c30s006_mee_1cb7d108:

    # mee "Stop, or I'm going to stain my dress with milk..."
    mee "Arrête, ou je vais tacher ma robe avec du lait..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4551
translate french c30s006_mee_1d6ce081:

    # mc "Are you turned on already?"
    mc "T'es déjà excitée ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4553
translate french c30s006_mee_a86509f1:

    # mee "*Laugh* I've been turned on since I saw you show up with Jamaal."
    mee "*Rires* Je suis excitée depuis que je t'ai vu débarquer avec Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4554
translate french c30s006_mee_f25ca35d:

    # mc "*Laugh* You never cease to amaze me."
    mc "*Rires* Tu ne cesses jamais de m'étonner."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4567
translate french c30s006_mee_b2798f60:

    # mee "You should go now. I don't want to keep you longer than necessary."
    mee "Tu devrais y aller maintenant. Je ne veux pas te retenir plus longtemps que nécessaire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4569
translate french c30s006_mee_b92cd66f:

    # mee "My daughter is waiting for you. She's next."
    mee "Ma fille t'attend. C'est la prochaine."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4571
translate french c30s006_mee_afddf2ae:

    # mee "[mar] is waiting for you. She's next."
    mee "[mar] t'attend. C'est la prochaine."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4573
translate french c30s006_mee_5c41aefb:

    # mee "[ama] is waiting for you. She's next."
    mee "[ama] t'attend. C'est la prochaine."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4574
translate french c30s006_mee_72d90bd7:

    # mc "I hate having to do this so quickly, but I can't wait to see her and find out what she has prepared. Or tattooed."
    mc "Je déteste devoir faire ça si vite, mais j'ai hâte de la voir et de découvrir ce qu'elle a préparé. Ou tatoué."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4576
translate french c30s006_mee_0b698cef:

    # mee "We should go to the welcome party now. They won't start without me."
    mee "On devrait aller à la fête de bienvenue maintenant. Ils ne commenceront pas sans moi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4577
translate french c30s006_mee_7ee3de1e:

    # mee "And if the food gets cold, [bet] is going to get mad."
    mee "Et si la nourriture refroidit, [bet] va se mettre en colère."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4578
translate french c30s006_mee_c669c20f:

    # mc "*Laugh* I don't think she'd get mad today even if we left her without food."
    mc "*Rire* Je ne pense pas qu'elle se mettrait en colère aujourd'hui, même si on la laissait sans rien à manger."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4581
translate french c30s006_mee_f2a7f40c:

    # "You give the beautiful woman a quick kiss before going back to Jamaal."
    "Tu donnes un baiser rapide à la belle femme avant de retourner voir Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4583
translate french c30s006_mee_44ed7f0a:

    # "You give the beautiful woman a quick kiss before heading to the welcome party where she is one of the guests of honor."
    "Tu donnes un baiser rapide à la belle femme avant de te diriger vers la fête de bienvenue où elle est l'une des invitées d'honneur."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4587
translate french c30s006_nor_f6c839fd:

    # "Jamaal guides you to the place where you ate on the first Sunday after your return."
    "Jamaal te guide jusqu'à l'endroit où tu as mangé le premier dimanche après ton retour."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4588
translate french c30s006_nor_6feaeb46:

    # "Dressing up for lunch fell out of practice once [mar] got out of her depression."
    "S'habiller chic pour le déjeuner s'est perdu une fois que [mar] est sortie de sa dépression."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4589
translate french c30s006_nor_370ee0c2:

    # "[nor] is waiting for you right where you kissed that day."
    "[nor] t'attend exactement là où vous vous êtes embrassés ce jour-là."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4602
translate french c30s006_nor_6ba9a7bd:

    # mc "I love that dress, [nor]. And even more so, what's inside it."
    mc "J'adore cette robe, [nor]. Et encore plus ce qu'il y a dedans."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4604
translate french c30s006_nor_334d5ddf:

    # nor "I don't remember the last time I wore white. A month ago, maybe? But it seemed like a good idea to do it today."
    nor "Je ne me souviens pas de la dernière fois que j'ai porté du blanc. Il y a un mois, peut-être ? Mais ça m'a semblé être une bonne idée de le faire aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4605
translate french c30s006_nor_5df46d1d:

    # mc "If every white dress looks like that on you, I think you should alternate them with the red ones."
    mc "Si toutes les robes blanches te vont comme ça, je pense que tu devrais les alterner avec les rouges."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4607
translate french c30s006_nor_3915d4cd:

    # nor "*Laugh* You don't like my red dresses?"
    nor "*Rires* Tu n'aimes pas mes robes rouges ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4608
translate french c30s006_nor_af1c9927:

    # mc "I love everything about you. Your dresses and when you take them off. Your red lips that stand out even more when you're dressed in white."
    mc "J'aime tout chez toi. Tes robes et quand tu les enlèves. Tes lèvres rouges qui ressortent encore plus quand tu es habillée en blanc."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4609
translate french c30s006_nor_3e138c53:

    # mc "There's nothing I would change about you. I've told you that many times."
    mc "Il n'y a rien que je changerais chez toi. Je te l'ai dit plein de fois."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4611
translate french c30s006_nor_6fd2789d:

    # nor "And that's one of the reasons why I'm in love with you."
    nor "Et c'est l'une des raisons pour lesquelles je suis amoureuse de toi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4612
translate french c30s006_nor_257109cb:

    # nor "You started out kissing an insecure woman and now I'm able to wear white... *Laugh* And white makes you look fat."
    nor "Tu as commencé par embrasser une femme qui manquait de confiance en elle et maintenant je suis capable de porter du blanc... *Rires* Et le blanc, ça grossit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4614
translate french c30s006_nor_a36aadf1:

    # nor "But would you really not change anything about me? Not even my back or my shoulders?"
    nor "Mais tu ne changerais vraiment rien chez moi ? Même pas mon dos ou mes épaules ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4615
translate french c30s006_nor_ce3a349f:

    # mc "I can swear it on everything holy."
    mc "Je peux le jurer sur tout ce qu'il y a de plus sacré."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4617
translate french c30s006_nor_cb817f62:

    # mc "Although I really want to see what you got tattooed."
    mc "Même si j'ai vraiment envie de voir ce que tu t'es fait tatouer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4620
translate french c30s006_nor_2344e727:

    # nor "Well, I'm very sorry, but there is a change."
    nor "Eh bien, je suis vraiment désolée, mais il y a un changement."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4621
translate french c30s006_nor_5633de16:

    # nor "With these rings, I declare myself your wife."
    nor "Avec ces bagues, je me déclare ta femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4622
translate french c30s006_nor_492b2426:

    # mc "What? I love them!"
    mc "Quoi ? Je les adore !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4624
translate french c30s006_nor_be145f13:

    # nor "I wanted to represent a lot of things with them, but I'm not entirely convinced you'd understand..."
    nor "Je voulais représenter beaucoup de choses avec, mais je ne suis pas tout à fait convaincue que tu comprendrais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4625
translate french c30s006_nor_5d6d2ac3:

    # mc "You can explain it to me if you want, but first I want to kiss you."
    mc "Tu peux me l'expliquer si tu veux, mais d'abord j'ai envie de t'embrasser."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4627
translate french c30s006_nor_9de8d95f:

    # "How much everything has changed in a month! The insecure woman you kissed in that cafe has gotten a tattoo to declare herself your wife."
    "Comme tout a changé en un mois ! La femme peu sûre d'elle que tu as embrassée dans ce café s'est fait tatouer pour se déclarer ta femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4628
translate french c30s006_nor_4e46c22c:

    # "Her lips are still like a home to always return to. That will never change."
    "Ses lèvres sont toujours comme un foyer où revenir. Ça ne changera jamais."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4629
translate french c30s006_nor_ba9d2ce6:

    # "It's impossible not to think about all the moments you've spent together over the last five weeks while her tongue explores your mouth."
    "Il est impossible de ne pas penser à tous les moments que vous avez passés ensemble au cours des cinq dernières semaines pendant que sa langue explore ta bouche."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4631
translate french c30s006_nor_a50ba377:

    # mc "Now you can explain it to me."
    mc "Maintenant, tu peux m'expliquer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4632
translate french c30s006_nor_6b556e89:

    # nor "*Laugh* I don't have the breath to do it right now."
    nor "*Rires* Je n'ai pas le souffle pour le faire tout de suite."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4633
translate french c30s006_nor_24cbcccb:

    # mc "Then you won't have the breath to resist if I take off your dress either, right?"
    mc "Alors tu n'auras pas non plus le souffle pour résister si je t'enlève ta robe, n'est-ce pas ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4635
translate french c30s006_nor_ef9463b1:

    # nor "What? You want to take off my dress? Now?"
    nor "Quoi ? Tu veux m'enlever ma robe ? Maintenant ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4636
translate french c30s006_nor_59ebb47a:

    # mc "*Laugh* I always want to take off whatever you're wearing. But I figured going to the party naked would be the ultimate step in your exhibitionism."
    mc "*Rires* J'ai toujours envie d'enlever ce que tu portes. Mais je me suis dit qu'aller à la fête toute nue serait l'étape ultime de ton exhibitionnisme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4638
translate french c30s006_nor_ecf892d8:

    # nor "*Laugh* And my mother's first step towards the coffin. If I go naked, she'll have a heart attack."
    nor "*Rires* Et le premier pas de ma mère vers le cercueil. Si j'y vais nue, elle va faire une crise cardiaque."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4639
translate french c30s006_nor_e6dd70a6:

    # mc "I was joking, but I see you've caught your breath. Care to explain the tattoo?"
    mc "Je plaisantais, mais je vois que tu as repris ton souffle. Tu veux bien m'expliquer ce tatouage ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4641
translate french c30s006_nor_f858ed42:

    # nor "They're two intertwined rings, representing you and me."
    nor "Ce sont deux anneaux entrelacés, qui nous représentent toi et moi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4642
translate french c30s006_nor_a589503c:

    # nor "I thought that all of this didn't start when you came back from college, but rather that we've been walking towards this moment for years."
    nor "Je me suis dit que tout ça n'a pas commencé quand tu es revenu de l'université, mais plutôt qu'on avance vers ce moment depuis des années."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4644
translate french c30s006_nor_67c3ae50:

    # nor "That's why the rings don't have smooth edges... They're like a zigzag where we kept getting closer and pulling away."
    nor "C'est pour ça que les anneaux n'ont pas de bords lisses... C'est comme un zigzag où on n'a pas arrêté de se rapprocher et de s'éloigner."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4645
translate french c30s006_nor_175ae74a:

    # nor "And they have different shades to represent all the phases we've been through."
    nor "Et ils ont différentes nuances pour représenter toutes les phases par lesquelles on est passés."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4647
translate french c30s006_nor_1aab70d4:

    # nor "I know... Very abstract, and nobody is going to get the meaning if I don't explain it to them."
    nor "Je sais... Très abstrait, et personne ne comprendra la signification si je ne leur explique pas."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4648
translate french c30s006_nor_249d2dac:

    # mc "Do you need to explain it to anyone? Well, except me, but you know I have a hard time catching on to things, sometimes."
    mc "As-tu besoin de l'expliquer à qui que ce soit ? Enfin, à part moi, mais tu sais que j'ai parfois du mal à comprendre les choses."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4649
translate french c30s006_nor_22c1bd1f:

    # mc "Now that you've explained it to me, I think it's a fantastic tattoo."
    mc "Maintenant que tu me l'as expliqué, je trouve que c'est un tatouage fantastique."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4651
translate french c30s006_nor_02c1164b:

    # nor "You're right, we don't owe anyone an explanation, do we?"
    nor "Tu as raison, on ne doit d'explications à personne, pas vrai ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4652
translate french c30s006_nor_b1d5bd51:

    # mc "Only to whoever we want to give them to, sweetheart."
    mc "Seulement à ceux à qui on a envie d'en donner, ma chérie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4665
translate french c30s006_nor_55be637a:

    # nor "Well, enough explanations. You need to go."
    nor "Bon, assez d'explications. Tu dois y aller."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4667
translate french c30s006_nor_e4a82d36:

    # nor "[mar] must be getting impatient."
    nor "[mar] doit commencer à s'impatienter."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4669
translate french c30s006_nor_e56ffe5b:

    # nor "[ama] must be getting impatient."
    nor "[ama] doit commencer à s'impatienter."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4670
translate french c30s006_nor_459986f2:

    # mc "You know I'd stay here with you a while longer, right?"
    mc "Tu sais que je resterais bien ici avec toi un peu plus longtemps, pas vrai ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4671
translate french c30s006_nor_acca25ea:

    # nor "I know, but you can't keep her waiting."
    nor "Je sais, mais tu ne peux pas la faire attendre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4673
translate french c30s006_nor_f0739e10:

    # nor "Well, enough explanations. We need to go."
    nor "Bon, assez d'explications. Il faut qu'on y aille."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4674
translate french c30s006_nor_7f170b3e:

    # nor "My mom and Aunt [bet] must be getting impatient."
    nor "Ma mère et tante [bet] doivent commencer à s'impatienter."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4675
translate french c30s006_nor_9793940b:

    # mc "I'm sure they'll understand if we take a little while. You know I'd stay here with you a while longer, right?"
    mc "Je suis sûr qu'elles comprendront si on prend un peu de temps. Tu sais que je resterais bien ici avec toi un peu plus longtemps, pas vrai ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4676
translate french c30s006_nor_670f8956:

    # nor "I know, but we can't keep them waiting. And I have to stop by [mar]'s kitchen before joining the party."
    nor "Je sais, mais on ne peut pas les faire attendre. Et je dois passer par la cuisine de [mar] avant de rejoindre la fête."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4678
translate french c30s006_nor_f6f054a1:

    # "You share a quick goodbye kiss. You'll only be apart for a few minutes, but it's going to feel like a lifetime."
    "Vous échangez un rapide baiser d'au revoir. Vous ne serez séparés que quelques minutes, mais ça va vous paraître une éternité."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4679
translate french c30s006_nor_46424b7e:

    # "And, in a couple of days, you'll be apart for a few months. That's going to be hell."
    "Et, dans quelques jours, vous serez séparés pendant quelques mois. Ça va être l'enfer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4684
translate french c30s006_mar_430a3249:

    # "Jamaal escorts you to the final stop of the amazing tour."
    "Jamaal t'escorte jusqu'au dernier arrêt de cette incroyable visite."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4686
translate french c30s006_mar_70c8adb4:

    # "Jamaal escorts you to the second to last stop of the amazing tour."
    "Jamaal t'escorte jusqu'à l'avant-dernière étape de cette incroyable visite."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4688
translate french c30s006_mar_ce9bbddd:

    # "Jamaal escorts you back to your front door."
    "Jamaal t'escorte jusqu'à ta porte d'entrée."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4689
translate french c30s006_mar_5f9a0d70:

    # "[mar] is waiting there, in the same spot where you first saw each other when you came back home."
    "[mar] attend là, au même endroit où vous vous êtes vus pour la première fois quand tu es rentré à la maison."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4701
translate french c30s006_mar_339796c5:

    # mc "Today I'm the luckiest guy in the world. Several times over, actually."
    mc "Aujourd'hui, je suis le mec le plus chanceux du monde. Plusieurs fois, en fait."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4702
translate french c30s006_mar_aed574b5:

    # mom "*Laugh* I hope you feel that way. I feel like the luckiest woman in the world."
    mom "*Rires* J'espère que c'est ce que tu ressens. Je me sens comme la femme la plus chanceuse du monde."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4706
translate french c30s006_mar_a75d6fb0:

    # mc "I guess today it wouldn't work if I told you I was the Amazonian delivery guy."
    mc "J'imagine qu'aujourd'hui ça ne marcherait pas si je te disais que je suis le livreur Amazon."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4707
translate french c30s006_mar_c0d0eda4:

    # mom "You guess right. Unless you bring a box of donuts."
    mom "Tu imagines bien. À moins que tu n'apportes une boîte de donuts."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4708
translate french c30s006_mar_855cf7d1:

    # mc "Well, I already gave you the best donut in the world. The one that made you my wife."
    mc "Eh bien, je t'ai déjà donné le meilleur donut du monde. Celui qui a fait de toi ma femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4711
translate french c30s006_mar_91d3c180:

    # mom "Which has left me a bit on the sidelines today. I'm the only one who can't declare herself your wife. I already am."
    mom "Ce qui m'a laissée un peu sur la touche aujourd'hui. Je suis la seule qui ne peut pas se déclarer comme étant ta femme. Je le suis déjà."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4712
translate french c30s006_mar_b9a8c363:

    # mc "But even so, I want to know what you got tattooed."
    mc "Mais quand même, je veux savoir ce que tu t'es fait tatouer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4714
translate french c30s006_mar_86c0f13a:

    # mom "Which made this a bit unnecessary. But the girls insisted and I think it's a nice gesture before you leave."
    mom "Ce qui rendait ça un peu inutile. Mais les filles ont insisté et je trouve que c'est un beau geste avant que tu partes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4715
translate french c30s006_mar_3401de95:

    # mc "I don't know if you've noticed, but I still don't know what this is all about."
    mc "Je ne sais pas si tu as remarqué, mais je ne sais toujours pas de quoi il s'agit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4717
translate french c30s006_mar_30e17019:

    # mom "With this donut I declare myself your wife. *Laugh* I know I already am, but I wanted to say that line."
    mom "Avec ce donut, je me déclare ta femme. *Rires* Je sais que je le suis déjà, mais j'avais envie de dire cette phrase."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4718
translate french c30s006_mar_1923cf45:

    # mom "You gave me the best donut in the world, and I want to carry it with me always."
    mom "Tu m'as donné le meilleur donut du monde, et je veux le porter sur moi pour toujours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4719
translate french c30s006_mar_da4b9586:

    # mc "*Laugh* You got the donut tattooed!"
    mc "*Rires* Tu t'es fait tatouer le donut !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4722
translate french c30s006_mar_d2e6d6d2:

    # mom "I know they'll never allow a mother to marry her son."
    mom "Je sais qu'ils n'autoriseront jamais une mère à épouser son fils."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4724
translate french c30s006_mar_7a4150c1:

    # mom "Besides, I wouldn't want the rest of the harem to feel like you've chosen me over them."
    mom "En plus, je ne voudrais pas que le reste du harem ait l'impression que tu m'as choisie plutôt qu'elles."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4726
translate french c30s006_mar_8c2c4991:

    # mom "We'll never be able to get married because I don't want the rest of the harem to feel like you've chosen me over them."
    mom "On ne pourra jamais se marier parce que je ne veux pas que le reste du harem ait l'impression que tu m'as choisie plutôt qu'elles."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4728
translate french c30s006_mar_de2491b4:

    # mom "We won't be able to get married before you leave for Aruba, and I wanted my ring."
    mom "On ne pourra pas se marier avant que tu partes pour Aruba, et je voulais ma bague."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4730
translate french c30s006_mar_be4095d9:

    # mom "And, even if we could, we wouldn't be able to do it before you leave for Aruba."
    mom "Et, même si on le pouvait, on ne pourrait pas le faire avant que tu partes pour Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4732
translate french c30s006_mar_a3f44eb5:

    # mom "But like you said in the kitchen, we don't need anyone's permission or a wedding ring to feel like husband and wife."
    mom "Mais comme tu l'as dit dans la cuisine, on n'a besoin de la permission de personne ni d'une alliance pour se sentir comme mari et femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4733
translate french c30s006_mar_fc48d175:

    # mom "I think this is the sweetest ring I could have."
    mom "Je pense que c'est la bague la plus mignonne que je puisse avoir."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4735
translate french c30s006_mar_08c2a4be:

    # "If there's anything sweeter than the ring, it's your wife's lips."
    "S'il y a quelque chose de plus doux que l'anneau, ce sont les lèvres de ta femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4736
translate french c30s006_mar_026b074c:

    # "And her hugs, and her smile, and her gaze..."
    "Et ses étreintes, et son sourire, et son regard..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4737
translate french c30s006_mar_cc8ee238:

    # "You're certainly the luckiest guy in history."
    "Tu es certainement le mec le plus chanceux de l'histoire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4739
translate french c30s006_mar_f712afae:

    # mom "I love you."
    mom "Je t'aime."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4740
translate french c30s006_mar_6616e794:

    # mc "I love you too."
    mc "Je t'aime aussi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4742
translate french c30s006_mar_1eed4823:

    # "You don't need to say anything else, at least for a while."
    "Tu n'as besoin de rien dire d'autre, du moins pour un moment."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4743
translate french c30s006_mar_4bc295be:

    # "You know you've come a long way since that day she threw herself into your arms, the day you arrived, and you both ended up on the floor."
    "Tu sais que tu as fait du chemin depuis ce jour où elle s'est jetée dans tes bras, le jour de ton arrivée, et où vous avez tous les deux fini par terre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4744
translate french c30s006_mar_90e6912f:

    # "You still hold her in your arms, in a different way than you could have imagined back then, and you don't plan on ever letting her go. At least figuratively."
    "Tu la tiens toujours dans tes bras, d'une manière différente de ce que tu aurais pu imaginer à l'époque, et tu n'as pas l'intention de la laisser partir un jour. Du moins au sens figuré."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4757
translate french c30s006_mar_caede29e:

    # mom "You should go see [ama] now. She was really nervous about today."
    mom "Tu devrais aller voir [ama] maintenant. Elle était vraiment nerveuse pour aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4758
translate french c30s006_mar_0caaaba9:

    # mc "I'd like to stay a while longer with you, but I'm also looking forward to seeing her."
    mc "J'aimerais rester encore un peu avec toi, mais j'ai aussi hâte de la voir."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4759
translate french c30s006_mar_6c48c3f5:

    # mom "We had our moment when you gave me the donut. I don't need anything more."
    mom "On a eu notre moment quand tu m'as donné le donut. Je n'ai besoin de rien de plus."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4761
translate french c30s006_mar_dfd3b937:

    # mom "I know I don't need to tell you, but please take care of my little girl when you're in Aruba."
    mom "I know I don't need to tell you, but please take care of my little girl when you're in Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4762
translate french c30s006_mar_7d340a69:

    # mc "Don't worry. I think she'll be taking care of me more than I'll be taking care of her..."
    mc "Don't worry. I think she'll be taking care of me more than I'll be taking care of her..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4764
translate french c30s006_mar_3fcaa9a3:

    # mom "We should head to the welcome party or they'll get impatient."
    mom "We should head to the welcome party or they'll get impatient."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4765
translate french c30s006_mar_d4d2ed92:

    # mc "I'd like to stay a while longer with you, but I think we've delayed the party long enough."
    mc "I'd like to stay a while longer with you, but I think we've delayed the party long enough."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4766
translate french c30s006_mar_6c48c3f5_1:

    # mom "We had our moment when you gave me the donut. I don't need anything else."
    mom "We had our moment when you gave me the donut. I don't need anything else."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4767
translate french c30s006_mar_00314096:

    # mom "We'll have time to be together before you leave. But I have to go up to the kitchen to grab a few things before joining."
    mom "We'll have time to be together before you leave. But I have to go up to the kitchen to grab a few things before joining."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4768
translate french c30s006_mar_8cbe776b:

    # mc "I hope so..."
    mc "I hope so..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4770
translate french c30s006_mar_f4f0086b:

    # "You share a long kiss before pulling away."
    "You share a long kiss before pulling away."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4771
translate french c30s006_mar_e94c7e2e:

    # "It feels too short."
    "It feels too short."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4775
translate french c30s006_ama_0f54145e:

    # "Jamaal accompanies you to [nor]'s kitchen door. [ama] is waiting for you a little further away."
    "Jamaal accompanies you to [nor]'s kitchen door. [ama] is waiting for you a little further away."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4776
translate french c30s006_ama_9fb8fd91:

    # "She seems to consciously distance herself from the place where she burst into tears during her introduction to the family."
    "She seems to consciously distance herself from the place where she burst into tears during her introduction to the family."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4788
translate french c30s006_ama_4004e0ab:

    # mc "You look gorgeous, [ama]."
    mc "Tu es magnifique, [ama]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4789
translate french c30s006_ama_b14acb05:

    # ama "Thanks. Can we take a walk?"
    ama "Merci. On peut aller se promener ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4792
translate french c30s006_ama_28f45aed:

    # ama "Do you feel like going for a walk?"
    ama "Tu as envie d'aller te promener ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4793
translate french c30s006_ama_890c041b:

    # mc "Of course."
    mc "Bien sûr."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4795
translate french c30s006_ama_06e82d27:

    # "You start walking while [ama] seems thoughtful."
    "Tu commences à marcher tandis qu'[ama] semble pensive."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4797
translate french c30s006_ama_fef2b536:

    # "You take her hand gently, telling her that you're there for whatever she needs."
    "Tu lui prends doucement la main, en lui disant que tu es là pour tout ce dont elle a besoin."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4798
translate french c30s006_ama_321ec4e6:

    # ama "Thank you..."
    ama "Merci..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4799
translate french c30s006_ama_f46bfa3f:

    # mc "Is something wrong, [ama]?"
    mc "Quelque chose ne va pas, [ama] ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4801
translate french c30s006_ama_8e44990b:

    # ama "You're going to think I'm stupid."
    ama "Tu vas me trouver stupide."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4802
translate french c30s006_ama_d697263c:

    # mc "The day I think that, shoot me..."
    mc "Le jour où je penserai ça, tire-moi dessus..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4803
translate french c30s006_ama_36cb97d2:

    # mc "*Laugh* Don't listen to me. You could actually do it. It was sarcasm."
    mc "*Rires* Ne m'écoute pas. Tu serais bien capable de le faire. C'était du sarcasme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4804
translate french c30s006_ama_cecd1ab5:

    # mc "What I mean is, I don't think the day will ever come when I'd think you're stupid."
    mc "Ce que je veux dire, c'est que je ne pense pas que le jour viendra où je te trouverai stupide."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4807
translate french c30s006_ama_be136b0c:

    # ama "You know about the tattoos... The thing about declaring ourselves your wives and all that..."
    ama "Tu sais pour les tatouages... Le truc de se déclarer comme tes femmes et tout ça..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4809
translate french c30s006_ama_bd319e56:

    # ama "The girls convinced me to get a tattoo to tell you that I considered myself your wife."
    ama "Les filles m'ont convaincue de me faire tatouer pour te dire que je me considérais comme ta femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4810
translate french c30s006_ama_debba696:

    # mc "That's very original, but where's the problem?"
    mc "C'est très original, mais où est le problème ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4812
translate french c30s006_ama_c1d5c049:

    # ama "That I don't want to do it."
    ama "C'est que je n'ai pas envie de le faire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4813
translate french c30s006_ama_071a60c8:

    # mc "You don't have to do it. Saying that you feel like we're married at this point might sound a bit weird."
    mc "Tu n'es pas obligée de le faire. Dire que tu as l'impression qu'on est mariés à ce stade pourrait paraître un peu bizarre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4815
translate french c30s006_ama_1a542168:

    # ama "Because I haven't wanted to have sex with you?"
    ama "Parce que je n'ai pas voulu coucher avec toi ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4816
translate french c30s006_ama_4b1e5e9b:

    # mc "No, it has nothing to do with sex."
    mc "Non, ça n'a rien à voir avec le sexe."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4818
translate french c30s006_ama_2a94d0aa:

    # mc "I haven't had sex with [kat] either, and it didn't sound weird with her."
    mc "Je n'ai pas couché avec [kat] non plus, et ça ne paraissait pas bizarre avec elle."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4820
translate french c30s006_ama_f490ceb2:

    # ama "It's just that I don't mean I feel like we're married. I don't know what being married is like outside of movies."
    ama "C'est juste que je ne veux pas dire que j'ai l'impression qu'on est mariés. Je ne sais pas ce que c'est d'être mariée en dehors des films."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4821
translate french c30s006_ama_ee4cde3f:

    # ama "I didn't grow up in a... normal family."
    ama "Je n'ai pas grandi dans une famille... normale."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4822
translate french c30s006_ama_50d8828a:

    # mc "I know. Me neither"
    mc "Je sais. Moi non plus."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4824
translate french c30s006_ama_608c9c52:

    # ama "I know I want to spend every free moment with you. I know I wake up and go to sleep thinking about you."
    ama "Je sais que je veux passer chaque moment de libre avec toi. Je sais que je me réveille et que je m'endors en pensant à toi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4825
translate french c30s006_ama_4d1ce10e:

    # ama "Thinking about how we have a month ahead of us in Aruba all to ourselves, whenever work leaves us some free time."
    ama "En pensant au fait qu'on a un mois devant nous à Aruba rien que pour nous, chaque fois que le travail nous laisse du temps libre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4826
translate french c30s006_ama_1f9d4d3f:

    # mc "That sounds a lot like a marriage. At least like newlyweds. And the trip to Aruba feels like a honeymoon. While we work."
    mc "Ça ressemble beaucoup à un mariage. Du moins à des jeunes mariés. Et le voyage à Aruba ressemble à une lune de miel. Tout en travaillant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4828
translate french c30s006_ama_1cee7dec:

    # ama "But, as much as I've thought about it, I couldn't come up with a tattoo that represented what I feel."
    ama "Mais, même si j'y ai beaucoup réfléchi, je n'ai pas réussi à trouver un tatouage qui représente ce que je ressens."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4829
translate french c30s006_ama_ae91dc61:

    # ama "I could only think of a ring... But it seemed... I don't know... It didn't seem right."
    ama "Je ne pouvais penser qu'à une bague... Mais ça semblait... Je ne sais pas... Ça ne semblait pas juste."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4831
translate french c30s006_ama_ec12d9e1:

    # ama "And I don't mean it wasn't right if any of the girls got a ring tattooed. But it wasn't for me."
    ama "Et je ne dis pas que ce n'était pas bien si l'une des filles se faisait tatouer une bague. Mais ce n'était pas pour moi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4832
translate french c30s006_ama_724b12c1:

    # ama "I didn't want anyone to show me their tattoos, so they wouldn't ask to see mine."
    ama "Je ne voulais pas que quelqu'un me montre ses tatouages, pour qu'on ne me demande pas de voir le mien."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4833
translate french c30s006_ama_5b3b74c7:

    # mc "I understand. A ring has to mean something. If it means nothing, it's just a piece of metal. Or a tattooed circle."
    mc "Je comprends. Une bague doit signifier quelque chose. Si ça ne signifie rien, c'est juste un bout de métal. Ou un cercle tatoué."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4835
translate french c30s006_ama_6270bd2b:

    # ama "That's what I mean. A ring wouldn't mean anything between us. We have to create memories to find something meaningful."
    ama "C'est ce que je veux dire. Une bague ne signifierait rien entre nous. Nous devons créer des souvenirs pour trouver quelque chose de significatif."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4836
translate french c30s006_ama_7cf98f04:

    # mc "I have many memories with you, [ama]."
    mc "J'ai beaucoup de souvenirs avec toi, [ama]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4838
translate french c30s006_ama_1eb74335:

    # ama "I know. I could list a hundred, but none would be 100%% ours."
    ama "Je sais. Je pourrais en lister une centaine, mais aucune ne serait 100%% à nous."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4839
translate french c30s006_ama_3cdca8b9:

    # ama "Back there, when I started crying like an idiot, overwhelmed by emotions, you came to save me. But I cried for them, for all of you."
    ama "Là-bas, quand j'ai commencé à pleurer comme une idiote, submergée par les émotions, tu es venu me sauver. Mais j'ai pleuré pour elles, pour vous tous."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4840
translate french c30s006_ama_e8deb19b:

    # ama "At the garage door, when you gave me the first hug on the day we came with Aaron."
    ama "À la porte du garage, quand tu m'as fait ce premier câlin le jour où on est venus avec Aaron."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4841
translate french c30s006_ama_810ed92d:

    # ama "At the cafe, when you kissed me for the first time while we were talking about the company, while we were looking at data on the laptop."
    ama "Au café, quand tu m'as embrassée pour la première fois pendant qu'on parlait de l'entreprise, alors qu'on regardait des données sur l'ordinateur portable."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4842
translate french c30s006_ama_57a2eb6e:

    # ama "In your bed, the day it broke..."
    ama "Dans ton lit, le jour où il s'est cassé..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4843
translate french c30s006_ama_6e89f1f3:

    # mc "The day Zeus broke it."
    mc "Le jour où Zeus l'a cassé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4845
translate french c30s006_ama_8402cfb3:

    # ama "*Laugh* The day seven women in your bed broke it."
    ama "*Rires* Le jour où sept femmes dans ton lit l'ont cassé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4846
translate french c30s006_ama_51edc81a:

    # "The first time [ama] laughs since you saw each other sounds better than any symphony in history. Take that, Beethoven!"
    "La première fois qu'[ama] rit depuis que vous vous êtes revus sonne mieux que n'importe quelle symphonie de l'histoire. Prends ça, Beethoven !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4847
translate french c30s006_ama_f2c1b74b:

    # mc "*Laugh* Seven women and a cat."
    mc "*Rires* Sept femmes et un chat."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4848
translate french c30s006_ama_b13bd0d5:

    # ama "*Laugh* OK. The day seven women and a cat broke your bed."
    ama "*Rires* OK. Le jour où sept femmes et un chat ont cassé ton lit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4849
translate french c30s006_ama_6bc466c0:

    # mc "*Laugh* That sounds better."
    mc "*Rires* Ça sonne mieux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4850
translate french c30s006_ama_3eea9abd:

    # mc "I see what you mean. Family is always in our memories."
    mc "Je vois ce que tu veux dire. La famille est toujours dans nos souvenirs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4852
translate french c30s006_ama_fb11be84:

    # ama "And that's why I haven't tattooed anything. I'm not going to tattoo Zeus or Aaron. I'm not going to tattoo the other six women who broke your bed or a laptop."
    ama "Et c'est pour ça que je ne me suis rien fait tatouer. Je ne vais pas me tatouer Zeus ou Aaron. Je ne vais pas me tatouer les six autres femmes qui ont pété ton lit ou un ordinateur portable."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4853
translate french c30s006_ama_020a162f:

    # ama "Maybe I can do it the day we have a memory that's just ours. But not today."
    ama "Peut-être que je le ferai le jour où on aura un souvenir qui n'appartient qu'à nous. Mais pas aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4854
translate french c30s006_ama_432f6659:

    # mc "I get it. And you don't have to say that you feel..."
    mc "Je comprends. Et tu n'as pas besoin de dire que tu te sens..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4856
translate french c30s006_ama_78978161:

    # "Without letting you finish your sentence, the gorgeous mercenary gives you a tender kiss."
    "Sans te laisser finir ta phrase, la magnifique mercenaire te donne un tendre baiser."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4857
translate french c30s006_ama_4a9df10a:

    # "It's just the brush of her lips against yours, but it communicates more than any tattoo could in her case."
    "C'est juste l'effleurement de ses lèvres contre les tiennes, mais ça communique bien plus que n'importe quel tatouage ne le pourrait dans son cas."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4858
translate french c30s006_ama_be61e307:

    # "The kiss lasts for a few brief seconds. It feels short. But neither of you needs more, for now."
    "Le baiser dure quelques brèves secondes. Ça paraît court. Mais aucun de vous n'a besoin de plus, pour l'instant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4860
translate french c30s006_ama_24f2e98c:

    # ama "With this kiss, I declare myself your wife, [mc]."
    ama "Par ce baiser, je me déclare ta femme, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4861
translate french c30s006_ama_f49265ad:

    # ama "Someday I'll get a tattoo so I can show it off."
    ama "Un jour, je me ferai tatouer pour pouvoir l'exhiber."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4862
translate french c30s006_ama_1e32ad05:

    # mc "Don't you think that kiss is enough of a way to show it?"
    mc "Tu ne trouves pas que ce baiser suffit à le prouver ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4863
translate french c30s006_ama_7e326d95:

    # mc "You can show love in many different ways. You don't need a tattoo, a ring, or to sign a piece of paper."
    mc "On peut montrer son amour de plein de façons différentes. Tu n'as pas besoin d'un tatouage, d'une bague, ou de signer un bout de papier."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4864
translate french c30s006_ama_605b9ddd:

    # mc "From this moment on, I consider myself your husband, [ama]."
    mc "À partir de ce moment, je me considère comme ton mari, [ama]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4866
translate french c30s006_ama_35796efc:

    # "You kiss each other again. As husband and wife this time. The first of many times. And every time you kiss, it will be as if it were your last."
    "Vous vous embrassez à nouveau. En tant que mari et femme cette fois. La première de nombreuses fois. Et à chaque fois que vous vous embrasserez, ce sera comme si c'était la dernière."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4867
translate french c30s006_ama_7f2decbe:

    # "And a minute, an hour, or a day later, you'll be glad that wasn't the last time, when you kiss each other again."
    "Et une minute, une heure, ou un jour plus tard, vous serez heureux que ce n'était pas la dernière fois, quand vous vous embrasserez à nouveau."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4868
translate french c30s006_ama_a5852d0d:

    # "Many kisses await you in Aruba. Many kisses await you for the rest of your lives."
    "De nombreux baisers vous attendent à Aruba. De nombreux baisers vous attendent pour le reste de vos vies."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4870
translate french c30s006_ama_b8b77b34:

    # ama "*Giggles* Sometimes I hate this family."
    ama "*Glousse* Parfois, je déteste cette famille."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4871
translate french c30s006_ama_d15d8518:

    # mc "*Laugh* What happened?"
    mc "*Rit* Qu'est-ce qui s'est passé ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4873
translate french c30s006_ama_8bdb24a3:

    # ama "One of us comes up with an idea and it seems like we're all forced to follow it..."
    ama "L'une de nous a une idée et on dirait qu'on est toutes obligées de la suivre..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4874
translate french c30s006_ama_eb0c5a0a:

    # mc "You just proved with your lack of a tattoo that it's not necessary to follow an idea you don't like or one you don't agree with."
    mc "Tu viens de prouver avec ton absence de tatouage qu'il n'est pas nécessaire de suivre une idée que tu n'aimes pas ou avec laquelle tu n'es pas d'accord."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4876
translate french c30s006_ama_b51dec54:

    # ama "Sometimes it's hard not to follow the group..."
    ama "Parfois, c'est dur de ne pas suivre le groupe..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4877
translate french c30s006_ama_be6646a3:

    # mc "Do you remember when [eva] dressed up as [dap] to try to trick me?"
    mc "Tu te souviens quand [eva] s'est déguisée en [dap] pour essayer de me piéger ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4879
translate french c30s006_ama_f181a472:

    # ama "Yeah..."
    ama "Ouais..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4880
translate french c30s006_ama_0edb3509:

    # mc "Why did she do it?"
    mc "Pourquoi l'a-t-elle fait ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4881
translate french c30s006_ama_d0acb51d:

    # ama "To reaffirm her individuality."
    ama "Pour réaffirmer son individualité."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4882
translate french c30s006_ama_e9ab1f36:

    # mc "You can also assert your individuality by refusing to follow the pack, [ama]."
    mc "Tu peux aussi affirmer ton individualité en refusant de suivre la meute, [ama]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4883
translate french c30s006_ama_3bb9938b:

    # mc "Every woman in this family is an individual, and you must make your own decisions."
    mc "Chaque femme de cette famille est un individu à part entière, et tu dois prendre tes propres décisions."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4884
translate french c30s006_ama_25736490:

    # mc "Sometimes, one of those decisions might be going in a different direction than the pack."
    mc "Parfois, l'une de ces décisions peut consister à aller dans une direction différente de celle de la meute."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4886
translate french c30s006_ama_46556671:

    # ama "*Laugh* You say 'pack' like we're wolves. Most people would say 'herd' in that context."
    ama "*Rires* Tu dis 'meute' comme si on était des loups. La plupart des gens diraient 'troupeau' dans ce contexte."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4887
translate french c30s006_ama_b6a112d2:

    # mc "*Laugh* You're my wolves, [ama]. I'm still surprised there hasn't been a fight to figure out who the alpha is."
    mc "*Rires* Vous êtes mes louves, [ama]. Je suis d'ailleurs surpris qu'il n'y ait pas eu de bagarre pour savoir qui est l'alpha."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4888
translate french c30s006_ama_8ab3a581:

    # ama "*Laugh* There's no need for fights. The alphas are [mar] and [nor]. We all know that."
    ama "*Rires* Pas besoin de se battre. Les alphas sont [mar] et [nor]. On le sait toutes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4892
translate french c30s006_ama_1222f796:

    # mc "By the way, I wouldn't have complained if you had gotten the tattoo, but... what would have happened if I didn't like the idea?"
    mc "Au fait, je ne me serais pas plaint si tu avais fait ce tatouage, mais... que se serait-il passé si je n'aimais pas l'idée ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4893
translate french c30s006_ama_d72cd586:

    # ama "Like you've said several times, we have to accept everyone as they are."
    ama "Comme tu l'as dit plusieurs fois, on doit accepter tout le monde tel qu'il est."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4894
translate french c30s006_ama_0940079b:

    # ama "If I had found something that represented us, you would've had to accept me with a tattoo."
    ama "Si j'avais trouvé quelque chose qui nous représentait, tu aurais dû m'accepter avec un tatouage."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4895
translate french c30s006_ama_133c7a17:

    # mc "*Laugh* Fair enough."
    mc "*Rire* Pas faux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4901
translate french c30s006_ama_852d27ae:

    # mc "But I still don't quite understand why a tattoo."
    mc "Mais je ne comprends toujours pas vraiment pourquoi un tatouage."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4902
translate french c30s006_ama_3393e29f:

    # ama "The girls said we couldn't lose it and that it would be forever."
    ama "Les filles ont dit qu'on ne pourrait pas le perdre et que ce serait pour toujours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4904
translate french c30s006_ama_ef0134df:

    # ama "Besides, we could never agree on what kind of ring we want. Which means you'd have to wear a different ring for each girl."
    ama "En plus, on n'arriverait jamais à se mettre d'accord sur le type de bague qu'on veut. Ce qui veut dire que tu devrais porter une bague différente pour chaque fille."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4905
translate french c30s006_ama_7081a0bc:

    # ama "If you keep adding girls to the harem, you'd end up dragging your arms like an orangutan due to the weight of the rings."
    ama "Si tu continues d'ajouter des filles au harem, tu finirais par traîner les bras comme un orang-outan à cause du poids des bagues."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4906
translate french c30s006_ama_556075c6:

    # ama "And, besides, each of us could personalize it so it meant something unique."
    ama "Et puis, chacune de nous pourrait le personnaliser pour qu'il signifie quelque chose d'unique."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4908
translate french c30s006_ama_f4f76642:

    # ama "A ring could work for an... official wedding. A tattoo makes us unique to a certain degree."
    ama "Une bague pourrait marcher pour un... mariage officiel. Un tatouage nous rend uniques dans une certaine mesure."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4909
translate french c30s006_ama_d96ad109:

    # ama "That's why I couldn't do it."
    ama "C'est pour ça que je n'ai pas pu le faire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4911
translate french c30s006_ama_30739816:

    # ama "We should go to the party now. They must be waiting for us."
    ama "On devrait aller à la fête maintenant. Elles doivent nous attendre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4912
translate french c30s006_ama_d36b91bf:

    # mc "And they'll all want to know what you got tattooed."
    mc "Et elles voudront toutes savoir ce que tu t'es fait tatouer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4913
translate french c30s006_ama_25d430bc:

    # ama "And, thanks to this conversation, I won't feel like a fool telling them I didn't get anything tattooed."
    ama "Et, grâce à cette conversation, je n'aurai pas l'air d'une idiote en leur disant que je ne me suis rien fait tatouer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4914
translate french c30s006_ama_89305487:

    # mc "That's the spirit, babe."
    mc "C'est ça l'esprit, bébé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4916
translate french c30s006_ama_dac4457c:

    # "You kiss again before heading to the party. It's been over a minute since your last kiss."
    "Vous vous embrassez à nouveau avant de vous diriger vers la fête. Ça fait plus d'une minute depuis votre dernier baiser."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4917
translate french c30s006_ama_95deaf2c:

    # "Have you ever tried holding your breath for more than a minute? Every kid has done it at some point. The pressure in your lungs becomes painful."
    "As-tu déjà essayé de retenir ta respiration pendant plus d'une minute ? Tous les gosses l'ont fait à un moment donné. La pression dans tes poumons devient douloureuse."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4918
translate french c30s006_ama_b7db1ced:

    # "The lack of contact with [ama]'s lips feels more painful than the lack of oxygen."
    "Le manque de contact avec les lèvres de [ama] est plus douloureux que le manque d'oxygène."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4920
translate french c30s006_ama_ea7ae198:

    # "Since she kissed you for the first time, she hasn't let go of your hands, as if they were an anchor to a dream she doesn't want to wake up from."
    "Depuis qu'elle t'a embrassé pour la première fois, elle n'a pas lâché tes mains, comme si elles étaient une ancre vers un rêve dont elle ne veut pas se réveiller."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4922
translate french c30s006_ama_54846200:

    # "When your lips are satiated with each other's, you head to the party."
    "Quand vos lèvres sont rassasiées l'une de l'autre, vous vous dirigez vers la fête."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4923
translate french c30s006_ama_83ff60e8:

    # "The satiety will last a minute. Luckily, her hand is still in yours."
    "La satiété durera une minute. Heureusement, sa main est toujours dans la tienne."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4924
translate french c30s006_ama_d1063a9c:

    # "You're still her anchor. She will be yours forever."
    "Tu es toujours son ancre. Elle sera la tienne pour toujours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4927
translate french c30s007_convJamaal1_5457a963:

    # jam "She's too tired after today. She told me she'd love to, but the wedding was already too fast."
    jam "Elle est trop fatiguée après la journée d'aujourd'hui. Elle m'a dit qu'elle en aurait très envie, mais le mariage est déjà allé trop vite."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4928
translate french c30s007_convJamaal1_525f528c:

    # jam "Having newlywed sex while tired isn't a good idea, and I agree."
    jam "Faire l'amour en tant que jeunes mariés en étant fatigués n'est pas une bonne idée, et je suis d'accord."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4931
translate french c30s007_convJamaal2_6e11341f:

    # jam "Who are you going to choose to spend the night with, and who are you going to offend by not choosing her?"
    jam "Avec qui vas-tu choisir de passer la nuit, et qui vas-tu vexer en ne la choisissant pas ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4932
translate french c30s007_convJamaal2_095ff3a6:

    # jam "I don't think that's a good way to start your marriages."
    jam "Je ne pense pas que ce soit une bonne façon de commencer tes mariages."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4960
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e277251f:

    # "Arriving at [nor]'s kitchen, you head over to officially welcome [mee] and [bet]."
    "En arrivant dans la cuisine de [nor], tu t'approches pour accueillir officiellement [mee] et [bet]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5068
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_6aed1108:

    # "You've already greeted them individually during your weddings, but you haven't talked about their trip."
    "Tu les as déjà saluées individuellement pendant tes mariages, mais vous n'avez pas parlé de leur voyage."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5070
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d6a7ea64:

    # "You've already greeted [mee] during your wedding, but you haven't talked about their trip, and it's time to greet [bet] too."
    "Tu as déjà salué [mee] pendant ton mariage, mais vous n'avez pas parlé de leur voyage, et il est temps de saluer [bet] aussi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5071
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_401be1cc:

    # mc "Welcome back home, Aunt [bet]."
    mc "Bon retour à la maison, Tante [bet]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5073
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_65c7f9a4:

    # "You've already greeted [bet] during your wedding, but you haven't talked about their trip, and it's time to greet [mee] too."
    "Tu as déjà salué [bet] pendant ton mariage, mais vous n'avez pas parlé de leur voyage, et il est temps de saluer [mee] aussi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5074
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_4450e1da:

    # mc "Welcome back home, Meemaw."
    mc "Bon retour à la maison, Mamie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5076
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_c7d2f9ac:

    # "You haven't seen them yet since you and Jamaal got home."
    "Tu ne les as pas encore vues depuis que Jamaal et toi êtes rentrés."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5078
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_4b3be834:

    # "The scavenging vulture has kept you busy."
    "Ce vautour charognard t'a bien occupé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5079
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a668da4c:

    # mc "Welcome back home."
    mc "Bon retour à la maison."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5080
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_954ec7ad:

    # mc "You have to tell me how the trip went."
    mc "Il faut que vous me racontiez comment s'est passé le voyage."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5081
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d1cdf97a:

    # bet "Everything went well, but I missed you guys and Gino's pizza. The pizza we ordered in Florida wasn't as good."
    bet "Tout s'est bien passé, mais vous m'avez manqué, ainsi que la pizza de Gino. Celle qu'on a commandée en Floride n'était pas aussi bonne."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5082
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_c08b7ba5:

    # mee "Aside from [bet] wiping out the state's pizza supply, everything went well."
    mee "À part [bet] qui a épuisé les réserves de pizza de l'État, tout s'est bien passé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5083
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_0d4d2923:

    # mee "The house is already for sale, and our things will arrive on Friday."
    mee "La maison est déjà en vente, et nos affaires arriveront vendredi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5084
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_39fd1fac:

    # mc "But [bet] won't be here..."
    mc "Mais [bet] ne sera pas là..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5086
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_926e5bd1:

    # bet "Don't worry, I didn't have much there. Some habits and some clothes that... aren't my style anymore."
    bet "Ne t'inquiète pas, je n'avais pas grand-chose là-bas. Quelques habitudes et des vêtements qui... ne sont plus mon style."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5087
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_b39f23aa:

    # mee "I think [bet] has discovered a taste for dresses... too short for her age."
    mee "Je crois que [bet] s'est découvert un goût pour les robes... trop courtes pour son âge."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5088
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d1daacfd:

    # mc "I don't think dress length has anything to do with age, Meemaw."
    mc "Je ne pense pas que la longueur d'une robe ait quoi que ce soit à voir avec l'âge, Meemaw."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5090
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e8a78308:

    # mc "And, even though she can defend herself if she thinks you're attacking her, I don't think I should let you criticize my wife for how she dresses."
    mc "Et, même si elle peut se défendre si elle pense que tu l'attaques, je ne crois pas que je devrais te laisser critiquer ma femme sur sa façon de s'habiller."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5092
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_33b8c81d:

    # mc "Just like I wouldn't let anyone criticize you for how you dress."
    mc "Tout comme je ne laisserais personne te critiquer sur ta façon de t'habiller."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5093
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_30fd24f8:

    # mc "In both cases, I love how my wives dress. Each of you looks great in your own style."
    mc "Dans les deux cas, j'adore comment mes femmes s'habillent. Chacune de vous est magnifique dans son propre style."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5095
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_5703b20e:

    # mc "Besides, I love the wardrobe change Aunt [bet] has made."
    mc "D'ailleurs, j'adore le changement de garde-robe qu'a fait Tante [bet]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5097
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_28e6b835:

    # bet "Don't listen to her. She's spent a few days away from the family and already thinks she can boss us all around again."
    bet "Ne l'écoute pas. Elle a passé quelques jours loin de la famille et elle pense déjà pouvoir nous donner des ordres à tous à nouveau."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5098
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_cce1cf35:

    # mee "That's not true!"
    mee "C'est pas vrai !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5099
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a9658ebb:

    # mc "*Laugh* It seems like it is. That you don't like how your little sister dresses was almost the first thing you told me."
    mc "*Rires* On dirait bien que si. Le fait que tu n'aimes pas comment s'habille ta petite sœur est presque la première chose que tu m'as dite."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5100
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_5d0e14d3:

    # mc "*Laugh* As long as you don't start picking on [nor]'s weight or how she has the house organized..."
    mc "*Rires* Tant que tu ne commences pas à faire des remarques sur le poids de [nor] ou sur la façon dont elle organise la maison..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5102
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_b162dc73:

    # mee "Am I turning back into that [mee] again?"
    mee "Est-ce que je suis en train de redevenir cette [mee]-là ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5103
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_7db1f93c:

    # mc "I don't think so, besides, they won't let you go back to being that version of yourself."
    mc "Je ne pense pas, et puis, elles ne te laisseront pas redevenir cette version de toi-même."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5104
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_63d71513:

    # mc "And if you try, there will be 19 women and a black vulture to put you in your place when I'm not around."
    mc "Et si tu essaies, il y aura 19 femmes et un vautour noir pour te remettre à ta place quand je ne serai pas là."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5106
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_86e2998e:

    # bet "Don't criticize the black vulture... Shit! *Laugh* Jamaal. You're going to end up making us all call him a vulture."
    bet "Ne critique pas le vautour noir... Merde ! *Rires* Jamaal. Tu vas finir par tous nous faire l'appeler le vautour."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5108
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_b5574014:

    # bet "He's done a good job as master of ceremonies."
    bet "Il a fait du bon boulot en tant que maître de cérémonie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5110
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_1e925ecd:

    # bet "The idea for this party was partially his, from what I've been told."
    bet "L'idée de cette fête venait en partie de lui, d'après ce qu'on m'a dit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5111
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_13c59e3e:

    # mc "*Laugh* When he starts stealing food, you'll understand why I call him a vulture."
    mc "*Rires* Quand il commencera à voler de la bouffe, tu comprendras pourquoi je l'appelle un vautour."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5113
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_99836b3f:

    # eri "I'm going to steal [mc] from you."
    eri "Je vais vous voler [mc]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5115
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_ba5d4e58:

    # mee "He just got here, young lady!"
    mee "Il vient juste d'arriver, jeune fille !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5116
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_433931a9:

    # bet "I think I know why she's taking him away."
    bet "Je crois savoir pourquoi elle l'emmène."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5118
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_b7325a3c:

    # eri "[meg] and [sam.nick] are going to have to leave shortly and won't be staying for dinner. They both work tonight."
    eri "[meg] et [sam.nick] vont devoir partir bientôt et ne resteront pas pour le dîner. Elles travaillent toutes les deux ce soir."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5119
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d133b005:

    # eri "Neither of them wants to leave without saying goodbye to [mc], in case they don't see him before he flies to Aruba."
    eri "Aucune d'elles ne veut partir sans dire au revoir à [mc], au cas où elles ne le verraient pas avant qu'il ne s'envole pour Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5120
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_39e0c13a:

    # mc "And they sent you to look for me?"
    mc "Et elles t'ont envoyée me chercher ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5122
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a8385687:

    # eri "*Laugh* No, I volunteered. [sam.nick] is scared of grandma and didn't dare. And [meg] is too busy messing with Jamaal."
    eri "*Rires* Non, je me suis portée volontaire. [sam.nick] a peur de grand-mère et n'a pas osé. Et [meg] est trop occupée à embêter Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5124
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_bfdc3034:

    # mee "*Laugh* [sam.nick] is scared of me? I'll have to spend more time with her, so she changes her mind!"
    mee "*Rires* [sam.nick] a peur de moi ? Il va falloir que je passe plus de temps avec elle pour qu'elle change d'avis !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5125
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_5c5029b5:

    # bet "*Laugh* That sounded like a threat."
    bet "*Rires* Ça ressemblait à une menace."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5126
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_4134130e:

    # mc "*Laugh* I think I just heard [sam.nick]'s car tires screeching as she speeds away."
    mc "*Rires* Je crois que je viens d'entendre les pneus de la voiture de [sam.nick] crisser alors qu'elle s'enfuit à toute vitesse."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5127
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d375b217:

    # mc "Well, ladies, I'll see you later."
    mc "Bon, mesdames, à plus tard."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5129
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_cd7dc533:

    # mee "See you later, [mc]."
    mee "À plus tard, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5130
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_974b1516:

    # bet "Have fun, [mc]."
    bet "Amuse-toi bien, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5133
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_c86b66eb:

    # mc "Is [sam.nick] really afraid of Meemaw?"
    mc "Est-ce que [sam.nick] a vraiment peur de Meemaw ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5134
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a80c5c95:

    # eri "More than fear, she fills her with a tremendous sense of unease. Think about it, they haven't crossed paths much since that day at the beach. Two or three times."
    eri "Plus que de la peur, elle lui inspire un énorme sentiment de malaise. Penses-y, elles ne se sont pas beaucoup croisées depuis ce jour à la plage. Deux ou trois fois."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5135
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d18048c1:

    # eri "[sam.nick] hasn't experienced firsthand how much grandma has changed."
    eri "[sam.nick] n'a pas pu voir de ses propres yeux à quel point grand-mère a changé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5136
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_354ce315:

    # mc "You're right. I guess, from now on, it'll be different, with everyone permanently in Newport."
    mc "Tu as raison. J'imagine qu'à partir de maintenant, ce sera différent, avec tout le monde installé définitivement à Newport."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5138
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a2e720a1:

    # eri "Well... Not everyone..."
    eri "Eh bien... Pas tout le monde..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5139
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_bcd43393:

    # mc "Okay, yeah. [ama], Aunt [bet] and I are leaving for a while... and then [eva], but Aunt [bet] will probably be back by then..."
    mc "Ok, ouais. [ama], Tante [bet] et moi partons pour un moment... et ensuite [eva], mais Tante [bet] sera probablement de retour d'ici là..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5140
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_64f74732:

    # mc "What I mean is that almost all of you are going to be here and you'll have more time to get to know each other."
    mc "Ce que je veux dire, c'est que vous serez presque toutes ici et que vous aurez plus de temps pour apprendre à vous connaître."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5141
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_61be76ff:

    # mc "Besides, you're going to have to help each other out when I'm not around."
    mc "En plus, vous allez devoir vous entraider quand je ne serai pas là."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5143
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_136b39dc:

    # eri "I know. But it's going to be hard not having you here. Or [ama], [eva], or Aunt [bet]."
    eri "Je sais. Mais ça va être dur de ne pas t'avoir ici. Ou [ama], [eva], ou Tante [bet]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5144
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_691d4aba:

    # mc "It's going to be hard for us too. But I'm leaving with peace of mind. I know you're going to help keep the peace at home and make sure everyone behaves."
    mc "Ça va être dur pour nous aussi. Mais je pars l'esprit tranquille. Je sais que tu vas aider à maintenir la paix à la maison et t'assurer que tout le monde se tient à carreau."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5146
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_f9e76efa:

    # eri "You're putting a lot of responsibility on my shoulders!"
    eri "Tu me mets beaucoup de responsabilités sur les épaules !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5147
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_6c0b15be:

    # mc "*Laugh* And I haven't even told you yet that you're going to be one of the main people in charge of making sure the new girls fit in good."
    mc "*Rire* Et je ne t'ai même pas encore dit que tu vas être l'une des principales responsables pour t'assurer que les nouvelles filles s'intègrent bien."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5149
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_4dcb331e:

    # eri "*Laugh* I don't think there will be too many problems. They're talking a lot in the WhatsUp group you suggested making with them."
    eri "*Rire* Je ne pense pas qu'il y aura trop de problèmes. Elles parlent beaucoup dans le groupe WhatsUp que tu as suggéré de créer avec elles."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5150
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_6e25c3d3:

    # mc "How do you know?"
    mc "Comment tu le sais ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5152
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_8241e206:

    # eri "Remember what I said about texting [zoe] about her makeup? We've talked a lot, and she added me to the new girls' group."
    eri "Tu te souviens de ce que j'ai dit sur le fait d'envoyer un message à [zoe] à propos de son maquillage ? On a beaucoup parlé, et elle m'a ajoutée au groupe des nouvelles."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5153
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a8923324:

    # eri "Now I talk to all of them. They're good girls and, like I told you, I don't think there will be many problems."
    eri "Maintenant je parle avec toutes. Ce sont des filles bien et, comme je te l'ai dit, je ne pense pas qu'il y aura beaucoup de problèmes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5154
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_c49a1173:

    # mc "Now you understand why I'm giving you the responsibility of keeping everything in line, right?"
    mc "Maintenant tu comprends pourquoi je te donne la responsabilité de garder tout le monde dans le droit chemin, pas vrai ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5156
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a67ca71f:

    # eri "I get it. I'll try to do a good job."
    eri "J'ai compris. Je vais essayer de faire du bon boulot."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5157
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_90d6dd84:

    # eri "And my job starts by sending you over to [sam.nick]. There she is."
    eri "Et mon boulot commence par t'envoyer vers [sam.nick]. La voilà."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5158
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_6e7876ba:

    # mc "See you later, [eri]."
    mc "À plus tard, [eri]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5159
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_cd8a47d8:

    # eri "Save me a dance."
    eri "Garde-moi une danse."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5162
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_5fcba458:

    # mc "[eri] told me you're leaving. So soon?"
    mc "[eri] m'a dit que tu partais. Si tôt ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5163
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_dd05c28a:

    # sam "I have to go to the hospital. My shift starts in a little over an hour."
    sam "Je dois aller à l'hôpital. Mon service commence dans un peu plus d'une heure."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5164
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_8ee6a62f:

    # sam "But I didn't want to leave without having a dance with you."
    sam "Mais je ne voulais pas partir sans avoir une danse avec toi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5165
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e2096b7f:

    # sam "I think this party is as much a welcome for [mee] and [bet] as it is a farewell for [ama], [bet], and you."
    sam "Je pense que cette fête est autant pour souhaiter la bienvenue à [mee] et [bet] que pour faire nos adieux à [ama], [bet] et toi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5168
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_749258cf:

    # mc "And a celebration of our wedding..."
    mc "Et une célébration de notre mariage..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5170
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_3c4bad71:

    # mc "And a celebration of my wedding..."
    mc "Et une célébration de mon mariage..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5172
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_85e4e7b2:

    # mc "And a celebration of my weddings..."
    mc "Et une célébration de mes mariages..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5174
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_47e5486a:

    # mc "It seems so, although we still have a couple of days before we leave."
    mc "Il semblerait, même s'il nous reste encore quelques jours avant de partir."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5176
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d2dd59f7:

    # mc "Although we still have a couple of days before we leave."
    mc "Même s'il nous reste encore quelques jours avant de partir."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5178
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_3db90a22:

    # sam "A couple of days go by too fast. I don't know if we'll all be able to see you before you leave."
    sam "Quelques jours, ça passe trop vite. Je ne sais pas si on pourra tous te voir avant que tu partes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5180
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a2a9304e:

    # mc "Does that mean we're not going to have a wedding night?"
    mc "Ça veut dire qu'on n'aura pas de nuit de noces ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5182
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_58cabbd8:

    # sam "*Laugh* I have to check my schedule. Just kidding. Don't worry, I'm sure we'll find some time before you leave."
    sam "*Rires* Il faut que je vérifie mon emploi du temps. Je plaisante. T'inquiète pas, je suis sûre qu'on trouvera un moment avant ton départ."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5183
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_904096b3:

    # mc "*Laugh* I hope so. I'm really looking forward to spending some time alone with my wife."
    mc "*Rires* Je l'espère. J'ai vraiment hâte de passer un peu de temps seul avec ma femme."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5184
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_067fb2e9:

    # mc "*Laugh* Even if I have to break an arm and go to the hospital to get some special treatment."
    mc "*Rires* Même si je dois me casser un bras et aller à l'hôpital pour avoir droit à un traitement de faveur."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5186
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_bfe6fdb0:

    # mc "I'm sure we'll see each other again before we leave. Even if I have to break an arm to go to the hospital."
    mc "Je suis sûr qu'on se reverra avant notre départ. Même si je dois me casser un bras pour aller à l'hôpital."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5188
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d142840e:

    # sam "*Laugh* You better not break any arms. And now, let's dance. I love this song."
    sam "*Rires* T'as pas intérêt à te casser un bras. Et maintenant, dansons. J'adore cette chanson."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5190
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_11037303:

    # "You dance with [sam] and [meg] before they leave."
    "Tu danses avec [sam] et [meg] avant qu'elles ne partent."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5191
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a9f563c9:

    # "Afterwards, you go from one girl to another without a moment's pause."
    "Ensuite, tu passes d'une fille à l'autre sans un instant de répit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5192
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d01aed74:

    # "They all want to have one last dance with you and won't let you dance more than one song in a row with another girl."
    "Elles veulent toutes une dernière danse avec toi et ne te laissent pas danser plus d'une chanson d'affilée avec une autre fille."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5194
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_67c6fff0:

    # "The conversations while you dance are about the weddings and how much you're going to miss each other."
    "Les conversations pendant que tu danses tournent autour des mariages et à quel point vous allez vous manquer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5196
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_2a84d81d:

    # "The conversations while you dance are about the wedding and how much you're going to miss each other."
    "Les conversations pendant que tu danses tournent autour du mariage et à quel point vous allez vous manquer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5198
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_c16a5227:

    # "The conversations while you dance are about how much you're going to miss each other."
    "Les conversations pendant que vous dansez tournent autour d'à quel point vous allez vous manquer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5199
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_1bc30544:

    # "It's a mixed contrast of happiness and sadness."
    "C'est un mélange contrasté de bonheur et de tristesse."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5200
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_0d4ad389:

    # "It's a welcome and farewell party."
    "C'est une fête de bienvenue et d'adieu."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5206
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_46c763de:

    # "By the time they let you rest, you're starving. You head over to where Jamaal is. There's bound to be food nearby. If he hasn't gobbled it all..."
    "Au moment où elles vous laissent vous reposer, vous mourez de faim. Vous vous dirigez vers Jamaal. Il y a forcément de la nourriture à proximité. S'il n'a pas tout englouti..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5207
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e4fc14c4:

    # mc "Is there anything left to eat? Or did you eat it all?"
    mc "Il reste quelque chose à manger ? Ou tu as tout bouffé ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5208
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_c829c01a:

    # jam "I don't think I'm going to answer that baseless accusation."
    jam "Je ne pense pas que je vais répondre à cette accusation infondée."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5209
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_228cf3de:

    # jam "But there's nothing left, unless you want to eat some of the ice cream [mee] made, or something from the fridge. The ice cream is surprisingly good."
    jam "Mais il ne reste rien, à moins que tu ne veuilles manger de la glace que [mee] a faite, ou un truc du frigo. La glace est étonnamment bonne."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5210
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_ac0967f6:

    # mc "*Laugh* Don't worry, eat that ice cream. Don't leave anything for the rest of us."
    mc "*Rires* T'inquiète, mange cette glace. Ne laisse rien pour les autres."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5213
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_bd54dcae:

    # jam "What did you think of the surprise?"
    jam "T'as pensé quoi de la surprise ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5214
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_0a9ec317:

    # mc "It was great, but I wish it had lasted longer."
    mc "C'était génial, mais j'aurais aimé que ça dure plus longtemps."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5215
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_7518023c:

    # mc "It felt really short. It was almost like 'I arrive, we chat a bit, she declares herself my wife, and I leave'."
    mc "Ça m'a paru vraiment court. C'était presque genre 'J'arrive, on discute un peu, elle se déclare ma femme, et je me casse'."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5217
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_f3d2e3c2:

    # mc "Rinse and repeat. The details are getting mixed up in my head."
    mc "On rince et on recommence. Les détails s'embrouillent dans ma tête."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5219
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_cc647c02:

    # jam "We couldn't drag it out any longer, or the welcome party would have never started."
    jam "On ne pouvait pas faire traîner ça plus longtemps, ou la fête de bienvenue n'aurait jamais commencé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5220
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_389bdd7f:

    # jam "And my mom and [meg] had to go to work."
    jam "Et ma mère et [meg] devaient aller travailler."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5221
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_ff76f0a5:

    # mc "I understand why it had to be like this, and I love that it happened."
    mc "Je comprends pourquoi ça devait se passer comme ça, et j'adore que ça soit arrivé."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5222
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_634bad2c:

    # mc "But maybe I would have planned it differently, if I had known."
    mc "Mais j'aurais peut-être planifié ça différemment, si j'avais su."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5224
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_cec3681c:

    # jam "I know how you would have planned it, and it was impossible."
    jam "Je sais comment tu l'aurais planifié, et c'était impossible."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5225
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_b0063c8f:

    # mc "*Laugh* Enlighten me on what your crystal ball has told you about my plans."
    mc "*Rire* Éclaire-moi sur ce que ta boule de cristal t'a dit de mes plans."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5228
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_630225c5:

    # jam "You would have wanted to dedicate a whole day to the wedding."
    jam "Tu aurais voulu consacrer une journée entière au mariage."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5230
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_3c913141:

    # jam "You would have wanted to dedicate a whole day to each of the weddings."
    jam "Tu aurais voulu consacrer une journée entière à chacun des mariages."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5231
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_8b455716:

    # mc "It's the logical thing, and the least we should have done."
    mc "C'est la chose logique à faire, et le minimum qu'on aurait dû faire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5233
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_53c4bcff:

    # jam "But you're leaving in two days. There wouldn't have been time to organize it."
    jam "Mais tu pars dans deux jours. Il n'y aurait pas eu le temps de l'organiser."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5236
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_304c8369:

    # jam "Nor time to do it. [bodas] weddings in two days and also prepare for the trip?"
    jam "Ni le temps de le faire. [bodas] mariages en deux jours et aussi préparer le voyage ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5237
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e7ca75d5:

    # jam "Besides, who would you marry first? Which of your girls gets a painful death because you chose her first?"
    jam "En plus, avec qui tu te marierais en premier ? Laquelle de tes meufs aura droit à une mort douloureuse parce que tu l'as choisie en premier ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5238
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_f3684faa:

    # jam "And they would all want to be at every wedding, and today was the only day everyone had some free time."
    jam "Et elles voudraient toutes être à chaque mariage, et aujourd'hui c'était le seul jour où tout le monde avait du temps libre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5239
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_163807c1:

    # mc "You're right... And I'm not buying you a T-shirt that says you're always right. That one is for me."
    mc "T'as raison... Et je vais pas t'acheter un t-shirt qui dit que t'as toujours raison. Celui-là, il est pour moi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5241
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_fe8f75a8:

    # jam "*Laugh* I don't need a T-shirt. This adorable face says everything that needs to be said."
    jam "*Rires* J'ai pas besoin d'un t-shirt. Cette bouille adorable dit tout ce qu'il y a à dire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5242
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_288886f6:

    # mc "*Laugh* What that face says is that you're a glutton who left me without dinner."
    mc "*Rires* Ce que cette bouille dit, c'est que t'es un gros morfale qui m'a laissé sans dîner."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5245
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_ea732095:

    # jam "*Laugh* At least you won't need energy for the wedding night."
    jam "*Rires* Au moins, t'auras pas besoin d'énergie pour la nuit de noces."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5246
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_ce705018:

    # mc "What? Why?"
    mc "Quoi ? Pourquoi ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5250
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_aa589089:

    # jam "*Laugh* Because she went to work, idiot!"
    jam "*Rires* Parce qu'elle est partie bosser, idiot !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5255
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_34cc9c0a:

    # jam "*Laugh* Because they went to work, idiot!"
    jam "*Rires* Parce qu'elles sont parties bosser, idiot !"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5257
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_169ec70c:

    # jam "One went to work, and the other..."
    jam "L'une est partie bosser, et l'autre..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5263
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_de82ed41:

    # jam "*Laugh* Because they went to work, idiot! And the other..."
    jam "*Rire* Parce qu'elles sont allées bosser, idiot ! Et l'autre..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5271
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_f050aa61:

    # jam "*Laugh* Well, you're going to need energy for the wedding night."
    jam "*Rire* Eh bien, tu vas avoir besoin d'énergie pour la nuit de noces."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5272
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a3d06657:

    # mc "Did you guys plan my wedding night too?"
    mc "Vous avez aussi prévu ma nuit de noces ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5274
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_9194d9f1:

    # mc "I wouldn't know who to choose. Whoever wasn't chosen might feel bad."
    mc "Je ne saurais pas qui choisir. Celle qui ne serait pas choisie pourrait se sentir mal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5276
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_8f4c1f2c:

    # jam "There was only one good option for today, and don't make me say who it is if you can't figure it out."
    jam "Il n'y avait qu'une seule bonne option pour aujourd'hui, et ne m'oblige pas à dire qui c'est si tu n'arrives pas à deviner."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5277
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_3edf8d8c:

    # jam "All your wives have agreed on it, so you don't have to worry."
    jam "Toutes tes femmes se sont mises d'accord là-dessus, alors tu n'as pas à t'en faire."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5280
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_81d7c3a8:

    # jam "Do you have something better to do?"
    jam "Tu as quelque chose de mieux à faire ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5281
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_c764ffcb:

    # mc "I'm going to regret saying this, but you're right once again."
    mc "Je vais regretter de dire ça, mais tu as encore raison."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5284
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_0602b6a1:

    # jam "By the way, I'm very disappointed."
    jam "Au fait, je suis très déçu."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5285
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_54b31be8:

    # mc "Why? What have I done now?"
    mc "Pourquoi ? Qu'est-ce que j'ai encore fait ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5286
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_8bc53f60:

    # jam "It's not with you. [eil] promised me I could officiate your wedding when we were in high school."
    jam "Ce n'est pas contre toi. [eil] m'avait promis que je pourrais officier à ton mariage quand on était au lycée."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5287
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_62ab734c:

    # jam "I even got ordained as a priest by the Unified Church of Lasagna."
    jam "J'ai même été ordonné prêtre par l'Église Unifiée des Lasagnes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5288
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_2cb5870f:

    # mc "*Laugh* We talked about that during our wedding. We were both afraid you'd show up in a robe."
    mc "*Rires* On en a parlé pendant notre mariage. On avait tous les deux peur que tu te pointes en toge."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5289
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_fa2ed4c6:

    # mc "*Laugh* And we were both glad you didn't."
    mc "*Rires* Et on était tous les deux bien contents que tu ne l'aies pas fait."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5291
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e8a830da:

    # jam "You two are terrible friends. I was looking forward to doing it..."
    jam "Vous êtes vraiment des amis de merde. J'avais tellement hâte de le faire..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5292
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e87aba5f:

    # mc "*Laugh* You should see your face right now, you look like a kid throwing a tantrum."
    mc "*Rires* Tu devrais voir ta tête en ce moment, on dirait un gamin qui pique une crise."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5293
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_dc1dad4f:

    # mc "I promise I'll talk to [eil] so you can officiate the vow renewal. But she has to agree."
    mc "Je te promets que je parlerai à [eil] pour que tu puisses officier le renouvellement de nos vœux. Mais il faut qu'elle soit d'accord."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5295
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_c874476a:

    # jam "*Laugh* That works for me. If the redheaded witch doesn't agree, I know secrets I can tell the other girls."
    jam "*Rires* Ça me va. Si la sorcière rousse n'est pas d'accord, je connais des secrets que je peux balancer aux autres filles."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5296
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_1e5fb909:

    # mc "*Laugh* I think you spend too much time with [sai]."
    mc "*Rires* Je crois que tu passes trop de temps avec [sai]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5297
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_acf45809:

    # mc "If I were you, I'd start spending more time with [ama] and [eva], so you have someone to defend you from [eil]'s fury if you try."
    mc "Si j'étais toi, je commencerais à passer plus de temps avec [ama] et [eva], pour avoir quelqu'un pour te défendre de la fureur d'[eil] si tu essaies."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5299
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_6d01a0e2:

    # "You spend a while chatting with Jamaal about the party, about Anthony, about your trip to Aruba, and about a thousand other things."
    "Tu passes un moment à discuter avec Jamaal de la fête, d'Anthony, de ton voyage à Aruba, et d'un millier d'autres choses."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5301
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_2a39fa4a:

    # "Obviously, also about his role as master of ceremonies."
    "Évidemment, aussi de son rôle de maître de cérémonie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5302
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_664b0c48:

    # "He's surprised to have become the most hated guy in the family."
    "Il est surpris d'être devenu le mec le plus détesté de la famille."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5303
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e6abda5d:

    # "Between the conversation and Jamaal gobbling all the food around before you arrived, you don't eat a thing."
    "Entre la conversation et Jamaal qui a englouti toute la bouffe avant ton arrivée, tu ne manges rien."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5305
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a7fcc991:

    # oma "*Laugh* I'm here to arrest you, [mc]."
    oma "*Rire* Je suis là pour t'arrêter, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5306
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_62e576e3:

    # mc "*Laugh* What have I done now? What am I accused of, Officer?"
    mc "*Rire* Qu'est-ce que j'ai encore fait ? De quoi suis-je accusé, officier ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5307
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_ddf8c5b0:

    # oma "*Laugh* Of leaving 20 women unattended. We've already given you some time to eat something. It's time to get back to dancing."
    oma "*Rire* D'avoir laissé 20 femmes sans surveillance. On t'a déjà laissé un peu de temps pour manger un truc. Il est temps de retourner danser."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5309
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_b1475c3e:

    # jam "*Laugh* You heard her. They gave you some time to eat. *Laugh*"
    jam "*Rire* Tu l'as entendue. Elles t'ont laissé un peu de temps pour manger. *Rire*"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5310
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_65254a86:

    # mc "*Laugh* Fucking glutton."
    mc "*Rire* Putain de goinfre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5313
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_77e17875:

    # oma "What was that about?"
    oma "C'était quoi ça ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5314
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_78ac3684:

    # mc "Do you see any food around? You said you gave me time to eat something, but Jamaal finished it all."
    mc "Tu vois de la bouffe dans le coin ? Tu as dit que vous m'aviez laissé le temps de manger un truc, mais Jamaal a tout fini."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5316
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_97c6b9d1:

    # oma "I hadn't noticed. We kidnapped you to dance with you and haven't given you time to eat until now."
    oma "Je n'avais pas remarqué. On t'a kidnappé pour danser avec toi et on ne t'avait pas laissé le temps de manger jusqu'à maintenant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5317
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_f0fcce10:

    # oma "We've been grabbing bites between dances with you."
    oma "On a grignoté entre deux danses avec toi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5318
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_16dd2b81:

    # mc "*Laugh* You should ask Jamaal to dance when there's food around. That way he'd leave some for the rest of us."
    mc "*Rire* Tu devrais inviter Jamaal à danser quand il y a de la bouffe dans le coin. Comme ça, il en laisserait pour les autres."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5320
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_81a991d6:

    # oma "*Laugh* He'd probably bite our hand off if we pulled him away from the food."
    oma "*Rire* Il nous arracherait sûrement la main si on l'éloignait de la nourriture."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5321
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_2f8b7a81:

    # oma "But don't worry. When this dance is over, I'll go with one of the girls to make you something to eat."
    oma "Mais ne t'en fais pas. Quand cette danse sera terminée, j'irai avec une des filles te préparer un truc à manger."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5322
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_62d43dfd:

    # mc "*Laugh* There's no need, really. I can eat some fruit or something from the fridge."
    mc "*Rire* Ce n'est pas la peine, vraiment. Je peux manger un fruit ou un truc du frigo."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5324
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_40eebeba:

    # oma "Well, you're almost doing me a favor. I wouldn't dare cook in this dress. [nor] lent it to me and I wouldn't want to stain it."
    oma "Eh bien, tu me rends presque service. Je n'oserais pas cuisiner dans cette robe. [nor] me l'a prêtée et je ne voudrais pas la tacher."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5325
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_1f3a1424:

    # mc "You look gorgeous in it."
    mc "Tu es magnifique dedans."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5327
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_aa7a8aa1:

    # oma "I didn't have a white dress and, even though our wedding was short, I wanted to wear white for today."
    oma "Je n'avais pas de robe blanche et, même si notre mariage a été court, je voulais porter du blanc aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5329
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_bb4ade43:

    # mc "Not all of you chose to wear white today."
    mc "Vous n'avez pas toutes choisi de porter du blanc aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5331
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_8e534b1f:

    # oma "Well, some of us are more traditional than others. Even if the wedding wasn't too traditional."
    oma "Eh bien, certaines d'entre nous sont plus traditionnelles que d'autres. Même si le mariage n'était pas très traditionnel."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5339
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_1596677b:

    # oma "And then you have [personaje], who literally dressed as a bride."
    oma "Et puis tu as [personaje], qui s'est littéralement habillée en mariée."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5340
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_084ff1ca:

    # oma "And now it's time for you to dance with someone else. I think the rest of the girls are looking at me like wolves waiting for their share of [mc]."
    oma "Et maintenant, il est temps pour toi de danser avec quelqu'un d'autre. Je crois que le reste des filles me regardent comme des louves qui attendent leur part de [mc]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5342
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_f8272697:

    # "You go back to dancing with the women who are still at home and spend the rest of the evening going from the arms of one to the arms of another."
    "Tu retournes danser avec les femmes qui sont encore à la maison et passes le reste de la soirée à aller des bras de l'une aux bras d'une autre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5343
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_2e6dbe46:

    # "Exhaustion begins to take its toll on all of you, and each girl tells you that it's the last time she'll dance with you and that they're going to let you rest."
    "L'épuisement commence à se faire sentir pour vous tous, et chaque fille te dit que c'est la dernière fois qu'elle danse avec toi et qu'elles vont te laisser te reposer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5344
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_f75158f5:

    # "None of them keep their word and you find them in your arms again after an hour or so."
    "Aucune d'entre elles ne tient parole et tu les retrouves dans tes bras une heure plus tard environ."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5345
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_2121e8d7:

    # "20 women. 20 songs. And start all over again."
    "20 femmes. 20 chansons. Et on recommence."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5347
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_ff28e007:

    # "When it gets late, the goodbyes begin for the girls who are leaving."
    "Quand il se fait tard, les au revoir commencent pour les filles qui partent."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5348
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_eedda809:

    # "[oma] takes Jamaal, [sim] and [mad.nick] home. All four of them have to work tomorrow and the big eater has to get up early."
    "[oma] ramène Jamaal, [sim] et [mad.nick] à la maison. Tous les quatre doivent travailler demain et la grosse mangeuse doit se lever tôt."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5349
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e0b17834:

    # "[ama] and [eva] don't leave the house. They're going to sleep with [mee] and [bet] respectively."
    "[ama] et [eva] ne quittent pas la maison. Elles vont dormir avec [mee] et [bet] respectivement."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5351
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_83ef3118:

    # "After helping clean up [nor]'s kitchen, you go up to your room."
    "Après avoir aidé à nettoyer la cuisine de [nor], tu montes dans ta chambre."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5352
translate french c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_86326168:

    # "It's been an amazing day."
    "Ça a été une journée incroyable."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5356
translate french c30s007_KatConv_aeca0d27:

    # "After a while..."
    "Après un moment..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5357
translate french c30s007_KatConv_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Toc-Toc*"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5358
translate french c30s007_KatConv_d184b98b:

    # kat "*Through the door* Can I come in? I'm bringing food."
    kat "*À travers la porte* Je peux entrer ? J'apporte à manger."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5359
translate french c30s007_KatConv_36c3b34c:

    # mc "*Laugh* Come in, [kat]."
    mc "*Rire* Entre, [kat]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5369
translate french c30s007_KatConv_8bd819eb:

    # kat "I was told Jamaal left you without dinner... Or between Jamaal and us."
    kat "On m'a dit que Jamaal t'avait laissé sans dîner... Ou entre Jamaal et nous."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5370
translate french c30s007_KatConv_f122747e:

    # kat "I made you some waffles. I didn't know if you liked them with whipped cream or chocolate, so I brought both."
    kat "Je t'ai fait des gaufres. Je ne savais pas si tu les aimais avec de la chantilly ou du chocolat, alors j'ai apporté les deux."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5372
translate french c30s007_KatConv_e2445707:

    # kat "I can't let my husband go hungry, can I?"
    kat "Je ne peux pas laisser mon mari mourir de faim, n'est-ce pas ?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5373
translate french c30s007_KatConv_9d5c2504:

    # mc "I think, right now, the only waffle I'm hungry for is the one tattooed on your shoulder."
    mc "Je crois que là, tout de suite, la seule gaufre qui me donne faim, c'est celle tatouée sur ton épaule."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5374
translate french c30s007_KatConv_2cad9834:

    # kat "*Giggles* The waffle is close enough to my neck... That makes that proposal VERY tempting."
    kat "*Glousse* La gaufre est assez près de mon cou... Ça rend cette proposition TRÈS tentante."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5376
translate french c30s007_KatConv_6ae1ee9d:

    # mc "Thank you, [kat]."
    mc "Merci, [kat]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5377
translate french c30s007_KatConv_5b187f57:

    # kat "I'll let you eat them before they get cold, and I'm going to bed. Goodnight."
    kat "Je te laisse les manger avant qu'elles ne refroidissent, et je vais me coucher. Bonne nuit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5378
translate french c30s007_KatConv_5b62e19a:

    # mc "Goodnight, [kat]."
    mc "Bonne nuit, [kat]."

